(1330410, 171235, 36235, '<td valign="top">I like the use of black &amp; white.  I think this could have been a great photo for this challenge if the cow (I''m guessing it''s a cow) in the foreground wasn''t there.  I love how the sun hitting the cow in the background makes it stand out so much from the rest of the landscape, but the cow in the foreground fights with the other cow for being the strong point in the image.</td>', 'I like the use of black & white.  I think this could have been a great photo for this challenge if the cow (I''m guessing it''s a cow) in the foreground wasn''t there.  I love how the sun hitting the cow in the background makes it stand out so much from the rest of the landscape, but the cow in the foreground fights with the other cow for being the strong point in the image.', '2005-04-27 01:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330411, 171278, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I like black/white abstract.  Well done</td>', 'Nice!  I like black/white abstract.  Well done', '2005-04-27 01:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330414, 170971, 36235, '<td valign="top">Great colors and concept, but photo probably taken at wrong time during the day.  Sunlight is way too strong, especially reflecting off the water.</td>', 'Great colors and concept, but photo probably taken at wrong time during the day.  Sunlight is way too strong, especially reflecting off the water.', '2005-04-27 01:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330417, 171145, 34763, '<td valign="top">grass looks a little oversharp in middle, may be from depth of field. all frog deserve a good stomping.</td>', 'grass looks a little oversharp in middle, may be from depth of field. all frog deserve a good stomping.', '2005-04-27 01:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
