(1330617, 171364, 9668, '<td valign="top">Awsome shot! To bad the sunset didn''t get more colorful. But of course that would make your main subject stand out less, so I guess the way it is now is good =). I know you coudn''t really change this either, but the mark to the right of the rock it a tad annoying.  Great composition on this shot, with the rock in the lower left rule of third, the horizon in the center, and the land mass leading down into the rock. Overall: great job! Where did you get the title?</td>', 'Awsome shot! To bad the sunset didn''t get more colorful. But of course that would make your main subject stand out less, so I guess the way it is now is good =). I know you coudn''t really change this either, but the mark to the right of the rock it a tad annoying.  Great composition on this shot, with the rock in the lower left rule of third, the horizon in the center, and the land mass leading down into the rock. Overall: great job! Where did you get the title?', '2005-04-27 02:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330618, 170802, 36628, '<td valign="top">I just wish the colors were a little more vibrant. Try adjusting the levels/saturation/contrast to get the lemon to really pop out.</td>', 'I just wish the colors were a little more vibrant. Try adjusting the levels/saturation/contrast to get the lemon to really pop out.', '2005-04-27 02:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
