(1330705, 169913, 31399, '<td valign="top">nice shadowS, perhaps turn rose few degrees so that lower petal and lower leaf aren''t both flat and round looking..my mind keeps wanting to see those two things as dots...gl .. 8</td>', 'nice shadowS, perhaps turn rose few degrees so that lower petal and lower leaf aren''t both flat and round looking..my mind keeps wanting to see those two things as dots...gl .. 8', '2005-04-27 02:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
