(1330707, 169325, 36628, '<td valign="top">A little out of focuse, you might also want to try rotating to make the horizon level.</td>', 'A little out of focuse, you might also want to try rotating to make the horizon level.', '2005-04-27 03:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
