(1330711, 170837, 36604, '<td valign="top">The image is fuzzy, there is a halo around the insect, and the water color is sufficiently odd that until checked the title, I thought it might have been some kind of airplane.  The bundle of fuzzy dark grass on the left also distracts more than it adds context.</td>', 'The image is fuzzy, there is a halo around the insect, and the water color is sufficiently odd that until checked the title, I thought it might have been some kind of airplane.  The bundle of fuzzy dark grass on the left also distracts more than it adds context.', '2005-04-27 03:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330715, 171284, 31399, '<td valign="top">i think this would even be good concept with just the hand visible...gl</td>', 'i think this would even be good concept with just the hand visible...gl', '2005-04-27 03:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330716, 169301, 37011, '<td valign="top">Nice one!</td>', 'Nice one!', '2005-04-27 03:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330717, 170846, 36604, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I''m not quite sure what it is (some kind of plant?  partially shredded cat-tail with a metal spike in it?), but that''s offset a bit by the very nice color contrast and texture of the fibers.</td>', 'Very nice.  I''m not quite sure what it is (some kind of plant?  partially shredded cat-tail with a metal spike in it?), but that''s offset a bit by the very nice color contrast and texture of the fibers.', '2005-04-27 03:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330718, 171074, 34763, '<td valign="top">beautiful mountain, lake and trees .... oh after admiring entire beauty I found you.</td>', 'beautiful mountain, lake and trees .... oh after admiring entire beauty I found you.', '2005-04-27 03:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330720, 171202, 31399, '<td valign="top">I find several items of interest in this shot...shine of metals...roughness of wooden tracks...shapes of metal ...</td>', 'I find several items of interest in this shot...shine of metals...roughness of wooden tracks...shapes of metal ...', '2005-04-27 03:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330721, 170503, 36679, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this shot, though, for some reason, I think it would be so much better if we didn''t see the couple. I''d really like it with the bikes alone, begging the question "where are the owners of these bikes?". Still a nice shot and I rate it above average.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this shot, though, for some reason, I think it would be so much better if we didn''t see the couple. I''d really like it with the bikes alone, begging the question "where are the owners of these bikes?". Still a nice shot and I rate it above average.', '2005-04-27 03:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330722, 170275, 36604, '<td valign="top">A somewhat pretty picture, but it has too many potential focal points.  Animal?  House?  Barn?  Field?  Minimalism should be very simple, with the focal point very obvious.  Also, the animal is sufficiently indistinct that I''m not sure what it is.  Young horse?</td>', 'A somewhat pretty picture, but it has too many potential focal points.  Animal?  House?  Barn?  Field?  Minimalism should be very simple, with the focal point very obvious.  Also, the animal is sufficiently indistinct that I''m not sure what it is.  Young horse?', '2005-04-27 03:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330723, 170817, 36679, '<td valign="top">i like the photo but I really don''t like the colours...</td>', 'i like the photo but I really don''t like the colours...', '2005-04-27 03:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330724, 169168, 35827, '<td valign="top">i think the white background is too bright compare to the flowers. but nice simple photo.</td>', 'i think the white background is too bright compare to the flowers. but nice simple photo.', '2005-04-27 03:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330725, 170474, 36679, '<td valign="top">great colours on the plane. If only it was complimented with a beautiful rich blue sky :(</td>', 'great colours on the plane. If only it was complimented with a beautiful rich blue sky :(', '2005-04-27 03:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330726, 171212, 35827, '<td valign="top">the swan seems not in focus enough.</td>', 'the swan seems not in focus enough.', '2005-04-27 03:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330727, 169515, 18552, '<td valign="top">The background with all the cd''s is interesting and colorful but seems much too "busy"  for a minimalistic photo. The iPod on a plain background would have been nice, I think.</td>', 'The background with all the cd''s is interesting and colorful but seems much too "busy"  for a minimalistic photo. The iPod on a plain background would have been nice, I think.', '2005-04-27 03:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330728, 170157, 36604, '<td valign="top">Pretty and elegant, but I find the lone-item-on-field-of-black to be unimaginative and boring.</td>', 'Pretty and elegant, but I find the lone-item-on-field-of-black to be unimaginative and boring.', '2005-04-27 03:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330732, 170807, 31213, '<td valign="top">Wish you could spot edit in theis challenge!  Way cool.  Sharp eye you have for finding this.  Nice colors in your background.  Nice use of negative space.</td>', 'Wish you could spot edit in theis challenge!  Way cool.  Sharp eye you have for finding this.  Nice colors in your background.  Nice use of negative space.', '2005-04-27 03:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330735, 171351, 18552, '<td valign="top">I really like the minimalism of the picture. The yellow and red border just doesn''t seem to match the mood of the picture.</td>', 'I really like the minimalism of the picture. The yellow and red border just doesn''t seem to match the mood of the picture.', '2005-04-27 03:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330736, 171134, 36604, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  I could wish for a bit more color on the snail shell to liven it up, but at least the shadow gives some meaning to the the pure-color background.  I wish it hadn''t been pure white, though, since the result is harsh on the eyes and hard to look at.  Next time snail on parchment?</td>', 'Not bad.  I could wish for a bit more color on the snail shell to liven it up, but at least the shadow gives some meaning to the the pure-color background.  I wish it hadn''t been pure white, though, since the result is harsh on the eyes and hard to look at.  Next time snail on parchment?', '2005-04-27 03:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330738, 170270, 36604, '<td valign="top">Hah, okay, cute and somewhat funny.  The multiple oblique angles add to the effect.  Blown highlights behind the squirrel are hard on the eyes and distracting, however.</td>', 'Hah, okay, cute and somewhat funny.  The multiple oblique angles add to the effect.  Blown highlights behind the squirrel are hard on the eyes and distracting, however.', '2005-04-27 03:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
