(1330744, 169187, 36604, '<td valign="top">Elegant, and a nice use of black and white for effect.  Unfortunately, I''m holding the topic of Minimalism to mean that there really should be a single, obvious point of focus, and since my eye was drawn first to the plant before I realized you meant the focus to be the moon, I''m docking points accordingly.  Also, the noise is odd and irregular, leaving a couple dark specks in the center I *think* are noise, but am not sure, and the edge of the moon is ragged from it as well.</td>', 'Elegant, and a nice use of black and white for effect.  Unfortunately, I''m holding the topic of Minimalism to mean that there really should be a single, obvious point of focus, and since my eye was drawn first to the plant before I realized you meant the focus to be the moon, I''m docking points accordingly.  Also, the noise is odd and irregular, leaving a couple dark specks in the center I *think* are noise, but am not sure, and the edge of the moon is ragged from it as well.', '2005-04-27 03:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
