(1330816, 171267, 36604, '<td valign="top">My second snail-on-blank shot seen tonight.  Yours has the advantage of being on blue, which is less harsh on the eyes and slightly more interesting than white, but has absolutely nothing else of interest, whereas the other one had at least an interesting shadow.  There is also a visible halo around the snail, which is distracting.</td>', 'My second snail-on-blank shot seen tonight.  Yours has the advantage of being on blue, which is less harsh on the eyes and slightly more interesting than white, but has absolutely nothing else of interest, whereas the other one had at least an interesting shadow.  There is also a visible halo around the snail, which is distracting.', '2005-04-27 03:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
