(1330825, 170314, 36604, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept.  The fading color of the background offsets the tedium, and the hand in the reflection draws the eye.  My only real complaint is that the reflected highlights are distracting and make the reflected hand a little hard to look at.</td>', 'An interesting concept.  The fading color of the background offsets the tedium, and the hand in the reflection draws the eye.  My only real complaint is that the reflected highlights are distracting and make the reflected hand a little hard to look at.', '2005-04-27 03:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
