(1330831, 171365, 36604, '<td valign="top">Although this doesn''t really meet the challenge description (small area), it does meet the classic definition of minimalism, so I''m not docking points for that.  However, the white is harsh and glaring, causing the wheel to become indistinct on the right side and hurting the eyes, and the skateboard seems slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Although this doesn''t really meet the challenge description (small area), it does meet the classic definition of minimalism, so I''m not docking points for that.  However, the white is harsh and glaring, causing the wheel to become indistinct on the right side and hurting the eyes, and the skateboard seems slightly out of focus.', '2005-04-27 03:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330832, 171341, 36679, '<td valign="top">As much as I love this photo, I have to say that I think it fails in the "minimalism" sense because the clouds in the sky and the light coming from behind the tree and the fence are all such prominent parts of the scene. The whole thing is superbly composed and captured.  Good job.</td>', 'As much as I love this photo, I have to say that I think it fails in the "minimalism" sense because the clouds in the sky and the light coming from behind the tree and the fence are all such prominent parts of the scene. The whole thing is superbly composed and captured.  Good job.', '2005-04-27 03:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330833, 169440, 11078, '<td valign="top">I like this so colourful and basic works well</td>', 'I like this so colourful and basic works well', '2005-04-27 03:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330838, 171342, 11078, '<td valign="top">beautiful image well done</td>', 'beautiful image well done', '2005-04-27 03:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330839, 170476, 36604, '<td valign="top">Very elegant, minimalist, on a background with an interesting texture.  I''m not all that far into scoring yet, but it''s the best I''ve seen so far.  The level of brightness is exactly correct, and the older style of the keys makes the subject interesting.</td>', 'Very elegant, minimalist, on a background with an interesting texture.  I''m not all that far into scoring yet, but it''s the best I''ve seen so far.  The level of brightness is exactly correct, and the older style of the keys makes the subject interesting.', '2005-04-27 03:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
