(1330854, 169355, 36679, '<td valign="top">Stunning colour. Good subject placement. Great capture.</td>', 'Stunning colour. Good subject placement. Great capture.', '2005-04-27 03:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330855, 169817, 35169, '<td valign="top">In minimalism; the subject should consume only a small portion (how much is debateable) of the overall image.  If the puzzle piece were in focus and the rest of the puzzel burred or background to the piece, that would be minimalism.</td>', 'In minimalism; the subject should consume only a small portion (how much is debateable) of the overall image.  If the puzzle piece were in focus and the rest of the puzzel burred or background to the piece, that would be minimalism.', '2005-04-27 03:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330857, 170479, 11078, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-04-27 03:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330858, 170429, 36604, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject, and I like the way the water blends into nothingness.  Unfortunately, I really can''t stand pure bright backgrounds, since they''re very hard on my eyes.</td>', 'An interesting subject, and I like the way the water blends into nothingness.  Unfortunately, I really can''t stand pure bright backgrounds, since they''re very hard on my eyes.', '2005-04-27 03:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330860, 171333, 11078, '<td valign="top">nice sky</td>', 'nice sky', '2005-04-27 03:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330863, 169266, 11078, '<td valign="top">seems a bit out of focus nice scene though</td>', 'seems a bit out of focus nice scene though', '2005-04-27 03:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330867, 168807, 36604, '<td valign="top">There seem to be two subjects in this, both fuzzy, and minimalism really calls for the eye to be drawn to a distinct subject.  The colors are pretty, but the sky is hazy.  Increasing contrast a little might have helped.</td>', 'There seem to be two subjects in this, both fuzzy, and minimalism really calls for the eye to be drawn to a distinct subject.  The colors are pretty, but the sky is hazy.  Increasing contrast a little might have helped.', '2005-04-27 03:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330868, 171070, 21716, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot!!</td>', 'Really cool shot!!', '2005-04-27 03:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330869, 171354, 11078, '<td valign="top">ah cute baby *cuddles from me*</td>', 'ah cute baby *cuddles from me*', '2005-04-27 03:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330870, 171217, 36679, '<td valign="top">I think a few steps forward would be put this shot a few grades higher for me. I think the off-angle road really detracts from an otherwise beautiful shot. The clouds are beautiful and the horizon is nice and level.</td>', 'I think a few steps forward would be put this shot a few grades higher for me. I think the off-angle road really detracts from an otherwise beautiful shot. The clouds are beautiful and the horizon is nice and level.', '2005-04-27 03:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330872, 171348, 11078, '<td valign="top">fits the challenge but seems a bit flat</td>', 'fits the challenge but seems a bit flat', '2005-04-27 03:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330875, 170269, 36679, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. No critique, here.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. No critique, here.', '2005-04-27 03:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330877, 169441, 11078, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus but fits the challenge</td>', 'A little out of focus but fits the challenge', '2005-04-27 03:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330879, 171170, 36604, '<td valign="top">This is almost comic, and the background fails to be monotonous (which is good, what with all the plain color entries).  Color contrast is nice, and the rooster is so sharp and colorful that it actually looks almost like a plastic model.  That actually hurts the image a little -- it doesn''t look real.  Otherwise, the image is excellent.</td>', 'This is almost comic, and the background fails to be monotonous (which is good, what with all the plain color entries).  Color contrast is nice, and the rooster is so sharp and colorful that it actually looks almost like a plastic model.  That actually hurts the image a little -- it doesn''t look real.  Otherwise, the image is excellent.', '2005-04-27 03:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330882, 169656, 11078, '<td valign="top">lovelyimage  I love the green also</td>', 'lovelyimage  I love the green also', '2005-04-27 03:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330883, 170807, 36679, '<td valign="top">Good eye for the little things!</td>', 'Good eye for the little things!', '2005-04-27 03:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330884, 169955, 11078, '<td valign="top">nice tones of colour here good detail</td>', 'nice tones of colour here good detail', '2005-04-27 03:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330889, 171351, 36679, '<td valign="top">I love it when people go the extra bit and take a challenge beyond the literal into the world of word play. Good job with the shot &amp; title. That border looks terrible though, IMO. Disregarding border for grading, though. :)</td>', 'I love it when people go the extra bit and take a challenge beyond the literal into the world of word play. Good job with the shot & title. That border looks terrible though, IMO. Disregarding border for grading, though. :)', '2005-04-27 03:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330893, 169135, 11078, '<td valign="top">wonderful one of the best so far</td>', 'wonderful one of the best so far', '2005-04-27 03:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330894, 169440, 34547, '<td valign="top">Neat colors. How''d you make ''em?</td>', 'Neat colors. How''d you make ''em?', '2005-04-27 03:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330895, 169445, 35169, '<td valign="top">This was taken with flash on camera... you need a more powerful flash or a diffuser for the one you have .  A contrasting background will set the subject apart.  bring the subject a couple feet in front of the wall and shoot evenly  across the wall not to an angle which is why the drop off on the flash is so apparent.</td>', 'This was taken with flash on camera... you need a more powerful flash or a diffuser for the one you have .  A contrasting background will set the subject apart.  bring the subject a couple feet in front of the wall and shoot evenly  across the wall not to an angle which is why the drop off on the flash is so apparent.', '2005-04-27 03:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330897, 171279, 11078, '<td valign="top">seems very blurred to me</td>', 'seems very blurred to me', '2005-04-27 03:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330898, 171259, 36604, '<td valign="top">I''ve been scoring negatively for having multiple points of focus, but in this case, it seems to work, as I can see all six objects as a clipping of a single item somehow.  I''m not sure *why* it works for me, though.  My reasoning seems arbitrary even to me, but it''s working in your favor so I guess you won''t complain. :)<br/> <br/>A couple bonus points for being interesting, but minus one for the slight halos around the trees. 6.  The image doesn''t really grab me, though, so no higher.</td>', 'I''ve been scoring negatively for having multiple points of focus, but in this case, it seems to work, as I can see all six objects as a clipping of a single item somehow.  I''m not sure *why* it works for me, though.  My reasoning seems arbitrary even to me, but it''s working in your favor so I guess you won''t complain. :) A couple bonus points for being interesting, but minus one for the slight halos around the trees. 6.  The image doesn''t really grab me, though, so no higher.', '2005-04-27 03:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330901, 171085, 36679, '<td valign="top">The backdrop is too distracting.. I had to search for the subject. While I understand the effect you were going for, I think that if the image doesn''t naturally draw my eye to the subject, and I have to search, then it doesn''t hold my interest.</td>', 'The backdrop is too distracting.. I had to search for the subject. While I understand the effect you were going for, I think that if the image doesn''t naturally draw my eye to the subject, and I have to search, then it doesn''t hold my interest.', '2005-04-27 03:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330902, 169385, 34547, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is what I call minimal.</td>', 'Now THAT is what I call minimal.', '2005-04-27 03:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330903, 169817, 24784, '<td valign="top">barrel effekt from the lens</td>', 'barrel effekt from the lens', '2005-04-27 03:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330904, 171261, 36679, '<td valign="top">Light boxes are a blessing to play with. Even the most bizarre, inane subjects look interesting in a lightbox. :)</td>', 'Light boxes are a blessing to play with. Even the most bizarre, inane subjects look interesting in a lightbox. :)', '2005-04-27 03:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330906, 169348, 21716, '<td valign="top">not sure how this fits the challenge. . .</td>', 'not sure how this fits the challenge. . .', '2005-04-27 03:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330907, 171085, 34547, '<td valign="top">...and I almost missed it.</td>', '...and I almost missed it.', '2005-04-27 03:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330910, 171366, 36679, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t get any more minimalist than not having any subject whatsoever. :P</td>', 'It doesn''t get any more minimalist than not having any subject whatsoever. :P', '2005-04-27 03:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330911, 169445, 36679, '<td valign="top">The strong flash shadow pins the subject against the backdrop in an unusually pleasing way.</td>', 'The strong flash shadow pins the subject against the backdrop in an unusually pleasing way.', '2005-04-27 03:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330912, 170484, 36604, '<td valign="top">Eek.  Blown highlights all throughout the sky, hurting the eyes and drawing the eye away from the tree into the pure white glare behind it.  The wide open space of dull brown sand on the left also fades into some very fuzzy vegetation, which isn''t very attractive.<br/> <br/>The only positive point is that the colors in the sky on the right are absolutely gorgeous.  If you had framed this vertically around the tree, giving it more textured earth below and more dark cloud above, cropping tightly left and right,  it would have been much better, avoiding much of the blown white on the left.</td>', 'Eek.  Blown highlights all throughout the sky, hurting the eyes and drawing the eye away from the tree into the pure white glare behind it.  The wide open space of dull brown sand on the left also fades into some very fuzzy vegetation, which isn''t very attractive. The only positive point is that the colors in the sky on the right are absolutely gorgeous.  If you had framed this vertically around the tree, giving it more textured earth below and more dark cloud above, cropping tightly left and right,  it would have been much better, avoiding much of the blown white on the left.', '2005-04-27 03:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330913, 170604, 24983, '<td valign="top">I think that this would work better as a panoramic, crop tight but an 8anyway</td>', 'I think that this would work better as a panoramic, crop tight but an 8anyway', '2005-04-27 03:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330915, 171220, 24983, '<td valign="top">good idea but subject is too centred IMO 8</td>', 'good idea but subject is too centred IMO 8', '2005-04-27 03:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330916, 170633, 36679, '<td valign="top">Ah, if only the power line didn''t cross through the frame. Nice shot.</td>', 'Ah, if only the power line didn''t cross through the frame. Nice shot.', '2005-04-27 03:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330917, 170550, 24983, '<td valign="top">I like this very expresive 8</td>', 'I like this very expresive 8', '2005-04-27 03:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330918, 171300, 36604, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant, colorful, and the background has just enough texture and shadow to keep it from being monotonous.  I find myself vaguely craving a slice of radish, and I don''t even like radishes.  The noise/grain works well for you, here.<br/> <br/>You''ll probably get docked for filling over a quarter of the space, but it meets the classic definition of minimalism, if not the contest description, so I''m not docking anything for that.  It''s not quite as evocative as the best image I''ve seen so far, against which I''m measuring my 10s, so this gets a 9.</td>', 'Simple, elegant, colorful, and the background has just enough texture and shadow to keep it from being monotonous.  I find myself vaguely craving a slice of radish, and I don''t even like radishes.  The noise/grain works well for you, here. You''ll probably get docked for filling over a quarter of the space, but it meets the classic definition of minimalism, if not the contest description, so I''m not docking anything for that.  It''s not quite as evocative as the best image I''ve seen so far, against which I''m measuring my 10s, so this gets a 9.', '2005-04-27 03:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330919, 171305, 36604, '<td valign="top">Nice color and texture on the button, and the texture in the background keeps it from being too tedious.  I wish you had chosen a color less bright, though, as looking at all that bright red is hurting my eyes.  If you had done this on forest green, it might have been a 9.  As it is, 7.</td>', 'Nice color and texture on the button, and the texture in the background keeps it from being too tedious.  I wish you had chosen a color less bright, though, as looking at all that bright red is hurting my eyes.  If you had done this on forest green, it might have been a 9.  As it is, 7.', '2005-04-27 03:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330920, 169355, 31399, '<td valign="top">yep...i like it..photography is good...colors are great...10</td>', 'yep...i like it..photography is good...colors are great...10', '2005-04-27 03:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330921, 171243, 36604, '<td valign="top">The tree is sharp, which is good, but the sky is bright, hard on the eyes, and lacks color.  I recommend strongly boosting contrast to bring out the blue.  The curved ground is nice, remniscent of a tree on a very, very, very small planet. :)</td>', 'The tree is sharp, which is good, but the sky is bright, hard on the eyes, and lacks color.  I recommend strongly boosting contrast to bring out the blue.  The curved ground is nice, remniscent of a tree on a very, very, very small planet. :)', '2005-04-27 03:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330922, 170802, 34547, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a bit more lemon.</td>', 'I''d like to see a bit more lemon.', '2005-04-27 03:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330923, 170322, 36604, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and reflection in the water.  My only nit is that the duck looks slightly plastic somehow.  9.</td>', 'Very nice color and reflection in the water.  My only nit is that the duck looks slightly plastic somehow.  9.', '2005-04-27 03:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330927, 170501, 31399, '<td valign="top">gray area upper left ... 8..gl</td>', 'gray area upper left ... 8..gl', '2005-04-27 03:57:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1330928, 171051, 21716, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but I don''t think the sun is what catches your attention-mostly I was trying to figure out what the other stuff is.</td>', 'I like the shot, but I don''t think the sun is what catches your attention-mostly I was trying to figure out what the other stuff is.', '2005-04-27 03:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330930, 169441, 21716, '<td valign="top">Glare on the ladybug is a bit distracting</td>', 'Glare on the ladybug is a bit distracting', '2005-04-27 03:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330931, 170784, 36604, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what the background is, but it''s very pretty.  The butterfly seems defective, missing the bulb on the left antenna, but otherwise makes a nice subject.  The bright white light underneath is harsh, though.</td>', 'I have no idea what the background is, but it''s very pretty.  The butterfly seems defective, missing the bulb on the left antenna, but otherwise makes a nice subject.  The bright white light underneath is harsh, though.', '2005-04-27 03:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330933, 170809, 31399, '<td valign="top">lovely colors and tranquil feeling...gl  8</td>', 'lovely colors and tranquil feeling...gl  8', '2005-04-27 03:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330934, 170712, 34547, '<td valign="top">I don''t like whatever is going on in the green area. What''s happening there? It might be a neat texture. I just can''t tell.</td>', 'I don''t like whatever is going on in the green area. What''s happening there? It might be a neat texture. I just can''t tell.', '2005-04-27 03:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330935, 171194, 22479, '<td valign="top">Sharp, focused, good DOF, and clean processing without distracting artifacts. Appears to be a rather simple profile shot but in this particular challenge, simplicity is a bonus.</td>', 'Sharp, focused, good DOF, and clean processing without distracting artifacts. Appears to be a rather simple profile shot but in this particular challenge, simplicity is a bonus.', '2005-04-27 03:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330936, 170980, 21716, '<td valign="top">Very disturbing image, but I like it.  The blurry guy in the background is freaky</td>', 'Very disturbing image, but I like it.  The blurry guy in the background is freaky', '2005-04-27 03:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330938, 169522, 36604, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what I''m looking at here, or what the object of focus of the image is supposed to be.  That entire thing is a knife?  What''s on the blade?<br/> <br/>I do like the way the background is slightly textured to keep it from being tedious.</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what I''m looking at here, or what the object of focus of the image is supposed to be.  That entire thing is a knife?  What''s on the blade? I do like the way the background is slightly textured to keep it from being tedious.', '2005-04-27 03:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330939, 169781, 31399, '<td valign="top">would have loved to see the bird not centered in frame...in left or right third, perhaps? very nice reflection.. 7</td>', 'would have loved to see the bird not centered in frame...in left or right third, perhaps? very nice reflection.. 7', '2005-04-27 03:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330941, 171363, 21716, '<td valign="top">Love it!!</td>', 'Love it!!', '2005-04-27 03:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330942, 171346, 36679, '<td valign="top">nice landscape!. quite a bit going on for a minimalist challenge, but i love it anyways.</td>', 'nice landscape!. quite a bit going on for a minimalist challenge, but i love it anyways.', '2005-04-27 03:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330944, 169751, 22479, '<td valign="top">Hatched pattern on the field is quite visually interesting and distinctive. Just enough detail on the ball player. Very good entry for this challenge.</td>', 'Hatched pattern on the field is quite visually interesting and distinctive. Just enough detail on the ball player. Very good entry for this challenge.', '2005-04-27 04:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330945, 169978, 34547, '<td valign="top">What a nice shade of gray(?)</td>', 'What a nice shade of gray(?)', '2005-04-27 04:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330947, 171064, 21716, '<td valign="top">Wow, he must have stood for quite a while to let the water settle down!</td>', 'Wow, he must have stood for quite a while to let the water settle down!', '2005-04-27 04:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330948, 170867, 36604, '<td valign="top">The title and the necking birds make a cute combination.  The tree breaks up the monotony without drawing the eye too much or being too distracting, which is good.  The overall effect is good, but not really spectacular, though there''s nothing technically wrong that I can point to.  8.</td>', 'The title and the necking birds make a cute combination.  The tree breaks up the monotony without drawing the eye too much or being too distracting, which is good.  The overall effect is good, but not really spectacular, though there''s nothing technically wrong that I can point to.  8.', '2005-04-27 04:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330949, 170269, 34547, '<td valign="top">Marvelous. Made my favorites.</td>', 'Marvelous. Made my favorites.', '2005-04-27 04:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330950, 169955, 36604, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and lighting, and the background is interesting without being distracting.</td>', 'Very nice color and lighting, and the background is interesting without being distracting.', '2005-04-27 04:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330951, 168831, 22479, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy but not distractingly so. I wish the sky was a bit more interesting. However, the gradient of hues suffices.<br/> <br/>Overall a good entry for this challenge.</td>', 'A bit grainy but not distractingly so. I wish the sky was a bit more interesting. However, the gradient of hues suffices. Overall a good entry for this challenge.', '2005-04-27 04:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330952, 169602, 36604, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color.  The bright red umbrella against the desaturated sky and ocean really catches the eye, and the red sands break the tedium.</td>', 'Nice use of color.  The bright red umbrella against the desaturated sky and ocean really catches the eye, and the red sands break the tedium.', '2005-04-27 04:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330953, 170494, 21716, '<td valign="top">Good one</td>', 'Good one', '2005-04-27 04:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330955, 170699, 36604, '<td valign="top">Cute, and almost funny.  The bright white backdrop hurts my eyes, though, and the tedium is broken only by the upper left hand corner.  Adding something to break up the background (even blue lines from school paper) would have helped.</td>', 'Cute, and almost funny.  The bright white backdrop hurts my eyes, though, and the tedium is broken only by the upper left hand corner.  Adding something to break up the background (even blue lines from school paper) would have helped.', '2005-04-27 04:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330956, 171262, 34547, '<td valign="top">One of the better perspectives on one of these.</td>', 'One of the better perspectives on one of these.', '2005-04-27 04:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330958, 171145, 21716, '<td valign="top">Love it!!</td>', 'Love it!!', '2005-04-27 04:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330959, 171342, 22479, '<td valign="top">Solitary trees seem to be a popular topic. I like the moody sky and the overall color saturation. Good detail and sharpness. Overall well done!</td>', 'Solitary trees seem to be a popular topic. I like the moody sky and the overall color saturation. Good detail and sharpness. Overall well done!', '2005-04-27 04:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330960, 171091, 36604, '<td valign="top">Nice background color.  The silhouette works, but isn''t really evocative.</td>', 'Nice background color.  The silhouette works, but isn''t really evocative.', '2005-04-27 04:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330964, 170564, 36604, '<td valign="top">If that''s supposed to be a crystal marble, I think you got ripped off.  The light from it is dull, making it look like tarnished glass, plastic, or resin.  The texture of the stone is nice, as is the shadow, and the red... something... adds an interesting note to the subject.</td>', 'If that''s supposed to be a crystal marble, I think you got ripped off.  The light from it is dull, making it look like tarnished glass, plastic, or resin.  The texture of the stone is nice, as is the shadow, and the red... something... adds an interesting note to the subject.', '2005-04-27 04:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330965, 170781, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nicely presented with choice of DOF and angle. Leaves the possibilities of what this might be to the interpretation of the viewer.</td>', 'Nicely presented with choice of DOF and angle. Leaves the possibilities of what this might be to the interpretation of the viewer.', '2005-04-27 04:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330966, 169398, 21716, '<td valign="top">nice contrast but the blue looks oversaturated or unnatural or something. . .Looks like a plastic flower.</td>', 'nice contrast but the blue looks oversaturated or unnatural or something. . .Looks like a plastic flower.', '2005-04-27 04:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330968, 171129, 26679, '<td valign="top">Beautifull, for me this easily mets the theme and if it had my name in the right hand corner would be perfect ;)<br/>If you are going to put  this in DPC prints I would clone out the slight imperfection in the top petal, <br/>I would offer some more superlatives, but my spelling is lousey...  Well done..</td>', 'Beautifull, for me this easily mets the theme and if it had my name in the right hand corner would be perfect ;)If you are going to put  this in DPC prints I would clone out the slight imperfection in the top petal, I would offer some more superlatives, but my spelling is lousey...  Well done..', '2005-04-27 04:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330969, 170830, 34547, '<td valign="top">Could playing around with the channel mixer made the "Sea Devil" more visible?</td>', 'Could playing around with the channel mixer made the "Sea Devil" more visible?', '2005-04-27 04:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330970, 171333, 36679, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot!</td>', 'beautiful shot!', '2005-04-27 04:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330972, 169409, 21716, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Maybe crop so the horizon is level.</td>', 'Cool shot.  Maybe crop so the horizon is level.', '2005-04-27 04:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
