(1330975, 169276, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation. Technically sharp, focused, detailed, and processed without distracting artifacts. Nice clean sky. Love the color saturation.<br/> <br/>I propose cropping the roof even tigher...just below the top tiles. Well done.</td>', 'Nice presentation. Technically sharp, focused, detailed, and processed without distracting artifacts. Nice clean sky. Love the color saturation. I propose cropping the roof even tigher...just below the top tiles. Well done.', '2005-04-27 04:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330976, 169577, 21716, '<td valign="top">Love the dark colors</td>', 'Love the dark colors', '2005-04-27 04:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330977, 171366, 34547, '<td valign="top">It''s small, but it appeals to me. How did you make this?</td>', 'It''s small, but it appeals to me. How did you make this?', '2005-04-27 04:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330979, 169348, 36604, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what''s supposed to be minimalistic about this photograph.  It meets neither the contest definition nor the classic definition.  Cute kid, though the image could use some mild sharpening.</td>', 'I have no idea what''s supposed to be minimalistic about this photograph.  It meets neither the contest definition nor the classic definition.  Cute kid, though the image could use some mild sharpening.', '2005-04-27 04:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330980, 171326, 22479, '<td valign="top">Lovely floral entry. Like the tones and sharp detail. Nice processing without any visible artifactual distractions. Very good border for this challenge!</td>', 'Lovely floral entry. Like the tones and sharp detail. Nice processing without any visible artifactual distractions. Very good border for this challenge!', '2005-04-27 04:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330983, 171221, 34547, '<td valign="top">I like how the vertical line breaks up the image while my eye bouces between the leaf and it.</td>', 'I like how the vertical line breaks up the image while my eye bouces between the leaf and it.', '2005-04-27 04:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330984, 169988, 21716, '<td valign="top">Not sure what red v yellow has to do with minimalism.  Nice concrete though.</td>', 'Not sure what red v yellow has to do with minimalism.  Nice concrete though.', '2005-04-27 04:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330985, 170342, 22479, '<td valign="top">I think you''re on the right track with this entry. The nice color of the flower is in sharp contrast to the murky water. Image is not quite as sharp as I would hope for. A bit lacking in fine detail as well, but I think this is more a limitation imposed by your digital camera than your processing, and thus is not that big of an issue. A very appropriate entry, and I think it''s a fine entry overall.</td>', 'I think you''re on the right track with this entry. The nice color of the flower is in sharp contrast to the murky water. Image is not quite as sharp as I would hope for. A bit lacking in fine detail as well, but I think this is more a limitation imposed by your digital camera than your processing, and thus is not that big of an issue. A very appropriate entry, and I think it''s a fine entry overall.', '2005-04-27 04:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330988, 171219, 21716, '<td valign="top">Very creative, can''t really see what she is holding.</td>', 'Very creative, can''t really see what she is holding.', '2005-04-27 04:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330989, 169577, 31399, '<td valign="top">cropped out maybe 10% of top?some pink but not so much? 7</td>', 'cropped out maybe 10% of top?some pink but not so much? 7', '2005-04-27 04:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330990, 171221, 36604, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept.  The color of the leaf immediately draws the eye, and the background avoids being tedious.  My only objection is that the joining of the boards at the center draws the eye away from the subject, and the lighter boards on the left are a bit harsh.  Cropping or reframing just shy of the seam would have improved the image, even if the subject took up a little more space as a result.</td>', 'An interesting concept.  The color of the leaf immediately draws the eye, and the background avoids being tedious.  My only objection is that the joining of the boards at the center draws the eye away from the subject, and the lighter boards on the left are a bit harsh.  Cropping or reframing just shy of the seam would have improved the image, even if the subject took up a little more space as a result.', '2005-04-27 04:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1330992, 170983, 31399, '<td valign="top">background seems gritty?or noise?or oversharpened? gl...7</td>', 'background seems gritty?or noise?or oversharpened? gl...7', '2005-04-27 04:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
