(1331023, 171045, 36604, '<td valign="top">This is one of those odd images where I can go through the checklist and have everything technically correct (non-tedious background, obvious subject, sharpness), but somehow the result lacks any emotive force, despite having had shadow and light set up specifically for it.  I''m not sure if that''s helpful, but it''s the best I can describe why I find it unappealing.</td>', 'This is one of those odd images where I can go through the checklist and have everything technically correct (non-tedious background, obvious subject, sharpness), but somehow the result lacks any emotive force, despite having had shadow and light set up specifically for it.  I''m not sure if that''s helpful, but it''s the best I can describe why I find it unappealing.', '2005-04-27 04:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
