(1331054, 170351, 36604, '<td valign="top">Pretty background, without being distracting, and the subject immediately draws the eye.  The image as a whole is evocative as well.  My only nit (that keeps this from being a 10), is that the center of the heart (candy?) is harshly reflective.  This does draw the eye, but crosses over into painful glare, obscuring what it actually is.</td>', 'Pretty background, without being distracting, and the subject immediately draws the eye.  The image as a whole is evocative as well.  My only nit (that keeps this from being a 10), is that the center of the heart (candy?) is harshly reflective.  This does draw the eye, but crosses over into painful glare, obscuring what it actually is.', '2005-04-27 04:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
