(1331168, 170508, 36528, '<td valign="top">I like macros and I really like the colours in this. Too much sharpening for me (watch the halos around the edges), and I would like to see a little more DOF. I would try this one again attempting to draw out the fine purple feathery elements in the centre together with the yellow pollen - would make a nice contrast IMO (but perhaps would then not meet the challange but would make a nice image).</td>', 'I like macros and I really like the colours in this. Too much sharpening for me (watch the halos around the edges), and I would like to see a little more DOF. I would try this one again attempting to draw out the fine purple feathery elements in the centre together with the yellow pollen - would make a nice contrast IMO (but perhaps would then not meet the challange but would make a nice image).', '2005-04-27 05:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
