(1331243, 170765, 35044, '<td valign="top">great image - I have seen this angle a lot, so guess it is a famous view point, but v pretty.  You will get comments that not minimalistic enough - but I can just about get over that.</td>', 'great image - I have seen this angle a lot, so guess it is a famous view point, but v pretty.  You will get comments that not minimalistic enough - but I can just about get over that.', '2005-04-27 06:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1331245, 170431, 8643, '<td valign="top">This is so close to being brilliant - for me, I would have preferred the subject a little higher in the frame.  I know that means more (darker) sea but it is too close to the bottom of the frame.</td>', 'This is so close to being brilliant - for me, I would have preferred the subject a little higher in the frame.  I know that means more (darker) sea but it is too close to the bottom of the frame.', '2005-04-27 06:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
