(1331249, 171154, 35044, '<td valign="top">like the leading lines from the roots.  fraction loss of sharpness/focus in the flowers could be fixed outside advanced editing.  stone chips in top middle and top left should have been removed.</td>', 'like the leading lines from the roots.  fraction loss of sharpness/focus in the flowers could be fixed outside advanced editing.  stone chips in top middle and top left should have been removed.', '2005-04-27 06:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
