(1331253, 169355, 8643, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best, lovely colouring, just enough background detail to provide depth and interest and an arresting subject and reflection, perfectly positioned in the composition.  Nice to catch the leg bent too, creates movement.  Must ribbon. . .</td>', 'This is one of the best, lovely colouring, just enough background detail to provide depth and interest and an arresting subject and reflection, perfectly positioned in the composition.  Nice to catch the leg bent too, creates movement.  Must ribbon. . .', '2005-04-27 06:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
