(1331265, 170200, 35044, '<td valign="top">I spy the great court... I think!  <br/> <br/>Nice image - sharp.  Colours in sky are a little muted (but then that is London for you).  clouds detract a little from minimalism.</td>', 'I spy the great court... I think!   Nice image - sharp.  Colours in sky are a little muted (but then that is London for you).  clouds detract a little from minimalism.', '2005-04-27 06:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
