(1332118, 171250, 32265, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a lot of airplanes flying overhead in this challenge (and I''m sure you''ve seen them too) but this is the only one that made me pause and write a comment. With the others, the plane was so small, that even though it made it more minimal, it lost a lot of interest. Your picture is much more balanced in the minimalism vs interesting battle. Well done.</td>', 'I''ve seen a lot of airplanes flying overhead in this challenge (and I''m sure you''ve seen them too) but this is the only one that made me pause and write a comment. With the others, the plane was so small, that even though it made it more minimal, it lost a lot of interest. Your picture is much more balanced in the minimalism vs interesting battle. Well done.', '2005-04-27 10:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
