(1332148, 171235, 35548, '<td valign="top">How image meets challenge description 4 pts...this is very different from what I would expect to meet the description of the challenge not sure which cow you want me to look at...and image is a bit busy.<br/>How image meets the defination of Minimalixm...0pts<br/> <br/>Average score 3<br/>Technical 5pts...needs to be sharper, with less foreground contrast<br/>Artistic...6pts....over-all image is interesting to look at and think about.</td>', 'How image meets challenge description 4 pts...this is very different from what I would expect to meet the description of the challenge not sure which cow you want me to look at...and image is a bit busy.How image meets the defination of Minimalixm...0pts Average score 3Technical 5pts...needs to be sharper, with less foreground contrastArtistic...6pts....over-all image is interesting to look at and think about.', '2005-04-27 11:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
