(1332152, 171363, 33560, '<td valign="top">Excuse me while I think out loud:<br/> <br/>It is a matter of some interest to me that a person in a photo, regardless of how smal,  becomes the subject.  I think it is always true, because whenever I see a landscape with a token person I complain that it is no longer a landscape.  So it is with this photo that the thing that makes the photo  an exquisite one is the landscape; the clouds, the water, the mirrored shore.  But there on that mirrored shore is a tiny speck of a human being.  And suddenly the photo is of a person on the shore.  Soooo....this photo epitomizes the minimalism of the challenge language. It is the ideal form for the challenge and its perfect expression.</td>', 'Excuse me while I think out loud: It is a matter of some interest to me that a person in a photo, regardless of how smal,  becomes the subject.  I think it is always true, because whenever I see a landscape with a token person I complain that it is no longer a landscape.  So it is with this photo that the thing that makes the photo  an exquisite one is the landscape; the clouds, the water, the mirrored shore.  But there on that mirrored shore is a tiny speck of a human being.  And suddenly the photo is of a person on the shore.  Soooo....this photo epitomizes the minimalism of the challenge language. It is the ideal form for the challenge and its perfect expression.', '2005-04-27 11:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1332153, 171180, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image. I like how everything is reflecting off of the water. I also like how there isn''t that much color until you get to the boat. finally, I like the texture seen in this image.. the water looks very smooth. Nice work.</td>', 'This is a nice image. I like how everything is reflecting off of the water. I also like how there isn''t that much color until you get to the boat. finally, I like the texture seen in this image.. the water looks very smooth. Nice work.', '2005-04-27 11:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
