(1332436, 170250, 22970, '<td valign="top">I find that your subject to centered within the picture and is not very strong. The nice sunset seems to overpower it. If it was not for the title I would find it hard to see the lamp as the subject. The lake seem to be a stronger subject in your picture. However you did capture a nice photograph and good lighting. Maybe a slight crop to tilt the horizon to left so it would be straight would of improved. I wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'I find that your subject to centered within the picture and is not very strong. The nice sunset seems to overpower it. If it was not for the title I would find it hard to see the lamp as the subject. The lake seem to be a stronger subject in your picture. However you did capture a nice photograph and good lighting. Maybe a slight crop to tilt the horizon to left so it would be straight would of improved. I wish you well in the challenge.', '2005-04-27 11:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
