(1333243, 169602, 17837, '<td valign="top">its a good shot, though you fell victim to having the frame split in half. Nex time, when composing the shot, place the man at intersecting thirds. This will give a greater impact on the photo. I know that this was a basic challenge, but perhaps you could do some slight burning of the clouds to give them some impact. Maybe even some levels might make them jump out some more.</td>', 'its a good shot, though you fell victim to having the frame split in half. Nex time, when composing the shot, place the man at intersecting thirds. This will give a greater impact on the photo. I know that this was a basic challenge, but perhaps you could do some slight burning of the clouds to give them some impact. Maybe even some levels might make them jump out some more.', '2005-04-27 14:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
