(1333353, 170878, 34481, '<td valign="top">diamond doesn''t seem to be in focus.  And the hole in the middle of the charcoal pieces is disconcerting.  If feels like the diamond is going to fall and will be lost.</td>', 'diamond doesn''t seem to be in focus.  And the hole in the middle of the charcoal pieces is disconcerting.  If feels like the diamond is going to fall and will be lost.', '2005-04-27 14:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
