(1333454, 171356, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am not going to lie to you, the frame bothers me but I did my best to look past that and judge the shot, not the frame.  Anyway, this shot works for well me, the halo really adds something to this shot and there is pretty much nothing bad I can say abuot this shot other than whatever that thing is in the right corner doesn´t help the shot IMHO.  Gave it an 8, I like it.</td>', 'I am not going to lie to you, the frame bothers me but I did my best to look past that and judge the shot, not the frame.  Anyway, this shot works for well me, the halo really adds something to this shot and there is pretty much nothing bad I can say abuot this shot other than whatever that thing is in the right corner doesn´t help the shot IMHO.  Gave it an 8, I like it.', '2005-04-27 14:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
