(1333468, 170508, 15922, '<td valign="top">Really like this - especially the way the background is VERY blurred. Almost lookes like the flower has been spot-editted though... the edges look outlined.</td>', 'Really like this - especially the way the background is VERY blurred. Almost lookes like the flower has been spot-editted though... the edges look outlined.', '2005-04-27 14:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
