(1333472, 169781, 27482, '<td valign="top">Composition way too centered for my taste but otherwise, not bad at all.  Still needs something to really make it shine, perhaps next time you could try a polarizer to decrease the reflection in the water to try and bring some depth into the texture of the water?  Just an idea anyway.  Good job but not great either, would have ranked it higher if you had cropped away the bottom and right side and placed the duck according to the rule of thirds but I still gave it a 6 like it is, nice capture.</td>', 'Composition way too centered for my taste but otherwise, not bad at all.  Still needs something to really make it shine, perhaps next time you could try a polarizer to decrease the reflection in the water to try and bring some depth into the texture of the water?  Just an idea anyway.  Good job but not great either, would have ranked it higher if you had cropped away the bottom and right side and placed the duck according to the rule of thirds but I still gave it a 6 like it is, nice capture.', '2005-04-27 14:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333474, 169329, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very simplistic, good strong colors and the power of the diagonal line. Well done.</td>', 'Very simplistic, good strong colors and the power of the diagonal line. Well done.', '2005-04-27 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333477, 170846, 30508, '<td valign="top">This has a wonderful feel to it.  For this challenge, I''d like to see a little more negative space, perhaps with the top of the cattail just barely reaching beyond the halfway point of the frame.  Minimalism aside, though, this would otherwise be a very strong composition.</td>', 'This has a wonderful feel to it.  For this challenge, I''d like to see a little more negative space, perhaps with the top of the cattail just barely reaching beyond the halfway point of the frame.  Minimalism aside, though, this would otherwise be a very strong composition.', '2005-04-27 14:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333478, 171354, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very cute baby!!  I enjoy the colors and the contrast between the checkered background and the stripes on the baby''s shirt.  I bet you had a lot of fun with this photo session.  =10</td>', 'Very cute baby!!  I enjoy the colors and the contrast between the checkered background and the stripes on the baby''s shirt.  I bet you had a lot of fun with this photo session.  =10', '2005-04-27 14:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
