(1333537, 168822, 30508, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of things I like about this photo, but I can''t quite put my finger on them.  Mostly it''s the mood and composition.  That said, though, I think the subject takes up far too much of the frame for minimalism and the focus isn''t quite sharp.  But, as I said, I like it from an artistic standpoint.</td>', 'There are a lot of things I like about this photo, but I can''t quite put my finger on them.  Mostly it''s the mood and composition.  That said, though, I think the subject takes up far too much of the frame for minimalism and the focus isn''t quite sharp.  But, as I said, I like it from an artistic standpoint.', '2005-04-27 14:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
