(1333596, 170878, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea.  Personally I''d like it with a bit more contrast.  The charcoal seems a bit too gray.</td>', 'This is a nice idea.  Personally I''d like it with a bit more contrast.  The charcoal seems a bit too gray.', '2005-04-27 14:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333597, 169839, 35804, '<td valign="top">A pretty prussian blue sky...simple and very effective picture. I love the stillness...the quiet.</td>', 'A pretty prussian blue sky...simple and very effective picture. I love the stillness...the quiet.', '2005-04-27 14:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333598, 170633, 30791, '<td valign="top">cool composition and idea, however the powerline distracts they eye from the real subject, 5</td>', 'cool composition and idea, however the powerline distracts they eye from the real subject, 5', '2005-04-27 14:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333600, 170589, 34481, '<td valign="top">Nicely  done.  I expected to see more shots like this, but it is unique thus far in my scoring.</td>', 'Nicely  done.  I expected to see more shots like this, but it is unique thus far in my scoring.', '2005-04-27 14:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333601, 171076, 2560, '<td valign="top">I like this, everything is good about this photo.  great lighting</td>', 'I like this, everything is good about this photo.  great lighting', '2005-04-27 14:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333602, 169262, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  The reeds make it just a little too busy and distract from the boy, but still a wonderful shot.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  The reeds make it just a little too busy and distract from the boy, but still a wonderful shot.', '2005-04-27 14:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333603, 169789, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Only thing that I would have liked is if the bunny were facing the other way.  However, I know how hard it is to capture those little rascals for the perfect pose.  =9</td>', 'Nicely done.  Only thing that I would have liked is if the bunny were facing the other way.  However, I know how hard it is to capture those little rascals for the perfect pose.  =9', '2005-04-27 14:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333604, 171235, 35645, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this photo, and had it been in better focus, it would have been a really good pic of the cow. I can''t tell if the horizon is tilted, or if they cows are just on a gentle slope, And having the tree on the left and the line of trees at the back of the field unfortunately make the photo too busy for me to consider it as fitting the challenge description. Also, the way the light hits the second cow seriously distracts from the cow in the foreground, which I think is the one you wanted as the main subject.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this photo, and had it been in better focus, it would have been a really good pic of the cow. I can''t tell if the horizon is tilted, or if they cows are just on a gentle slope, And having the tree on the left and the line of trees at the back of the field unfortunately make the photo too busy for me to consider it as fitting the challenge description. Also, the way the light hits the second cow seriously distracts from the cow in the foreground, which I think is the one you wanted as the main subject.', '2005-04-27 14:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333605, 170395, 3669, '<td valign="top">Elegant.  I like the muted tones.  Nice Job!!</td>', 'Elegant.  I like the muted tones.  Nice Job!!', '2005-04-27 14:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333606, 169138, 34481, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I wish the challenge rules would have allowed to to clone out that front post.</td>', 'I like it.  I wish the challenge rules would have allowed to to clone out that front post.', '2005-04-27 14:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333611, 170444, 34481, '<td valign="top">Nice but I would prefer the flower to be a bit larger.</td>', 'Nice but I would prefer the flower to be a bit larger.', '2005-04-27 14:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333612, 170157, 2560, '<td valign="top">I dont see the relationship with the flower and the negative space. good exposure</td>', 'I dont see the relationship with the flower and the negative space. good exposure', '2005-04-27 14:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333613, 170269, 30791, '<td valign="top">kind of looks like a windows XP desktop, 6</td>', 'kind of looks like a windows XP desktop, 6', '2005-04-27 14:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333616, 169429, 15922, '<td valign="top">I''m no expert, but for me it could have done with a bit more lighting, or maybe a different angle for the light you used - the right of the flower seems just ''dull'' rather than maybe the gradual shadow you wanted?</td>', 'I''m no expert, but for me it could have done with a bit more lighting, or maybe a different angle for the light you used - the right of the flower seems just ''dull'' rather than maybe the gradual shadow you wanted?', '2005-04-27 14:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333618, 169945, 34481, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but I  don''t think the DPC voters will be kind to this image.</td>', 'Interesting concept, but I  don''t think the DPC voters will be kind to this image.', '2005-04-27 14:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333619, 171284, 3669, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but slightly disturbing.  Great use of lighting</td>', 'Interesting, but slightly disturbing.  Great use of lighting', '2005-04-27 14:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333621, 171074, 34481, '<td valign="top">I think the photographer is too far down in the corner of the image, but the reflection is great.  you might do really well with this.  Good luck.</td>', 'I think the photographer is too far down in the corner of the image, but the reflection is great.  you might do really well with this.  Good luck.', '2005-04-27 14:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333623, 169007, 15922, '<td valign="top">really lovely scene, and I like the way the horse draws your eye because its darkness stands out, but I feel the trees are too light at the top - maybe you''ve over adjusted brightness or something similar? 6/10</td>', 'really lovely scene, and I like the way the horse draws your eye because its darkness stands out, but I feel the trees are too light at the top - maybe you''ve over adjusted brightness or something similar? 6/10', '2005-04-27 14:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333624, 169489, 35645, '<td valign="top">This seems to be a little too busy too meet the challenge defintion. Would have been much better to catch a photo of this at, say, the crest of a hill so that there would be less visual intereference from the surrounding landscape.</td>', 'This seems to be a little too busy too meet the challenge defintion. Would have been much better to catch a photo of this at, say, the crest of a hill so that there would be less visual intereference from the surrounding landscape.', '2005-04-27 14:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333626, 169347, 34481, '<td valign="top">I like this.  maybe a tad overexposed.</td>', 'I like this.  maybe a tad overexposed.', '2005-04-27 14:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333628, 171134, 30791, '<td valign="top">white balance seems off, but then agian this could be the way it was intended to be, 5</td>', 'white balance seems off, but then agian this could be the way it was intended to be, 5', '2005-04-27 14:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333630, 169353, 34481, '<td valign="top">I like the post-processing</td>', 'I like the post-processing', '2005-04-27 14:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333631, 171321, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot for this challenge.  The way you''ve highlighted the rice really helps it stand out, although it does look just a little forced.  Perhaps a softer border between the light and dark would have helped with that.  Also, the excess dark background on the left side of the hand is a little distracting.  A square crop with a centered composition might have improved this a little.  Still a fantastic shot, thouth.</td>', 'This is a great shot for this challenge.  The way you''ve highlighted the rice really helps it stand out, although it does look just a little forced.  Perhaps a softer border between the light and dark would have helped with that.  Also, the excess dark background on the left side of the hand is a little distracting.  A square crop with a centered composition might have improved this a little.  Still a fantastic shot, thouth.', '2005-04-27 14:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333632, 170835, 37008, '<td valign="top">I didn''t feel this image had a central subject that occupied a small portion of the image.</td>', 'I didn''t feel this image had a central subject that occupied a small portion of the image.', '2005-04-27 14:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333634, 169891, 2560, '<td valign="top">He isn''t lonely, he has a shovel.  I think you have to much here. You could compose to illiminate the forground stuff.</td>', 'He isn''t lonely, he has a shovel.  I think you have to much here. You could compose to illiminate the forground stuff.', '2005-04-27 14:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333636, 170277, 15922, '<td valign="top">Sorry - I don''t feel this one is anything special. You''ve managed to keep the very bright and very dark aspects clear though.</td>', 'Sorry - I don''t feel this one is anything special. You''ve managed to keep the very bright and very dark aspects clear though.', '2005-04-27 14:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333637, 171127, 30791, '<td valign="top">hahha this made me laugh, 7</td>', 'hahha this made me laugh, 7', '2005-04-27 14:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333638, 169199, 34481, '<td valign="top">Cool image, but I think the bird and the moon are too close together.</td>', 'Cool image, but I think the bird and the moon are too close together.', '2005-04-27 14:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1333639, 169781, 3669, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more color.  Perhaps some adjustment in post-processing with saturation would boost the blues in the water.</td>', 'I would have liked to see more color.  Perhaps some adjustment in post-processing with saturation would boost the blues in the water.', '2005-04-27 14:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
