(1333664, 171312, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a good composition for minimalism.  Some of the "outer" beans seem a little out of focus.  A slightly longer depth of field might have helped with that.</td>', 'This is a good composition for minimalism.  Some of the "outer" beans seem a little out of focus.  A slightly longer depth of field might have helped with that.', '2005-04-27 15:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
