(1333781, 169853, 30508, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this meets the minimalism challenge.  As far as the composition goes, I really like the lines of the birds body and how they take the viewer''s eye right to the bird''s eye.  The only change I would make would be to include all of the bird''s tail.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this meets the minimalism challenge.  As far as the composition goes, I really like the lines of the birds body and how they take the viewer''s eye right to the bird''s eye.  The only change I would make would be to include all of the bird''s tail.', '2005-04-27 15:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
