(1333786, 169974, 30508, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  I especially like the idea of the frame (of the plate) within the frame (of the photo itself).  The orientation of the lighting bothers me a little, though.  Given that my eye tends to move from right to left and from bottom to top, the shadow draws me away from the strawberry instead of towards it.  I think this might have been a little better if the strawberry were in the upper left and the light source was also from the upper left.  This would have caused the shadow to draw my eye from the center of the photo to the strawberry, moving from right to left and bottom to top.</td>', 'Great concept.  I especially like the idea of the frame (of the plate) within the frame (of the photo itself).  The orientation of the lighting bothers me a little, though.  Given that my eye tends to move from right to left and from bottom to top, the shadow draws me away from the strawberry instead of towards it.  I think this might have been a little better if the strawberry were in the upper left and the light source was also from the upper left.  This would have caused the shadow to draw my eye from the center of the photo to the strawberry, moving from right to left and bottom to top.', '2005-04-27 15:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
