(1334016, 168944, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a cool and unique fit for this challenge.     It is definitely a strong subject, and only occupies a tiny part of the picture.   You did really good!  :)</td>', 'What a cool and unique fit for this challenge.     It is definitely a strong subject, and only occupies a tiny part of the picture.   You did really good!  :)', '2005-04-27 16:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
