(1334026, 171342, 34285, '<td valign="top">Nice color.  Could have been cropped more along the horizon line and shot from a lower angle to get the tree higher in the sky.  But nice job none the less. 6.</td>', 'Nice color.  Could have been cropped more along the horizon line and shot from a lower angle to get the tree higher in the sky.  But nice job none the less. 6.', '2005-04-27 16:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
