(1334117, 170254, 7992, '<td valign="top">Now why can''t I get my critters to stop and pose like this fella. Excellent color--bonus point for slowing down a fidgety model :)</td>', 'Now why can''t I get my critters to stop and pose like this fella. Excellent color--bonus point for slowing down a fidgety model :)', '2005-04-27 16:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1334120, 170479, 7992, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition!</td>', 'Wonderful composition!', '2005-04-27 17:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1334123, 171366, 34659, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t see "any" subject matter other than the light/shadow/darkness.  Interesting concept, but I don''t see it as especially indicative of the topic...</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t see "any" subject matter other than the light/shadow/darkness.  Interesting concept, but I don''t see it as especially indicative of the topic...', '2005-04-27 17:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1334124, 170451, 29537, '<td valign="top">the subject is occupying a very large space</td>', 'the subject is occupying a very large space', '2005-04-27 17:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1334126, 171261, 33379, '<td valign="top">very talented fork..great job!!!</td>', 'very talented fork..great job!!!', '2005-04-27 17:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1334128, 169133, 7992, '<td valign="top">What a refreshing concept of minimalism.</td>', 'What a refreshing concept of minimalism.', '2005-04-27 17:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1334129, 169320, 29537, '<td valign="top">nice cololors, good composition</td>', 'nice cololors, good composition', '2005-04-27 17:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1334135, 169168, 35739, '<td valign="top">Other than the frame? Artistic value is very good.  Your subject is clear and lighting looks good.</td>', 'Other than the frame? Artistic value is very good.  Your subject is clear and lighting looks good.', '2005-04-27 17:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1334136, 169304, 30508, '<td valign="top">I''m a big baseball fan, so this really strikes home for me.  A couple of things that might improve the shot:  The player''s head corresponds with the line between the field and the outfield wall, it would be better if he was separated more from that (probably difficult to do based on where you were sitting).  Also, he is right in line with one of the seams in the padding on the wall which is also distracting.  Finally, while the subject is supposed to be small based on the challenge discription, he is a bit hard to make out at that distance, so maybe a slightly closer zoom would have worked better.  All in all, though, a very nice shot.</td>', 'I''m a big baseball fan, so this really strikes home for me.  A couple of things that might improve the shot:  The player''s head corresponds with the line between the field and the outfield wall, it would be better if he was separated more from that (probably difficult to do based on where you were sitting).  Also, he is right in line with one of the seams in the padding on the wall which is also distracting.  Finally, while the subject is supposed to be small based on the challenge discription, he is a bit hard to make out at that distance, so maybe a slightly closer zoom would have worked better.  All in all, though, a very nice shot.', '2005-04-27 17:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1334141, 171252, 35739, '<td valign="top">You met the challenge.</td>', 'You met the challenge.', '2005-04-27 17:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1334144, 171269, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  Your subject is placed perfectly and I love the texture of the plants in the foreground.  Too bad about the spots, though.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  Your subject is placed perfectly and I love the texture of the plants in the foreground.  Too bad about the spots, though.', '2005-04-27 17:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1334148, 170546, 30508, '<td valign="top">Cool image.  I love the way sillouhetting the subject enhances the shapes and textures and the angle draws the eye right into the frame.</td>', 'Cool image.  I love the way sillouhetting the subject enhances the shapes and textures and the angle draws the eye right into the frame.', '2005-04-27 17:09:43.000000', NULL, 1);
