(1334345, 169454, 31042, '<td valign="top">Was there a substantial filtering effect used on this image, or a physical filter put infront of the lens to substantially alter the image?  Either that, or the change in hues or tints detracts from the idea of this image, which, and sorry for my lack of theory-based knowledge, is unclear to me.  Is the plane supposed to be the subject, or the tree, or the person, which I think it is.  There is an uncertainty that does not help this image.  The subject should be clear and consise, and stands out from the rest of the image.  Too blue.  2</td>', 'Was there a substantial filtering effect used on this image, or a physical filter put infront of the lens to substantially alter the image?  Either that, or the change in hues or tints detracts from the idea of this image, which, and sorry for my lack of theory-based knowledge, is unclear to me.  Is the plane supposed to be the subject, or the tree, or the person, which I think it is.  There is an uncertainty that does not help this image.  The subject should be clear and consise, and stands out from the rest of the image.  Too blue.  2', '2005-04-27 17:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
