(1334583, 170879, 9668, '<td valign="top">Looks like you either cropped this image to small or used digital zoom for it, I can see alot of noise/bitmapping in it. Awesome image! Although it seems like you have two subjects (the sun on the water, and the boat), I think the boat definatly is the strong point, and what keeps the eye in the image. Lovely composition.</td>', 'Looks like you either cropped this image to small or used digital zoom for it, I can see alot of noise/bitmapping in it. Awesome image! Although it seems like you have two subjects (the sun on the water, and the boat), I think the boat definatly is the strong point, and what keeps the eye in the image. Lovely composition.', '2005-04-27 18:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
