(1334647, 170983, 31042, '<td valign="top">Great work, I love the composition and the colours of this one, great background too, and sorry for this one, (im picky), but the shadow on the bottom left hand corner is slightly distracting.  The image could be cleaned up a little too, (neat image maybe, im not an expert).  7 though, it deserves it.</td>', 'Great work, I love the composition and the colours of this one, great background too, and sorry for this one, (im picky), but the shadow on the bottom left hand corner is slightly distracting.  The image could be cleaned up a little too, (neat image maybe, im not an expert).  7 though, it deserves it.', '2005-04-27 19:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
