(1334654, 171312, 7599, '<td valign="top">Photo meets the challenge and the idea is good.  From a technical standpoint the lighting needs some work. I realize it''s very hard to make a white background "white" especially under the basic rules, but when attempting this type of shot you really need to nail the lighting as it makes or breaks the photo. I obviously dont know your setup but I have found when doing white shots a light source at the front, as well a. at the back of the background helps make the white brighter. You could also try it outside in daylight (noon)  the poor mans light studio.</td>', 'Photo meets the challenge and the idea is good.  From a technical standpoint the lighting needs some work. I realize it''s very hard to make a white background "white" especially under the basic rules, but when attempting this type of shot you really need to nail the lighting as it makes or breaks the photo. I obviously dont know your setup but I have found when doing white shots a light source at the front, as well a. at the back of the background helps make the white brighter. You could also try it outside in daylight (noon)  the poor mans light studio.', '2005-04-27 19:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1334659, 169305, 31042, '<td valign="top">Whoa, amazing capture, musta been a random shot, for this kind of desired outcome, or ur really good at this.  Everything in this photo works, I can see top 10, the focus is so surprisingly sharp on the bug, and it''s colours, with the colours of the leaf as well are so stunningly attractive and beautiful.  Overall, a terrific shot, 9, the highest i''ve rated so far; the first 9 i''ve given out, and probably th only one. AWESOME!</td>', 'Whoa, amazing capture, musta been a random shot, for this kind of desired outcome, or ur really good at this.  Everything in this photo works, I can see top 10, the focus is so surprisingly sharp on the bug, and it''s colours, with the colours of the leaf as well are so stunningly attractive and beautiful.  Overall, a terrific shot, 9, the highest i''ve rated so far; the first 9 i''ve given out, and probably th only one. AWESOME!', '2005-04-27 19:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1334663, 171346, 31042, '<td valign="top">I am not really understanding the whole idea of the title, degrees?  maybe ''3 % of minimalism'', for the amount of subject (cow) in the picture.  Great though, I love it though, nice burning and dodging, and nice comp.  7</td>', 'I am not really understanding the whole idea of the title, degrees?  maybe ''3 % of minimalism'', for the amount of subject (cow) in the picture.  Great though, I love it though, nice burning and dodging, and nice comp.  7', '2005-04-27 19:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
