(1334896, 171018, 36604, '<td valign="top">I normally don''t like harsh, white backgrounds, but here it serves well to show the colored shadow.  This is minimalist more in the classic sense than in the contest description sense, but I''m not docking points for that.  Excellent color contrasts, and the shadow breaks up the background tedium nicely.</td>', 'I normally don''t like harsh, white backgrounds, but here it serves well to show the colored shadow.  This is minimalist more in the classic sense than in the contest description sense, but I''m not docking points for that.  Excellent color contrasts, and the shadow breaks up the background tedium nicely.', '2005-04-27 20:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1334897, 171074, 24183, '<td valign="top">great phot, the mountain and trees want to be the main subject, not the photographer.  IMHO</td>', 'great phot, the mountain and trees want to be the main subject, not the photographer.  IMHO', '2005-04-27 20:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1334898, 169602, 20066, '<td valign="top">Ouch  ..  Would have been perfect (in my opinion) if there was more space in front of the person (not much more, just a little bit) and more sky also and less sand or the opposite more sand and less sky.</td>', 'Ouch  ..  Would have been perfect (in my opinion) if there was more space in front of the person (not much more, just a little bit) and more sky also and less sand or the opposite more sand and less sky.', '2005-04-27 20:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
