(1334938, 170493, 36604, '<td valign="top">Huh.  Almost the same concept that I used, only with a brighter, less dramatic style.  I''m really curious to see whether you outscore me.  The dark line above the shadow mars the image somewhat.  I would have preferred an arrangement that adds drama, but it seems I''m being downscored for having done exactly that, so take this advice with a large grain of salt.</td>', 'Huh.  Almost the same concept that I used, only with a brighter, less dramatic style.  I''m really curious to see whether you outscore me.  The dark line above the shadow mars the image somewhat.  I would have preferred an arrangement that adds drama, but it seems I''m being downscored for having done exactly that, so take this advice with a large grain of salt.', '2005-04-27 20:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
