(1334955, 171217, 24183, '<td valign="top">where is the subject?  Ok I see, but I dont think that your shadow is the main point o focus in the photo.  It seems to be over powered by the green grass,  I think a good photo has to have a dominating subject.  For this challenge it was suposed to be minimal, and I think the grass and sky are overwelming your shadow,  which creates compitition,which hurts a photo,</td>', 'where is the subject?  Ok I see, but I dont think that your shadow is the main point o focus in the photo.  It seems to be over powered by the green grass,  I think a good photo has to have a dominating subject.  For this challenge it was suposed to be minimal, and I think the grass and sky are overwelming your shadow,  which creates compitition,which hurts a photo,', '2005-04-27 20:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
