(1335130, 170629, 30508, '<td valign="top">OK, I think you''re making a point here, but I''m going to go ahead and comment anyway.  It looks like a monitor is being used as the background and the glare where the sun or moon is doesn''t look quite right.  The haloing around the flower makes it look detached from the background and unnatural and the lighting on the flower doesn''t match the lighting of the background.  Furthermore, I think you''re title is right on, as I''m no sure what the subject is supposed to be here.  Still, an intriguing image from a digital art standpoint.</td>', 'OK, I think you''re making a point here, but I''m going to go ahead and comment anyway.  It looks like a monitor is being used as the background and the glare where the sun or moon is doesn''t look quite right.  The haloing around the flower makes it look detached from the background and unnatural and the lighting on the flower doesn''t match the lighting of the background.  Furthermore, I think you''re title is right on, as I''m no sure what the subject is supposed to be here.  Still, an intriguing image from a digital art standpoint.', '2005-04-27 21:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335131, 169768, 35746, '<td valign="top">interesting idea...but the subject just doesnt grab you at all...not enough pop for me</td>', 'interesting idea...but the subject just doesnt grab you at all...not enough pop for me', '2005-04-27 21:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335133, 171184, 33947, '<td valign="top">Creative. Nicely lit and good highlights. Very sharp.</td>', 'Creative. Nicely lit and good highlights. Very sharp.', '2005-04-27 21:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335134, 171330, 30508, '<td valign="top">The lighting feels just a little bit flat here but I like the composition.</td>', 'The lighting feels just a little bit flat here but I like the composition.', '2005-04-27 21:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335136, 171278, 32790, '<td valign="top">Awesome contrast, very nice job on the well.. ''non-colors''. An eyecatcher!</td>', 'Awesome contrast, very nice job on the well.. ''non-colors''. An eyecatcher!', '2005-04-27 21:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335138, 169945, 30508, '<td valign="top">A nice, artistic approach to the challenge.  Still, my tastes prefer something to be in focus, but hey, that''s just me.</td>', 'A nice, artistic approach to the challenge.  Still, my tastes prefer something to be in focus, but hey, that''s just me.', '2005-04-27 21:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335139, 169945, 32790, '<td valign="top">I dont really see the minimalism in this one sorry to say.</td>', 'I dont really see the minimalism in this one sorry to say.', '2005-04-27 21:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335140, 169235, 30508, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  I like this a lot.</td>', 'Great concept.  I like this a lot.', '2005-04-27 21:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335142, 170269, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the curvy line of the hillsand the rich greens. Beautiful compositon. Nice light.</td>', 'Love the curvy line of the hillsand the rich greens. Beautiful compositon. Nice light.', '2005-04-27 21:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335143, 170088, 30508, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but it feels a little muddled to me.  You''ve definitely met the letter of the challenge, but I think the subject should stand out a bit more from it''s background (or in this case, foreground).</td>', 'Interesting concept, but it feels a little muddled to me.  You''ve definitely met the letter of the challenge, but I think the subject should stand out a bit more from it''s background (or in this case, foreground).', '2005-04-27 21:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335144, 169955, 32790, '<td valign="top">Oow im SO craving a sauna right now!! Funny detail, first time i saw my current girlfriend was in a sauna :)<br/>The colors and focus looks good and it meets the challenge, the grain works for me.</td>', 'Oow im SO craving a sauna right now!! Funny detail, first time i saw my current girlfriend was in a sauna :)The colors and focus looks good and it meets the challenge, the grain works for me.', '2005-04-27 21:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335145, 169577, 30669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.....&lt;10</td>', 'Beautiful shot.....<10', '2005-04-27 21:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335148, 170484, 32790, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, somehow it looks like a painting, it might be somewhat overexposed right above the horizon. Good one though!</td>', 'Nice colors, somehow it looks like a painting, it might be somewhat overexposed right above the horizon. Good one though!', '2005-04-27 21:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335149, 171036, 30508, '<td valign="top">Hey, that''s not a _rubber_ duck!  Well captured, everything looks nice and sharp.  The composition might be improved by isolating the duckling more, getting it away from some of the weeds and perhaps using a more extreme placement in the frame.</td>', 'Hey, that''s not a _rubber_ duck!  Well captured, everything looks nice and sharp.  The composition might be improved by isolating the duckling more, getting it away from some of the weeds and perhaps using a more extreme placement in the frame.', '2005-04-27 21:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335152, 170813, 32790, '<td valign="top">Wow, i really like this shot. Strong colors and contrast match the strong message it delivers. Great photo!</td>', 'Wow, i really like this shot. Strong colors and contrast match the strong message it delivers. Great photo!', '2005-04-27 21:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335153, 169440, 33947, '<td valign="top">This is really, really neat. Love the highlights on the bub, and the beautiful colors and shading in the background. Like the title, too.</td>', 'This is really, really neat. Love the highlights on the bub, and the beautiful colors and shading in the background. Like the title, too.', '2005-04-27 21:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335155, 170875, 32790, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and awesome negative space!</td>', 'Good lighting and awesome negative space!', '2005-04-27 21:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335157, 171259, 35746, '<td valign="top">good minimalistic concept ....just doesnt grab me subjest wise</td>', 'good minimalistic concept ....just doesnt grab me subjest wise', '2005-04-27 21:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335158, 170429, 32790, '<td valign="top">Nice one!</td>', 'Nice one!', '2005-04-27 21:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335159, 170564, 30508, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea.  I''m guessing that the placement of the shadow was intentional, but I''m not sure what the intent was.  The transition from light to dark in the middle of the frame just seems distracting to me.</td>', 'An interesting idea.  I''m guessing that the placement of the shadow was intentional, but I''m not sure what the intent was.  The transition from light to dark in the middle of the frame just seems distracting to me.', '2005-04-27 21:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335160, 171362, 30508, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  The placement doesn''t quite work for me, though.  There''s not enough empty space to create a real sense of tension or drama.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  The placement doesn''t quite work for me, though.  There''s not enough empty space to create a real sense of tension or drama.', '2005-04-27 21:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335161, 170385, 32790, '<td valign="top">Focus looks a bit off on this one. The tube thing, is that like the inside of a toiletpaper-roll thing? Creative :)</td>', 'Focus looks a bit off on this one. The tube thing, is that like the inside of a toiletpaper-roll thing? Creative :)', '2005-04-27 21:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335162, 170501, 33947, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly sharp and simple.</td>', 'Brilliantly sharp and simple.', '2005-04-27 21:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335163, 171236, 32790, '<td valign="top">Very nice :)</td>', 'Very nice :)', '2005-04-27 21:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335164, 171093, 35746, '<td valign="top">i really like the simple yet complex nature of this photograph....maybe your subject should have been a bit more minimal</td>', 'i really like the simple yet complex nature of this photograph....maybe your subject should have been a bit more minimal', '2005-04-27 21:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335165, 170807, 7599, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Lighting is excellent and the composition perfect. Only areas of improvement (which you are somewhat limited to adjust due to the basic rules) would be the light spot in the middle of the background and the almost blue halo around the top of the bird. As a whole this image is very clean and unique. High marks from me.</td>', 'Fantastic. Lighting is excellent and the composition perfect. Only areas of improvement (which you are somewhat limited to adjust due to the basic rules) would be the light spot in the middle of the background and the almost blue halo around the top of the bird. As a whole this image is very clean and unique. High marks from me.', '2005-04-27 21:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335166, 169940, 30669, '<td valign="top">veryyy clever.</td>', 'veryyy clever.', '2005-04-27 21:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335168, 169606, 35951, '<td valign="top">Wow, this picture really opened my eyes to the wonder found in simple things. The lighting especially, it really shows off the... whatever that is. Great shot!</td>', 'Wow, this picture really opened my eyes to the wonder found in simple things. The lighting especially, it really shows off the... whatever that is. Great shot!', '2005-04-27 21:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335169, 171293, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, but the white background is a little too much for me.  I think you could have still met the challenge and improved the shot by using the board as the entire background.</td>', 'This is a good idea, but the white background is a little too much for me.  I think you could have still met the challenge and improved the shot by using the board as the entire background.', '2005-04-27 21:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335170, 170395, 35746, '<td valign="top">like this picture dont see these in my backyard...a bit to washed out for me though</td>', 'like this picture dont see these in my backyard...a bit to washed out for me though', '2005-04-27 21:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335172, 170541, 32790, '<td valign="top">Abstract it is! I like it though, nice colors!</td>', 'Abstract it is! I like it though, nice colors!', '2005-04-27 21:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335173, 169916, 32790, '<td valign="top">Great focus!</td>', 'Great focus!', '2005-04-27 21:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335174, 170903, 30508, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  The bird is a little blurry (focus or motion blur - not sure), but I actually think that it adds to the mood.</td>', 'Great composition.  The bird is a little blurry (focus or motion blur - not sure), but I actually think that it adds to the mood.', '2005-04-27 21:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335176, 169266, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflections and light in the water. Meets challenge nicely.</td>', 'Beautiful reflections and light in the water. Meets challenge nicely.', '2005-04-27 21:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335177, 169503, 32790, '<td valign="top">Awesome! Really conveys loneliness.</td>', 'Awesome! Really conveys loneliness.', '2005-04-27 21:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
