(1335201, 171279, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the zoom blur.  You''ve got a couple of spots, though, probably from dust.  Nice concept though.</td>', 'Nice use of the zoom blur.  You''ve got a couple of spots, though, probably from dust.  Nice concept though.', '2005-04-27 21:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
