(1335672, 170558, 34134, '<td valign="top">Wonder effect and ever so SHARP!</td>', 'Wonder effect and ever so SHARP!', '2005-04-27 23:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335673, 171194, 35513, '<td valign="top">The image quality in this shot is fabulous.  I love that I can see strands of hair.  I also love the positioning of this shot...it just seems to capture something that I can''t quite put my finger on....some kind of expectancy perhaps.  Very enjoyable :-)</td>', 'The image quality in this shot is fabulous.  I love that I can see strands of hair.  I also love the positioning of this shot...it just seems to capture something that I can''t quite put my finger on....some kind of expectancy perhaps.  Very enjoyable :-)', '2005-04-27 23:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335674, 171094, 22734, '<td valign="top">The moon is not tack sharp but it does not have to in this type of composition. Bumping up.</td>', 'The moon is not tack sharp but it does not have to in this type of composition. Bumping up.', '2005-04-27 23:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335677, 171078, 22734, '<td valign="top">very good selective dof to make this fellow sing.</td>', 'very good selective dof to make this fellow sing.', '2005-04-27 23:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335680, 171136, 35513, '<td valign="top">The colors in this photo are stunning.  It reminds me of a painting.  I like the different textures and depths between the trees and the river.  And the image of one man in the middle of it all is very striking.</td>', 'The colors in this photo are stunning.  It reminds me of a painting.  I like the different textures and depths between the trees and the river.  And the image of one man in the middle of it all is very striking.', '2005-04-27 23:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335681, 170711, 34134, '<td valign="top">I think the subject is a bit too minimal. Hard to spot.</td>', 'I think the subject is a bit too minimal. Hard to spot.', '2005-04-27 23:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335684, 169385, 22734, '<td valign="top">The mouse could have been twice as big to increase the impact, but the image is fully within the bounds. Bumping up.</td>', 'The mouse could have been twice as big to increase the impact, but the image is fully within the bounds. Bumping up.', '2005-04-27 23:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335688, 170314, 35513, '<td valign="top">So simple, and yet so well done!  I liked this shot right off the bat, but it wasn''t until I looked closer that I noticed the reflection of the hand.  In my mind, that bumped it up from a 9 to a 10.  Very well done.</td>', 'So simple, and yet so well done!  I liked this shot right off the bat, but it wasn''t until I looked closer that I noticed the reflection of the hand.  In my mind, that bumped it up from a 9 to a 10.  Very well done.', '2005-04-27 23:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335689, 171224, 11800, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The dark person is contrasted from the scenic surroundings to make him the focal point. It is an interesting picture while still maintaining the challenge description. Good job. I''m just commenting on the few pictures I saw that aren''t boring.</td>', 'Great composition. The dark person is contrasted from the scenic surroundings to make him the focal point. It is an interesting picture while still maintaining the challenge description. Good job. I''m just commenting on the few pictures I saw that aren''t boring.', '2005-04-27 23:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335690, 170879, 3102, '<td valign="top">A nicely composed shot, and a pretty scene, but the .jpg artifacts kinda spoil it.  Be sure to take advantage of the 150K limit on file sizes -- this is only 37K.   This would have been a super shot at a better .jpg compression.  :)</td>', 'A nicely composed shot, and a pretty scene, but the .jpg artifacts kinda spoil it.  Be sure to take advantage of the 150K limit on file sizes -- this is only 37K.   This would have been a super shot at a better .jpg compression.  :)', '2005-04-27 23:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335691, 169577, 35513, '<td valign="top">This picture has a wonderful look and feel to it.  I love how the colors become cooler and cooler, with the shillouettes of the boats on the water.  Excellently captured.</td>', 'This picture has a wonderful look and feel to it.  I love how the colors become cooler and cooler, with the shillouettes of the boats on the water.  Excellently captured.', '2005-04-27 23:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335692, 171266, 22734, '<td valign="top">An image with two subjects but the plane gets the credit as the sun is only part of the sky (cosmos) Now, a bigger size would have helped out more.</td>', 'An image with two subjects but the plane gets the credit as the sun is only part of the sky (cosmos) Now, a bigger size would have helped out more.', '2005-04-27 23:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335694, 169441, 22734, '<td valign="top">Cute and colorful. Bumping up.</td>', 'Cute and colorful. Bumping up.', '2005-04-27 23:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335695, 169334, 14736, '<td valign="top">seems out of focus and pixelated.  i''ll be interested in seeing how this shot was taken (assuming it gets verified)</td>', 'seems out of focus and pixelated.  i''ll be interested in seeing how this shot was taken (assuming it gets verified)', '2005-04-27 23:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335697, 169717, 14736, '<td valign="top">one of the better flower shots in this challenge, i would have enjoyed a bluer sky, though</td>', 'one of the better flower shots in this challenge, i would have enjoyed a bluer sky, though', '2005-04-27 23:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335698, 170950, 35513, '<td valign="top">The detail of the water droplets is incredible.  The fold between the two petals makes for a lovely shadow and curve that eases the eye.</td>', 'The detail of the water droplets is incredible.  The fold between the two petals makes for a lovely shadow and curve that eases the eye.', '2005-04-27 23:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335699, 170762, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very good take on this challenge because the senses have to rearrange to accept the image. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very good take on this challenge because the senses have to rearrange to accept the image. Bumping up.', '2005-04-27 23:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335702, 169761, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this shot.  I love the difference geometric patterns, all the way down to the plaid in the girl''s outfit.  A striking image.</td>', 'I really enjoy this shot.  I love the difference geometric patterns, all the way down to the plaid in the girl''s outfit.  A striking image.', '2005-04-27 23:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335703, 170807, 22734, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the most interesting image in this challenge. bumping up.</td>', 'Perhaps the most interesting image in this challenge. bumping up.', '2005-04-27 23:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335709, 170807, 35513, '<td valign="top">I have never seen such an interestingly shaped drop of water.  I have to be amazed at the eye of the photographer who can look at something so small and show us the beauty of it so well.  Excellently captured.</td>', 'I have never seen such an interestingly shaped drop of water.  I have to be amazed at the eye of the photographer who can look at something so small and show us the beauty of it so well.  Excellently captured.', '2005-04-27 23:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335710, 170254, 22734, '<td valign="top">What a face! Very interesting composition with great framing and a wonderful gaussean sky. Bumping up.</td>', 'What a face! Very interesting composition with great framing and a wonderful gaussean sky. Bumping up.', '2005-04-27 23:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335712, 171295, 14736, '<td valign="top">image could use a little sharpening, and the blown out look doesn''t work well for me</td>', 'image could use a little sharpening, and the blown out look doesn''t work well for me', '2005-04-27 23:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335715, 170422, 22734, '<td valign="top">A nice image to look at with the most effective negative space available. Bumping up.</td>', 'A nice image to look at with the most effective negative space available. Bumping up.', '2005-04-27 23:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335716, 170873, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between all of the colors here.  The sky is such a brilliant blue, the grass so green....and when melded with the orange-brown of the dirt and slight yellow of the tree....it''s lovely :-)</td>', 'I love the contrast between all of the colors here.  The sky is such a brilliant blue, the grass so green....and when melded with the orange-brown of the dirt and slight yellow of the tree....it''s lovely :-)', '2005-04-27 23:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335718, 170971, 14736, '<td valign="top">great shot, but the hat is too dark... great location too</td>', 'great shot, but the hat is too dark... great location too', '2005-04-27 23:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335720, 171013, 11800, '<td valign="top">Commenting only. The thumbnail looked interesting. Now that it''s open, I see that it''s an actual candleholder and am a bit disappointed. The light was captured well. A slight curves adjustment might darken the black some, or changing the black point. It would also help with the dark noise. gl</td>', 'Commenting only. The thumbnail looked interesting. Now that it''s open, I see that it''s an actual candleholder and am a bit disappointed. The light was captured well. A slight curves adjustment might darken the black some, or changing the black point. It would also help with the dark noise. gl', '2005-04-27 23:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335721, 170615, 22734, '<td valign="top">acute concentration. great way to lead the eyes. Bumping up.</td>', 'acute concentration. great way to lead the eyes. Bumping up.', '2005-04-27 23:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335724, 169893, 35739, '<td valign="top">If you cropped out the other boats this may have meet the challenge better.Sorry.  I do not believe this meets the challenge criteria.</td>', 'If you cropped out the other boats this may have meet the challenge better.Sorry.  I do not believe this meets the challenge criteria.', '2005-04-27 23:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335726, 171341, 17291, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I like the idea of making it B&amp;W. I gave it a 10.</td>', 'Great photo. I like the idea of making it B&W. I gave it a 10.', '2005-04-27 23:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335729, 171297, 17291, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I liked the lighting and sharpness of the subject. I gave it a 10.</td>', 'Nice photo. I liked the lighting and sharpness of the subject. I gave it a 10.', '2005-04-27 23:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335730, 170269, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very subtle image wherein many voters may miss the point. My eyes are directed and acknowledge the trees as the subject. Good photography. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very subtle image wherein many voters may miss the point. My eyes are directed and acknowledge the trees as the subject. Good photography. Bumping up.', '2005-04-27 23:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335731, 169135, 11800, '<td valign="top">Commenting only. I love this picture. Wonderful. Hope you win.</td>', 'Commenting only. I love this picture. Wonderful. Hope you win.', '2005-04-27 23:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335732, 170167, 23278, '<td valign="top">Night contrast of lighting.</td>', 'Night contrast of lighting.', '2005-04-27 23:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335733, 169863, 14736, '<td valign="top">great photo, one of my favorites from the challenge, but i''m afraid it''s quite large for "minimalsim"</td>', 'great photo, one of my favorites from the challenge, but i''m afraid it''s quite large for "minimalsim"', '2005-04-27 23:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335734, 170879, 22734, '<td valign="top">A good entry moving with ten knots. Bumping up.</td>', 'A good entry moving with ten knots. Bumping up.', '2005-04-27 23:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335739, 170781, 23278, '<td valign="top">Very interesting DOF -- how it''s out of focus upto and including a tiny sliver of the drop and then snaps into focus.Nice detail.</td>', 'Very interesting DOF -- how it''s out of focus upto and including a tiny sliver of the drop and then snaps into focus.Nice detail.', '2005-04-27 23:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335740, 171262, 35513, '<td valign="top">I just.....REALLY like this shot.  I''m not sure I can effectively put into words why :-)  I like the starish shape of the green stems.  I like the dark and light parts of the dandelion fluff.  The compliment each other well.  And I enjoy the overall star shape of the picture as a whole.</td>', 'I just.....REALLY like this shot.  I''m not sure I can effectively put into words why :-)  I like the starish shape of the green stems.  I like the dark and light parts of the dandelion fluff.  The compliment each other well.  And I enjoy the overall star shape of the picture as a whole.', '2005-04-27 23:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335743, 169706, 23278, '<td valign="top">Nice, fits the challenge pretty well I think.</td>', 'Nice, fits the challenge pretty well I think.', '2005-04-27 23:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335745, 170715, 22734, '<td valign="top">many blowouts but nonetheless the image remains impressive with the red drop taking full attention. Bumping up.</td>', 'many blowouts but nonetheless the image remains impressive with the red drop taking full attention. Bumping up.', '2005-04-27 23:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335749, 170474, 14736, '<td valign="top">i missed an airshow this weekend... this shot makes me jealous</td>', 'i missed an airshow this weekend... this shot makes me jealous', '2005-04-27 23:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335750, 170842, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice image. Slightly smaller would have yielded higher marks, however, I love the image as is. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very nice image. Slightly smaller would have yielded higher marks, however, I love the image as is. Bumping up.', '2005-04-27 23:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335751, 169454, 23278, '<td valign="top">NIce. Nice colors.</td>', 'NIce. Nice colors.', '2005-04-27 23:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335752, 171217, 24749, '<td valign="top">Shadow is intriguing</td>', 'Shadow is intriguing', '2005-04-27 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335754, 169135, 23278, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured -- a little over saturated I think.</td>', 'Very nicely captured -- a little over saturated I think.', '2005-04-27 23:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335756, 169852, 22734, '<td valign="top">I see a structure but I am unable to decypher its shape. This is a case where favoring the subject would bring you a higher vote. 5</td>', 'I see a structure but I am unable to decypher its shape. This is a case where favoring the subject would bring you a higher vote. 5', '2005-04-27 23:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335757, 171094, 14736, '<td valign="top">the moon could use some sharpening... i''ve found the best way to get a clear shot of the moon is to use a telescope</td>', 'the moon could use some sharpening... i''ve found the best way to get a clear shot of the moon is to use a telescope', '2005-04-27 23:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335758, 170563, 36235, '<td valign="top">Love the texture of the background, and the central point of focus seems to be perfectly aligned in the rule of thirds grid.  However, it''s hard for me to tell what the item is.  The title indicates that it''s a jewel, but is it a jewel in some sort of setting? A ring?  A bit better lighting on the item would have helped me.</td>', 'Love the texture of the background, and the central point of focus seems to be perfectly aligned in the rule of thirds grid.  However, it''s hard for me to tell what the item is.  The title indicates that it''s a jewel, but is it a jewel in some sort of setting? A ring?  A bit better lighting on the item would have helped me.', '2005-04-27 23:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335760, 171263, 22734, '<td valign="top">Personally i would have avoided the desat look here. Without it the image is very strong. Bumping up.</td>', 'Personally i would have avoided the desat look here. Without it the image is very strong. Bumping up.', '2005-04-27 23:43:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1335763, 170138, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very well done to meet the challenge. Bumping up.</td>', 'Very well done to meet the challenge. Bumping up.', '2005-04-27 23:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335764, 170254, 36235, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color contrast.</td>', 'Gorgeous color contrast.', '2005-04-27 23:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335765, 171218, 11800, '<td valign="top">Commenting only. Lovely. One of the few I feel meet the title of the challenge. I just wouldn''t be mean enough to knock off points for this well executed photograph. gl</td>', 'Commenting only. Lovely. One of the few I feel meet the title of the challenge. I just wouldn''t be mean enough to knock off points for this well executed photograph. gl', '2005-04-27 23:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335766, 169000, 35513, '<td valign="top">This image is somewhat indistinct or blurry.  The subject also takes up a large area of the photo, which goes against the contest guidelines.  Cute little baby though!!!</td>', 'This image is somewhat indistinct or blurry.  The subject also takes up a large area of the photo, which goes against the contest guidelines.  Cute little baby though!!!', '2005-04-27 23:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335767, 170473, 23278, '<td valign="top">Sorry, takes up too much of the image. It is a nice shot, just not quite what I interpreted the challenge to mean.</td>', 'Sorry, takes up too much of the image. It is a nice shot, just not quite what I interpreted the challenge to mean.', '2005-04-27 23:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335768, 169480, 23278, '<td valign="top">Another rubber ducky shot! :) Nice lighting.</td>', 'Another rubber ducky shot! :) Nice lighting.', '2005-04-27 23:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335770, 169007, 36235, '<td valign="top">Great use of black and white.  Very good composition, both with regard to aligning the horse nicely in the rule of thirds grid, and also with regard to having just the right amount of interesting things in the background: not too much to pull the focus away from the horse, but not too little as to make the entire picture boring.</td>', 'Great use of black and white.  Very good composition, both with regard to aligning the horse nicely in the rule of thirds grid, and also with regard to having just the right amount of interesting things in the background: not too much to pull the focus away from the horse, but not too little as to make the entire picture boring.', '2005-04-27 23:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335772, 171271, 35513, '<td valign="top">This image is blurry and out of focus.  The shadows around the subject call some attention to it, but in general there isn''t anything to direct the eye.</td>', 'This image is blurry and out of focus.  The shadows around the subject call some attention to it, but in general there isn''t anything to direct the eye.', '2005-04-27 23:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335773, 171136, 33361, '<td valign="top">this is very nice except for the red splotchy thing on the right side of image...6</td>', 'this is very nice except for the red splotchy thing on the right side of image...6', '2005-04-27 23:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335774, 169482, 23278, '<td valign="top">Nice. Focus is soft though.</td>', 'Nice. Focus is soft though.', '2005-04-27 23:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335775, 169606, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice composition with beautiful colors but it begs a sharper subject. The colors are otherwise very soothing and even mystical. Bumping up.</td>', 'This is a very nice composition with beautiful colors but it begs a sharper subject. The colors are otherwise very soothing and even mystical. Bumping up.', '2005-04-27 23:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335777, 170835, 35513, '<td valign="top">some interesting use of filters.....but this photo doesn''t meet the guidelines for the contest.  I like the subject, but it''s much too large to fit the contest parameters.</td>', 'some interesting use of filters.....but this photo doesn''t meet the guidelines for the contest.  I like the subject, but it''s much too large to fit the contest parameters.', '2005-04-27 23:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335778, 170811, 23278, '<td valign="top">A blue lady bug!?! Is it sad and depressed? Really nice lighting and fits the challenge quite well.</td>', 'A blue lady bug!?! Is it sad and depressed? Really nice lighting and fits the challenge quite well.', '2005-04-27 23:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1335779, 170125, 36235, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great statue, but isn''t lit well enough.  Took me a while to figure out exactly what it is that I''m looking at.</td>', 'Looks like a great statue, but isn''t lit well enough.  Took me a while to figure out exactly what it is that I''m looking at.', '2005-04-27 23:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
