(1336078, 169817, 36235, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept but I don''t think the photo does enough to make the puzzle piece the center of focus.  Perhaps it would work better if the puzzle was darker than the last piece, and maybe if the composition placed the last piece more toward the center of the photo.</td>', 'I really like the concept but I don''t think the photo does enough to make the puzzle piece the center of focus.  Perhaps it would work better if the puzzle was darker than the last piece, and maybe if the composition placed the last piece more toward the center of the photo.', '2005-04-28 00:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
