(1336133, 171190, 36235, '<td valign="top">Amazing concept.  Wonderful creativity.  Only thing for me that subtracts from the photo is the artifacts at the bottom of the image that keep the wall from being perfectly flat.</td>', 'Amazing concept.  Wonderful creativity.  Only thing for me that subtracts from the photo is the artifacts at the bottom of the image that keep the wall from being perfectly flat.', '2005-04-28 01:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
