(1336454, 170109, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea. An interesting backdrop that does make the hurdle stand out. I''m thinking that maybe the shot would be stronger though if the hurdle were not so tight in the corner, seems to need a little space to breath.</td>', 'This is a good idea. An interesting backdrop that does make the hurdle stand out. I''m thinking that maybe the shot would be stronger though if the hurdle were not so tight in the corner, seems to need a little space to breath.', '2005-04-28 03:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336455, 171217, 35467, '<td valign="top">I find the shadow not strong enough to be a focal point, so not meeting the challenge. But I think the clouds do it for you instead, the formations are amazing while still a small part of the photo, my 2 cents worth, cheers and good luck</td>', 'I find the shadow not strong enough to be a focal point, so not meeting the challenge. But I think the clouds do it for you instead, the formations are amazing while still a small part of the photo, my 2 cents worth, cheers and good luck', '2005-04-28 03:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
