(1336577, 169303, 26526, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph''s tone. Interesting pov used. Strange focus, blurred foreground and blurred background, focus on the chair, kind of. It works for me. Tells a story. I am a real push-over for "chair" photos.</td>', 'I like this photograph''s tone. Interesting pov used. Strange focus, blurred foreground and blurred background, focus on the chair, kind of. It works for me. Tells a story. I am a real push-over for "chair" photos.', '2005-04-28 05:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
