(1336585, 169761, 32161, '<td valign="top">the child give the shot great perspective, I just wish she wasnt quite so dark. great framing. this is a very, very nice photo. brilliant.<br/>this is one of my top scores for the challenge.</td>', 'the child give the shot great perspective, I just wish she wasnt quite so dark. great framing. this is a very, very nice photo. brilliant.this is one of my top scores for the challenge.', '2005-04-28 05:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
