(1336632, 171312, 35467, '<td valign="top">Yummmmmmmm</td>', 'Yummmmmmmm', '2005-04-28 05:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336644, 171244, 31947, '<td valign="top">nice composition ... i like it !</td>', 'nice composition ... i like it !', '2005-04-28 06:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336654, 169429, 35467, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2005-04-28 06:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336655, 171249, 35467, '<td valign="top">Interesting....</td>', 'Interesting....', '2005-04-28 06:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336661, 169355, 34192, '<td valign="top">Honestly, I think the orange could be toned down just a little bit.  But, I think this is the best of what I have seen in the challenge so I am bumping this to a 10.  The simplicity works and I think it captures the spirit of the challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'Honestly, I think the orange could be toned down just a little bit.  But, I think this is the best of what I have seen in the challenge so I am bumping this to a 10.  The simplicity works and I think it captures the spirit of the challenge.  Good luck!', '2005-04-28 06:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336663, 171045, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the best in the challange but I am partial to B&amp;W.  Most voters seem not to be.  Good luck with this excellent capture.  10 from me!</td>', 'I think this is one of the best in the challange but I am partial to B&W.  Most voters seem not to be.  Good luck with this excellent capture.  10 from me!', '2005-04-28 06:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336665, 169135, 34192, '<td valign="top">Simple, in focus, great colors and not a flat background.  I have the same plant but its still brown.  and no ladybugs. sigh... The ladybug looks slightly over saturated but the lighting makes up for it.  One of the top images in the challenge for me.  10  Good luck!</td>', 'Simple, in focus, great colors and not a flat background.  I have the same plant but its still brown.  and no ladybugs. sigh... The ladybug looks slightly over saturated but the lighting makes up for it.  One of the top images in the challenge for me.  10  Good luck!', '2005-04-28 06:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336666, 170314, 35467, '<td valign="top">The hand is a bit distracting, good pic</td>', 'The hand is a bit distracting, good pic', '2005-04-28 06:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336669, 170429, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think the conversion of this image is excellent.  But, I hate all the white.  A little more detail in the background would have gotten you a 10.  9 from me on an excellent image.  Good luck!</td>', 'I think the conversion of this image is excellent.  But, I hate all the white.  A little more detail in the background would have gotten you a 10.  9 from me on an excellent image.  Good luck!', '2005-04-28 06:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336670, 171363, 34192, '<td valign="top">There are probably many voters who think this should be in color.  Not me.  I am glad you converted it - I think the depth and tonal range you got from B&amp;W pushes this image into the top 5 for this challenge.  there is so much more detail than you would ordinarily see in the play of shadows and reflection.  10 for an excellently executed image.  Good luck!</td>', 'There are probably many voters who think this should be in color.  Not me.  I am glad you converted it - I think the depth and tonal range you got from B&W pushes this image into the top 5 for this challenge.  there is so much more detail than you would ordinarily see in the play of shadows and reflection.  10 for an excellently executed image.  Good luck!', '2005-04-28 06:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336671, 170983, 35467, '<td valign="top">A bit small! Good entry</td>', 'A bit small! Good entry', '2005-04-28 06:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336672, 170715, 34192, '<td valign="top">Simple. If it weren''t for the blown areas in the middle row, this would have gotten a 10 from me.  But the originality and execution deserve at least a 9.  So here it is.</td>', 'Simple. If it weren''t for the blown areas in the middle row, this would have gotten a 10 from me.  But the originality and execution deserve at least a 9.  So here it is.', '2005-04-28 06:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336674, 170109, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Excellent presentation.  Great vision.  The only thing holding this back is the trash, though I am sure you heard this before.  9 for having the eye to find excellent detail in the simplist of places.</td>', 'Wow.  Excellent presentation.  Great vision.  The only thing holding this back is the trash, though I am sure you heard this before.  9 for having the eye to find excellent detail in the simplist of places.', '2005-04-28 06:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336675, 170874, 35467, '<td valign="top">very nice photo</td>', 'very nice photo', '2005-04-28 06:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336676, 169329, 34192, '<td valign="top">Well executed.  Great color juxtaposition.  The only thing holding this back from a higher score is the POV.  I think.  Not sure if it would work better slightly lower/straight on or not.  The knob has a funny tint that resembles skin - your arm perhaps? 8 from me.  While I like the shot and believe its well done, its not quite there for me.</td>', 'Well executed.  Great color juxtaposition.  The only thing holding this back from a higher score is the POV.  I think.  Not sure if it would work better slightly lower/straight on or not.  The knob has a funny tint that resembles skin - your arm perhaps? 8 from me.  While I like the shot and believe its well done, its not quite there for me.', '2005-04-28 06:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336678, 170835, 7531, '<td valign="top">Ok, well I''m going to be critical about this image, 1 It''s certainly doesn''t represent any form of minimalism whatsoever. Maybe that was your intention? Secondly you have applied an artistic filter which although may add or subtract to the photo, does not do it any justice given it''s obvious lack of meeting challenge criteria. <br/> <br/>I suspect that this is a religious or philosophical interpretation of the challenge, now, I am not one to judge, but for my money photography is visual and when one participates in a challenge with a title for minimalism, the least you can do is try to present something that meets it.</td>', 'Ok, well I''m going to be critical about this image, 1 It''s certainly doesn''t represent any form of minimalism whatsoever. Maybe that was your intention? Secondly you have applied an artistic filter which although may add or subtract to the photo, does not do it any justice given it''s obvious lack of meeting challenge criteria.  I suspect that this is a religious or philosophical interpretation of the challenge, now, I am not one to judge, but for my money photography is visual and when one participates in a challenge with a title for minimalism, the least you can do is try to present something that meets it.', '2005-04-28 07:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336679, 168963, 34192, '<td valign="top">While this image is simple and beautiful and well placed, there is something missing for me.  Maybe if he was on the right side of the image, this would be resolved.  I don''t know.  The detail at a distance is captured well.  I have no emotional attachment to the image, but that is a personal thing - can''t reach everyone!  9 from me!</td>', 'While this image is simple and beautiful and well placed, there is something missing for me.  Maybe if he was on the right side of the image, this would be resolved.  I don''t know.  The detail at a distance is captured well.  I have no emotional attachment to the image, but that is a personal thing - can''t reach everyone!  9 from me!', '2005-04-28 07:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336680, 171074, 35467, '<td valign="top">Superb photo, not sure in regard to this challenge as photographer not a strong subject compared to the rest of the shot.</td>', 'Superb photo, not sure in regard to this challenge as photographer not a strong subject compared to the rest of the shot.', '2005-04-28 07:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336682, 169916, 34192, '<td valign="top">Typically I really hate it when parts of things are amputated to create an image (people''s feet are my pet peeve).  However, in this case, I think it works.  I think this is probably the first image that successfully portrays a dandelion as a monument.  Yes, to me they look regal and noble and enduring.  Not an easy thing to do.  If the image had been slightly sharper with regard to the head of the dandelions, I would have scored this higher. 9 from me!  Good luck!</td>', 'Typically I really hate it when parts of things are amputated to create an image (people''s feet are my pet peeve).  However, in this case, I think it works.  I think this is probably the first image that successfully portrays a dandelion as a monument.  Yes, to me they look regal and noble and enduring.  Not an easy thing to do.  If the image had been slightly sharper with regard to the head of the dandelions, I would have scored this higher. 9 from me!  Good luck!', '2005-04-28 07:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336683, 170873, 34192, '<td valign="top">If the left side of the image could have been lightened just a hair this image would have scored higher.  This darkness hides details I would have loved to see.   I like hte light on the tree - pulls your eye to the tree.  8</td>', 'If the left side of the image could have been lightened just a hair this image would have scored higher.  This darkness hides details I would have loved to see.   I like hte light on the tree - pulls your eye to the tree.  8', '2005-04-28 07:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336685, 169980, 35467, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo even outside of this challenge this photo would stand on its own, well done</td>', 'Very nice photo even outside of this challenge this photo would stand on its own, well done', '2005-04-28 07:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336686, 169522, 29474, '<td valign="top">Took me a couple of minutes to figure out what this is. Could be a bit under-exposed.</td>', 'Took me a couple of minutes to figure out what this is. Could be a bit under-exposed.', '2005-04-28 07:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336687, 171346, 35467, '<td valign="top">This would look awesome in color</td>', 'This would look awesome in color', '2005-04-28 07:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336695, 171326, 35467, '<td valign="top">My 2cents worth is you have sold your self short by going black and white, color version would have been right up there. Good luck anyway</td>', 'My 2cents worth is you have sold your self short by going black and white, color version would have been right up there. Good luck anyway', '2005-04-28 07:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336698, 171193, 30857, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting picture, and the title sure helps to clarify what/who is the main subject of the picture, and what is the background. <br/> <br/>Reflections on the water are amazing, Good luck on the challenge :))</td>', 'This is a very interesting picture, and the title sure helps to clarify what/who is the main subject of the picture, and what is the background.  Reflections on the water are amazing, Good luck on the challenge :))', '2005-04-28 07:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336701, 170766, 36616, '<td valign="top">nice concept - too indistinct</td>', 'nice concept - too indistinct', '2005-04-28 07:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336703, 170719, 30857, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot !!!<br/>Maybe too much neat image?</td>', 'Amazing shot !!!Maybe too much neat image?', '2005-04-28 07:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336705, 169656, 30857, '<td valign="top">Beautiful details and texture on the flower, wonderful bokeh as background, lovely colours ... this is one of my favorites for the challenge ... Good Luck!!</td>', 'Beautiful details and texture on the flower, wonderful bokeh as background, lovely colours ... this is one of my favorites for the challenge ... Good Luck!!', '2005-04-28 07:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
