(1336868, 171249, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty good shot, good DOF and colours are quite good.  However, I have seen so many similar Peacock shots that this isn´t particularly interesting for me personally.  You need something original to appeal to me but still very well done technically and the composition is good so I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Pretty good shot, good DOF and colours are quite good.  However, I have seen so many similar Peacock shots that this isn´t particularly interesting for me personally.  You need something original to appeal to me but still very well done technically and the composition is good so I gave it a 7.', '2005-04-28 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1336874, 169041, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea but the backround is irritatingly drawing way too much attention.  IMHO you either need a bigger aperture or a longher focal length to decrease the DOF to not include the backround as much or a smaller aperture to include all of it.  As it is you can make out way too much about the backround but still not enough to make out details and that really draws the eye away from the fly.  Better luck next time.</td>', 'Not a bad idea but the backround is irritatingly drawing way too much attention.  IMHO you either need a bigger aperture or a longher focal length to decrease the DOF to not include the backround as much or a smaller aperture to include all of it.  As it is you can make out way too much about the backround but still not enough to make out details and that really draws the eye away from the fly.  Better luck next time.', '2005-04-28 09:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
