(1337119, 171180, 19952, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for shots showing boats on stll water, but this is a particularly good one. You did a great job with the reflection and with capturing the fog. I''m not sure the trees above ground add anything to this shot, so you might want to consider cropping them out since the water with only the boat and reflections is really gorgeous. Very nicely done!</td>', 'I''m a sucker for shots showing boats on stll water, but this is a particularly good one. You did a great job with the reflection and with capturing the fog. I''m not sure the trees above ground add anything to this shot, so you might want to consider cropping them out since the water with only the boat and reflections is really gorgeous. Very nicely done!', '2005-04-28 10:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337120, 171262, 34481, '<td valign="top">Cool take on a dandelion (sort of done to death).  I like the contracting tones combined with the subtle difference in tones between the little parachutes and the sky.  If cloning were allowed, I would take out that little leaf on the stem.</td>', 'Cool take on a dandelion (sort of done to death).  I like the contracting tones combined with the subtle difference in tones between the little parachutes and the sky.  If cloning were allowed, I would take out that little leaf on the stem.', '2005-04-28 10:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
