(1337191, 170843, 27482, '<td valign="top">Ohh...  The thumbnail looked so very promising but the image quality is pretty bad in this image so I rated it fairly low.  The composition is pretty good though and I like the purple colour but the noise is just dreadful and it is just frankly lacking in picture quality.  Did you resize it yourself?  If no, then you should probably look at the tutorial on how to prepare your shot for challenges and how to use save for web.  If yes and if you meant this shot to be this way then just ignore me for it is simply not to my taste.  Good effort though.</td>', 'Ohh...  The thumbnail looked so very promising but the image quality is pretty bad in this image so I rated it fairly low.  The composition is pretty good though and I like the purple colour but the noise is just dreadful and it is just frankly lacking in picture quality.  Did you resize it yourself?  If no, then you should probably look at the tutorial on how to prepare your shot for challenges and how to use save for web.  If yes and if you meant this shot to be this way then just ignore me for it is simply not to my taste.  Good effort though.', '2005-04-28 10:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
