(1337315, 169276, 34059, '<td valign="top">oh I love this one! on the roof in front of my window there is a pair of seagulls, with their nest and eggs (I''m waiting to see the newborn...) and I tried to do a picture like this, but the result was very poor, the roof is too far for my camera lenses and pixels  :) I''m telling you this to explain my strong emotive response to this picture which makes me liking it very very much! on the technical side, I''m not an expert, but I think the colors are great, focus and definition are fine, the size of the bird compared to the whole picture is absolutely perfect, for me. 10! and good luck ;)</td>', 'oh I love this one! on the roof in front of my window there is a pair of seagulls, with their nest and eggs (I''m waiting to see the newborn...) and I tried to do a picture like this, but the result was very poor, the roof is too far for my camera lenses and pixels  :) I''m telling you this to explain my strong emotive response to this picture which makes me liking it very very much! on the technical side, I''m not an expert, but I think the colors are great, focus and definition are fine, the size of the bird compared to the whole picture is absolutely perfect, for me. 10! and good luck ;)', '2005-04-28 11:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
