(1337395, 171291, 1202, '<td valign="top">With the direct angle of your shot the grid work in the glass has a dizzying effect on this viewer.  I might suggest that you take it from different angles to see what the effects might be.  You meet the challenge well, but it lacks much interest as is.</td>', 'With the direct angle of your shot the grid work in the glass has a dizzying effect on this viewer.  I might suggest that you take it from different angles to see what the effects might be.  You meet the challenge well, but it lacks much interest as is.', '2005-04-28 11:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
