(1337403, 169573, 37031, '<td valign="top">I''m jealous of this guy</td>', 'I''m jealous of this guy', '2005-04-28 11:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337407, 169875, 35645, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but none of it is really clear and in focus. This might have worked a little better for me if she had been in a different position or doing something rather than just standing with her back to the door.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but none of it is really clear and in focus. This might have worked a little better for me if she had been in a different position or doing something rather than just standing with her back to the door.', '2005-04-28 11:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337410, 171093, 1202, '<td valign="top">A very "telling" picture.  The subject might be too large for this challenge to get many big votes, but it is a great photo.  If the challenge were "Candid" I would give a definite 10, but in this one 6.</td>', 'A very "telling" picture.  The subject might be too large for this challenge to get many big votes, but it is a great photo.  If the challenge were "Candid" I would give a definite 10, but in this one 6.', '2005-04-28 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337416, 170541, 1202, '<td valign="top">My aye is drawn to the shadows and shapes of the background and find the bright orange area to be only distracting.</td>', 'My aye is drawn to the shadows and shapes of the background and find the bright orange area to be only distracting.', '2005-04-28 11:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337417, 169815, 35645, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this is one of those shots that really doesn''t ''speak'' to me. I don''t like the overall hue - I would have preferred this in color or in a less purply B&amp;W (keep in mind that my monitor may differ from yours). The highlights on the right hand side distract from the spider, and while I know it''s difficult to capture them sometimes, the spider would have been much clearer had you been able to catch it sitting still.</td>', 'Unfortunately this is one of those shots that really doesn''t ''speak'' to me. I don''t like the overall hue - I would have preferred this in color or in a less purply B&W (keep in mind that my monitor may differ from yours). The highlights on the right hand side distract from the spider, and while I know it''s difficult to capture them sometimes, the spider would have been much clearer had you been able to catch it sitting still.', '2005-04-28 11:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337418, 171326, 34838, '<td valign="top">Great pic, One of the best ones I''ve seen.</td>', 'Great pic, One of the best ones I''ve seen.', '2005-04-28 11:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337424, 169454, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, but I''m not sure where to look.... there''s too many choices for me to sort through as to what the main subject is. Water seems a little oversaturated, even though it''s a beautiful color.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, but I''m not sure where to look.... there''s too many choices for me to sort through as to what the main subject is. Water seems a little oversaturated, even though it''s a beautiful color.', '2005-04-28 11:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337426, 170421, 34838, '<td valign="top">Good idea. the string is a little distracting.</td>', 'Good idea. the string is a little distracting.', '2005-04-28 11:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337434, 169135, 34838, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice pic except for the red dots at the top of the pic.</td>', 'It''s a nice pic except for the red dots at the top of the pic.', '2005-04-28 11:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337436, 169135, 7531, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, not sure which subject graps my focus though, the plant or the ladybird??</td>', 'Nice capture, not sure which subject graps my focus though, the plant or the ladybird??', '2005-04-28 11:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337438, 171267, 35645, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge definition beautifully. Would like to see a little more light on the snail, and maybe a little less blue - even his body has a blue cast to it, and I don''t think I''ve ever seen a blue snail!! :)</td>', 'Meets the challenge definition beautifully. Would like to see a little more light on the snail, and maybe a little less blue - even his body has a blue cast to it, and I don''t think I''ve ever seen a blue snail!! :)', '2005-04-28 11:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337442, 171259, 1202, '<td valign="top">I think you met the challenge, but the main subject is so uninteresting that you might as well have just left it out. Just my opinion and others might score it higher.</td>', 'I think you met the challenge, but the main subject is so uninteresting that you might as well have just left it out. Just my opinion and others might score it higher.', '2005-04-28 11:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337443, 171333, 37031, '<td valign="top">doses anyone ealse feel lonely?</td>', 'doses anyone ealse feel lonely?', '2005-04-28 11:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337447, 171154, 35645, '<td valign="top">Seems to meet the challenge description, but the dried stems (vines?) are distracting and take some of the focus from the dandelions.</td>', 'Seems to meet the challenge description, but the dried stems (vines?) are distracting and take some of the focus from the dandelions.', '2005-04-28 11:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337449, 171261, 37031, '<td valign="top">very creative</td>', 'very creative', '2005-04-28 11:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337450, 169445, 34838, '<td valign="top">I think you should have used a different background to make the flowers stand out better.</td>', 'I think you should have used a different background to make the flowers stand out better.', '2005-04-28 11:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337453, 170541, 35645, '<td valign="top">Not sure where I should be looking. I find my eye pulled by the shadows and lines as much as by the bright spot in the bottom left.</td>', 'Not sure where I should be looking. I find my eye pulled by the shadows and lines as much as by the bright spot in the bottom left.', '2005-04-28 11:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337454, 168994, 37031, '<td valign="top">cool picture</td>', 'cool picture', '2005-04-28 11:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337456, 170610, 7531, '<td valign="top">I would like to be constructive about the effort, but I am struggling with this shot to see it''s relevance to the challenge. Firstly an array of objects draw my attention, so I cannot focus on any single object. Secondly, this seems to be happening a lot in this challenge, regarding interpretation of minimalism, but this is certainly not it.</td>', 'I would like to be constructive about the effort, but I am struggling with this shot to see it''s relevance to the challenge. Firstly an array of objects draw my attention, so I cannot focus on any single object. Secondly, this seems to be happening a lot in this challenge, regarding interpretation of minimalism, but this is certainly not it.', '2005-04-28 11:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337459, 170501, 1202, '<td valign="top">Excellent, and so very simple.  Without the shadows there would be no background, but with them the background is as big as the world. Super, a 10 from me.</td>', 'Excellent, and so very simple.  Without the shadows there would be no background, but with them the background is as big as the world. Super, a 10 from me.', '2005-04-28 11:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337461, 170392, 37031, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2005-04-28 11:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337463, 170905, 35645, '<td valign="top">Background is too busy. Perhaps if the car had been in an empty parking lot (not likely, I know) or against a grassy hill or smooth faced building this would have fit the challenge better.</td>', 'Background is too busy. Perhaps if the car had been in an empty parking lot (not likely, I know) or against a grassy hill or smooth faced building this would have fit the challenge better.', '2005-04-28 11:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337466, 171337, 37031, '<td valign="top">a bit literal.....  I LIKE IT</td>', 'a bit literal.....  I LIKE IT', '2005-04-28 11:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337469, 171045, 327, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked and looked at this shot. It''s go such a good, lonely, lost feeling. I really admire this work. You really have a great eye. Wonderful.</td>', 'I''ve looked and looked at this shot. It''s go such a good, lonely, lost feeling. I really admire this work. You really have a great eye. Wonderful.', '2005-04-28 11:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337474, 169382, 327, '<td valign="top">Real unique and fun.</td>', 'Real unique and fun.', '2005-04-28 11:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337476, 169259, 1202, '<td valign="top">On my monitor it looks much oversaturated.  You met the challenge well, but lost the detail in post processing.</td>', 'On my monitor it looks much oversaturated.  You met the challenge well, but lost the detail in post processing.', '2005-04-28 11:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337478, 169975, 327, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit dark...but hey maybe you wanted it that way. Still I think the white balance/levels could use adjusting. Good-luck.</td>', 'Looks a bit dark...but hey maybe you wanted it that way. Still I think the white balance/levels could use adjusting. Good-luck.', '2005-04-28 11:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337481, 170409, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I think your subject is a bit too much to the left of the frame.  This view makes it look like an almost missed shot more than a well composed one.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I think your subject is a bit too much to the left of the frame.  This view makes it look like an almost missed shot more than a well composed one.', '2005-04-28 11:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337490, 169978, 1202, '<td valign="top">Boy, that is some murky water.  It might have been better without a frame, already dull and you added the black frame.  Alright shot but not high in interest for me.</td>', 'Boy, that is some murky water.  It might have been better without a frame, already dull and you added the black frame.  Alright shot but not high in interest for me.', '2005-04-28 11:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337491, 169922, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice bold colors. Sharp image. But, it doesn''t meet the challenge very well. The subject should occupy a "very small portion" of the image space. The cut up cards seem to be the subject, and they occupy nearly the whole frame.</td>', 'Nice bold colors. Sharp image. But, it doesn''t meet the challenge very well. The subject should occupy a "very small portion" of the image space. The cut up cards seem to be the subject, and they occupy nearly the whole frame.', '2005-04-28 11:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337492, 171174, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and interesting patterns. Meets the challenge.</td>', 'Great contrast and interesting patterns. Meets the challenge.', '2005-04-28 11:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337496, 169481, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice bold colors, smooth creamy feel to it, simple clean composition. Meets the challenge. I like it.</td>', 'Nice bold colors, smooth creamy feel to it, simple clean composition. Meets the challenge. I like it.', '2005-04-28 12:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337498, 170429, 23865, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  I''d like to know how you got the background so nicely washed out.</td>', 'Great photo.  I''d like to know how you got the background so nicely washed out.', '2005-04-28 12:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337500, 170856, 1202, '<td valign="top">I didn''t even look at the title and I started singing Home on the Range. Nice shot, you could have even been closr to the subject.</td>', 'I didn''t even look at the title and I started singing Home on the Range. Nice shot, you could have even been closr to the subject.', '2005-04-28 12:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337506, 171112, 23865, '<td valign="top">Great Depth of field and nice perspective</td>', 'Great Depth of field and nice perspective', '2005-04-28 12:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337507, 170023, 16230, '<td valign="top">Way too much going on in this image to be considered minimalist.<br/> <br/>Seriously, good idea! I like it! :)<br/></td>', 'Way too much going on in this image to be considered minimalist. Seriously, good idea! I like it! :)', '2005-04-28 12:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337508, 171194, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool composition. I like how the eye is looking slightly up, towards the open space created in the upper right of the image. Meets the challenge. Good focus on the eye, good contrast. The border is the weakest part IMO. It''s a little too wide maybe, and the grey line blends into the person''s nose because it''s the same shade of grey. Still a great image.</td>', 'Cool composition. I like how the eye is looking slightly up, towards the open space created in the upper right of the image. Meets the challenge. Good focus on the eye, good contrast. The border is the weakest part IMO. It''s a little too wide maybe, and the grey line blends into the person''s nose because it''s the same shade of grey. Still a great image.', '2005-04-28 12:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337513, 170473, 16230, '<td valign="top">My first thought was "a snake with legs!" :) Very nice!</td>', 'My first thought was "a snake with legs!" :) Very nice!', '2005-04-28 12:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337514, 170313, 23865, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors of this photo.  Great job!</td>', 'I really like the colors of this photo.  Great job!', '2005-04-28 12:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337516, 168831, 1202, '<td valign="top">IMO this is way too small.  There is no detail, and very little is left to draw this viewers interest.</td>', 'IMO this is way too small.  There is no detail, and very little is left to draw this viewers interest.', '2005-04-28 12:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337524, 169262, 16230, '<td valign="top">Nice composition!</td>', 'Nice composition!', '2005-04-28 12:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337526, 170826, 30315, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. My 10. Great shot, focus and composition!</td>', 'Beautiful. My 10. Great shot, focus and composition!', '2005-04-28 12:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337527, 169706, 1202, '<td valign="top">Perfect!  Super blend of interesting background and common subject, to make an overall interesting photo.</td>', 'Perfect!  Super blend of interesting background and common subject, to make an overall interesting photo.', '2005-04-28 12:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337531, 169538, 16230, '<td valign="top">Nice action capture, but too much going on for minimalism. Perhaps if you had captured the skater by himself with just the sky behind him? It''s a good shot though.</td>', 'Nice action capture, but too much going on for minimalism. Perhaps if you had captured the skater by himself with just the sky behind him? It''s a good shot though.', '2005-04-28 12:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337533, 169852, 35751, '<td valign="top">Kind of plain in my opinion</td>', 'Kind of plain in my opinion', '2005-04-28 12:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337535, 170552, 35751, '<td valign="top">I like the photo overall but I have a hard time figuring out what is the main subject.</td>', 'I like the photo overall but I have a hard time figuring out what is the main subject.', '2005-04-28 12:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337536, 169706, 20662, '<td valign="top">I like this -- it has the simplicity that many of the others are missing. God Luck!</td>', 'I like this -- it has the simplicity that many of the others are missing. God Luck!', '2005-04-28 12:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337537, 169586, 16230, '<td valign="top">The flyer alone over the ocean might have fit the challenge criteria better. Nice shot though.</td>', 'The flyer alone over the ocean might have fit the challenge criteria better. Nice shot though.', '2005-04-28 12:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337540, 170623, 35751, '<td valign="top">I think this meets the challenge well. good job.</td>', 'I think this meets the challenge well. good job.', '2005-04-28 12:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337541, 169790, 1202, '<td valign="top">I feel the subject is "too out of the frame", and your angle is directed too much into the ground.  More of both subject and background needed for me.</td>', 'I feel the subject is "too out of the frame", and your angle is directed too much into the ground.  More of both subject and background needed for me.', '2005-04-28 12:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337542, 169916, 16230, '<td valign="top">Why two dandelions? I think that one would have been more minimalist. Very nice image though.</td>', 'Why two dandelions? I think that one would have been more minimalist. Very nice image though.', '2005-04-28 12:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337543, 169794, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot, but the subject is supposed to be the strong point (the white puffy dandylion is), but occupy only "a very small portion of the image space". Which it doesn''t, it fills almost the entire frame.</td>', 'I like this one a lot, but the subject is supposed to be the strong point (the white puffy dandylion is), but occupy only "a very small portion of the image space". Which it doesn''t, it fills almost the entire frame.', '2005-04-28 12:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337544, 169790, 35751, '<td valign="top">cute photo, i think this meets the challenge.</td>', 'cute photo, i think this meets the challenge.', '2005-04-28 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337545, 169500, 35751, '<td valign="top">I really like the image this creates.  The flower is very sharp! great job.</td>', 'I really like the image this creates.  The flower is very sharp! great job.', '2005-04-28 12:10:32.000000', NULL, 1);
