(1337571, 171224, 25787, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Nice shot.  Too bad there are so many tracks in the sand.  You probably couldn''t do much about that though.  6</td>', 'Good idea. Nice shot.  Too bad there are so many tracks in the sand.  You probably couldn''t do much about that though.  6', '2005-04-28 12:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
