(1337574, 168963, 27482, '<td valign="top">A nice tribute to "cowspace" that was in negative space a while ago and one of the favorites on the site.  Anyway, needs something more to make me gaze in wonderment but it´s very nice and I gave it a 7, I especially like the offbeat composition and the way that he is heading out of the frame instead of into the frame as is the "rule".</td>', 'A nice tribute to "cowspace" that was in negative space a while ago and one of the favorites on the site.  Anyway, needs something more to make me gaze in wonderment but it´s very nice and I gave it a 7, I especially like the offbeat composition and the way that he is heading out of the frame instead of into the frame as is the "rule".', '2005-04-28 12:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337576, 171077, 35751, '<td valign="top">Simple and clean. good job.</td>', 'Simple and clean. good job.', '2005-04-28 12:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1337578, 170392, 35751, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset and colors but i don''t see a strong subject tht stands out.</td>', 'Nice sunset and colors but i don''t see a strong subject tht stands out.', '2005-04-28 12:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
