(1337591, 170878, 25787, '<td valign="top">Is this for the jewelery challenge or the tack challenge?  But seriously, I guess by your title that its a diamond, but it is a little confusing what you are trying to portay.  Technique, lighting and composition are good.</td>', 'Is this for the jewelery challenge or the tack challenge?  But seriously, I guess by your title that its a diamond, but it is a little confusing what you are trying to portay.  Technique, lighting and composition are good.', '2005-04-28 12:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
