(1337597, 170722, 35751, '<td valign="top">I like the texture pictured. I think it would have been a stronger photo with out the glare on the side of the cut photograph.</td>', 'I like the texture pictured. I think it would have been a stronger photo with out the glare on the side of the cut photograph.', '2005-04-28 12:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
