(1337703, 170615, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good, I like this. You''ve reduced the necessary information used to portray your subject to an absolute minimum, I would say. The concentric pattern of the light is key, and that pin is clear although its nothing more than pure black and white. strong compositionally also - feels like you''ve paid attention to the fine details, all of which stuff I would suggest is requiite for minimalism.</td>', 'Good, I like this. You''ve reduced the necessary information used to portray your subject to an absolute minimum, I would say. The concentric pattern of the light is key, and that pin is clear although its nothing more than pure black and white. strong compositionally also - feels like you''ve paid attention to the fine details, all of which stuff I would suggest is requiite for minimalism.', '2005-04-28 12:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
