(1337755, 169552, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong work to retain that ddetail in the moon; and I like also that  your chosen landscape is so very plain. I don''t like, for this challenge, the enormous graininess of the sky, however: it seems to go against the ''full control'' element that is so often a hallmark of minimalism. But it''s an interesting approach, certainly.</td>', 'Strong work to retain that ddetail in the moon; and I like also that  your chosen landscape is so very plain. I don''t like, for this challenge, the enormous graininess of the sky, however: it seems to go against the ''full control'' element that is so often a hallmark of minimalism. But it''s an interesting approach, certainly.', '2005-04-28 13:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
