(1337842, 169658, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong colours, good composition - the semi-percieved lines in the grass work well. The vignetting is useful too. I think I might have been tempted to get a touch closer, personally, to play up the contrast of texture too, if possible - I think you could afford to be a touch more orange in this challenge. It''s difficult to decide whether I like it or not - I shall come back to it.</td>', 'Strong colours, good composition - the semi-percieved lines in the grass work well. The vignetting is useful too. I think I might have been tempted to get a touch closer, personally, to play up the contrast of texture too, if possible - I think you could afford to be a touch more orange in this challenge. It''s difficult to decide whether I like it or not - I shall come back to it.', '2005-04-28 13:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
