(1338194, 169325, 8970, '<td valign="top">The filter used on the ship makes it look less appealing.  The image should have been left to show the ship detail.</td>', 'The filter used on the ship makes it look less appealing.  The image should have been left to show the ship detail.', '2005-04-28 14:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
