(1338198, 170873, 15982, '<td valign="top">E-Rock, I have an awesome picture of that tree as well! The rotten limbs are slowly falling off of it more and more.  Would like to see the pink in the granite a little more and the white of the tree trunk a little more though, but I''m sure you lose the interest in the sky. But a very surreal picture overall!! 8</td>', 'E-Rock, I have an awesome picture of that tree as well! The rotten limbs are slowly falling off of it more and more.  Would like to see the pink in the granite a little more and the white of the tree trunk a little more though, but I''m sure you lose the interest in the sky. But a very surreal picture overall!! 8', '2005-04-28 14:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
