(1339685, 171112, 33732, '<td valign="top">Was there movement in this photo?</td>', 'Was there movement in this photo?', '2005-04-28 20:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339686, 170752, 17837, '<td valign="top">It looks as if you have used flash for this shot. Flash (when used correctly) can be very eye pleasing. <br/> <br/>You covered the topic very well. I think I would like to see this photo as a High Key shot. Or even further, maybe a single light source (It looks like you''ve used two lights here, one above camera right, and one camera left @ lens height to give the more drastic shadow) I think having both shadows takes away from the flower. Also I would of tried to rid the right corner of the dark area.<br/> <br/>To be repetitive, I think this would make a fantastic high key shot.</td>', 'It looks as if you have used flash for this shot. Flash (when used correctly) can be very eye pleasing.  You covered the topic very well. I think I would like to see this photo as a High Key shot. Or even further, maybe a single light source (It looks like you''ve used two lights here, one above camera right, and one camera left @ lens height to give the more drastic shadow) I think having both shadows takes away from the flower. Also I would of tried to rid the right corner of the dark area. To be repetitive, I think this would make a fantastic high key shot.', '2005-04-28 20:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339687, 171121, 35746, '<td valign="top">this is a cute idea but i might have taken out the trees in the back.....i was eyeing my matchbox partridge family bus for this challenge.....good luck</td>', 'this is a cute idea but i might have taken out the trees in the back.....i was eyeing my matchbox partridge family bus for this challenge.....good luck', '2005-04-28 20:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339688, 170157, 33732, '<td valign="top">This would be average for the frame and the solid black above does not add.</td>', 'This would be average for the frame and the solid black above does not add.', '2005-04-28 20:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339690, 170817, 33732, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and placement of the subject.</td>', 'I like the composition and placement of the subject.', '2005-04-28 20:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339691, 170392, 33732, '<td valign="top">Diffused.</td>', 'Diffused.', '2005-04-28 20:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339693, 170540, 31409, '<td valign="top">At first glance, it looked like an animal left a surprise, but I realise it was bees! Hope they didn''t sting you. Nice plain shot though.</td>', 'At first glance, it looked like an animal left a surprise, but I realise it was bees! Hope they didn''t sting you. Nice plain shot though.', '2005-04-28 20:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339694, 171293, 33732, '<td valign="top">I like the subject but smaller would have been better.</td>', 'I like the subject but smaller would have been better.', '2005-04-28 20:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339695, 169253, 33732, '<td valign="top">Interesting materials behind the ring.</td>', 'Interesting materials behind the ring.', '2005-04-28 20:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339697, 169347, 17837, '<td valign="top">I like this image very much, though I would have set it up differently I think. I am only assuming this man was helping you, as there doesnt seem to be much to walk to where you are. I would have put the rainbow on the upper left corner thirds quadrant, but kept the man in the center. I think this would make the image stronger. Also perhaps a polarizer to darken up the sky. One other thing I would have done would have been to crop the bottom a little more, taking the horizon away from the middle of the image. Good job though. 6</td>', 'I like this image very much, though I would have set it up differently I think. I am only assuming this man was helping you, as there doesnt seem to be much to walk to where you are. I would have put the rainbow on the upper left corner thirds quadrant, but kept the man in the center. I think this would make the image stronger. Also perhaps a polarizer to darken up the sky. One other thing I would have done would have been to crop the bottom a little more, taking the horizon away from the middle of the image. Good job though. 6', '2005-04-28 20:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339698, 171309, 17837, '<td valign="top">Lightpainting? I dont see the entire key...</td>', 'Lightpainting? I dont see the entire key...', '2005-04-28 20:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339700, 170806, 33732, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  What about the depth of field?</td>', 'Nice subject.  What about the depth of field?', '2005-04-28 20:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339701, 170809, 33732, '<td valign="top">This is what I would expect from the assignment.</td>', 'This is what I would expect from the assignment.', '2005-04-28 20:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
