(1339718, 169480, 35746, '<td valign="top">its amazing how i feel this inanimate object staring at me....i like the set up and the shot...good luck</td>', 'its amazing how i feel this inanimate object staring at me....i like the set up and the shot...good luck', '2005-04-28 20:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339719, 170570, 17837, '<td valign="top">Your title is blue sky, though the subject here should be the cloud.  You completed the challenge description, however I just can''t seem to find the subject stand out at me. It doesnt scream "hey look at me again and again".</td>', 'Your title is blue sky, though the subject here should be the cloud.  You completed the challenge description, however I just can''t seem to find the subject stand out at me. It doesnt scream "hey look at me again and again".', '2005-04-28 20:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339722, 171118, 33732, '<td valign="top">I had to look.  Nice size and I can still tell what the focal subject is in the photo.</td>', 'I had to look.  Nice size and I can still tell what the focal subject is in the photo.', '2005-04-28 20:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339728, 170429, 30669, '<td valign="top">This is GREAT...10</td>', 'This is GREAT...10', '2005-04-28 20:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339729, 171190, 17837, '<td valign="top">The lighting in the image is very flat, and as a result the entire image has suffered from it. It was clever how you used a mirror on the wall to reflect off a mirror you are holding to reflect the clock on the wall. Based on technicalities, I would only give this a 4, though you''re cleverness has bumped it to a 5. Good luck.</td>', 'The lighting in the image is very flat, and as a result the entire image has suffered from it. It was clever how you used a mirror on the wall to reflect off a mirror you are holding to reflect the clock on the wall. Based on technicalities, I would only give this a 4, though you''re cleverness has bumped it to a 5. Good luck.', '2005-04-28 20:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339732, 169346, 35746, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful calming shot.....i really enjoyed viewing it</td>', 'this is a beautiful calming shot.....i really enjoyed viewing it', '2005-04-28 20:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339734, 171136, 1024, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors, wonderful use of leading lines</td>', 'Gorgeous colors, wonderful use of leading lines', '2005-04-28 20:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339736, 170775, 17837, '<td valign="top">It seems you have under exposed by about 2/3''s to even a full stop. After the challenge, I would try boosting the levels or exposure if you shoot in raw. Perhaps not so much contrast either would possibly work here.</td>', 'It seems you have under exposed by about 2/3''s to even a full stop. After the challenge, I would try boosting the levels or exposure if you shoot in raw. Perhaps not so much contrast either would possibly work here.', '2005-04-28 20:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339739, 171344, 8284, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Nicely framed.  Too noisy.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Nicely framed.  Too noisy.', '2005-04-28 20:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339740, 170563, 35746, '<td valign="top">nice shot and a really nice choice of tones</td>', 'nice shot and a really nice choice of tones', '2005-04-28 20:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339741, 171069, 17837, '<td valign="top">Love the dramatic lighting, the lighting on the beet (is that a beet?) is wonderful. Not exactly sure what the other piece of food is, and im not even sure I would have included that. Regardless, I like the image. Good luck. 7</td>', 'Love the dramatic lighting, the lighting on the beet (is that a beet?) is wonderful. Not exactly sure what the other piece of food is, and im not even sure I would have included that. Regardless, I like the image. Good luck. 7', '2005-04-28 20:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339742, 170802, 35746, '<td valign="top">this is well done and a true definition of the challenge</td>', 'this is well done and a true definition of the challenge', '2005-04-28 20:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339744, 170397, 31606, '<td valign="top">This would do a lot better if were not dark.</td>', 'This would do a lot better if were not dark.', '2005-04-28 20:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339745, 170846, 17837, '<td valign="top">this image looks like you took this inside and shot it with a Tungsten light. Is this correct? I feel the colors are warm, perhaps a change in White balance, or a color shift is in order.</td>', 'this image looks like you took this inside and shot it with a Tungsten light. Is this correct? I feel the colors are warm, perhaps a change in White balance, or a color shift is in order.', '2005-04-28 20:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339748, 171341, 1024, '<td valign="top">Without the border this would have been a 10.  Unfortunately I find the border to be very distracting.  Do love the photo though.  Nice use of black and white</td>', 'Without the border this would have been a 10.  Unfortunately I find the border to be very distracting.  Do love the photo though.  Nice use of black and white', '2005-04-28 20:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339749, 169913, 31606, '<td valign="top">The shadow ruins it for me.</td>', 'The shadow ruins it for me.', '2005-04-28 20:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1339752, 170873, 30669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2005-04-28 20:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
