(1339755, 171165, 17837, '<td valign="top">I like the image, I think this is a great display of the topic at hand.<br/> <br/>Two things however bother me...<br/> <br/>1. The streak of exhaust goes into the border. I would crop the image, then add to the canvas a white and then add again a black. This will prevent the streak from going into the border.<br/> <br/>2. Why is the sky black? <br/> <br/>As is, I give it a 6.</td>', 'I like the image, I think this is a great display of the topic at hand. Two things however bother me... 1. The streak of exhaust goes into the border. I would crop the image, then add to the canvas a white and then add again a black. This will prevent the streak from going into the border. 2. Why is the sky black?  As is, I give it a 6.', '2005-04-28 20:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
