(1339908, 170838, 1024, '<td valign="top">very good photo, I love the feeling of isolation of your model.  The fact that she is looking out of the frame mirrors this feeling.  Good luck!</td>', 'very good photo, I love the feeling of isolation of your model.  The fact that she is looking out of the frame mirrors this feeling.  Good luck!', '2005-04-28 21:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
