(1340539, 170536, 24272, '<td valign="top">Since you brought the 7 into the title, I think it should be in focus too.  Also, the bricks on the left seem to be blown out.</td>', 'Since you brought the 7 into the title, I think it should be in focus too.  Also, the bricks on the left seem to be blown out.', '2005-04-29 00:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340540, 171362, 24272, '<td valign="top">nice colors, nice lighting, but maybe a little too soft.</td>', 'nice colors, nice lighting, but maybe a little too soft.', '2005-04-29 00:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340564, 169480, 9589, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  The way the duck seems to be looking at the camera add some life to it.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  The way the duck seems to be looking at the camera add some life to it.', '2005-04-29 00:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340570, 170446, 9589, '<td valign="top">Very simple and peaceful.  The person could appear to be any size and it would look normal because not much else gives this any sense of dimension.</td>', 'Very simple and peaceful.  The person could appear to be any size and it would look normal because not much else gives this any sense of dimension.', '2005-04-29 00:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340574, 169614, 15511, '<td valign="top">The front view would be more interesting, but I surmise that it had a poor background. Perhaps some flash for fill-in lighting.</td>', 'The front view would be more interesting, but I surmise that it had a poor background. Perhaps some flash for fill-in lighting.', '2005-04-29 00:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340577, 171356, 15511, '<td valign="top">Nice. I''d have cropped the object on the right.</td>', 'Nice. I''d have cropped the object on the right.', '2005-04-29 00:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340578, 170409, 9589, '<td valign="top">This looks disorienting, almost like the subject is pasted into this.  I don''t know about the composition either.</td>', 'This looks disorienting, almost like the subject is pasted into this.  I don''t know about the composition either.', '2005-04-29 00:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340580, 171127, 15511, '<td valign="top">Must be stumbling on 7 legs. I like the creativity.</td>', 'Must be stumbling on 7 legs. I like the creativity.', '2005-04-29 00:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340585, 169785, 9589, '<td valign="top">You''ve made it look very flat and simplified, which I think makes it more appropriate for this challenge than if you could see reflections on the glass.  Now I''m thirsty.</td>', 'You''ve made it look very flat and simplified, which I think makes it more appropriate for this challenge than if you could see reflections on the glass.  Now I''m thirsty.', '2005-04-29 00:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340591, 171341, 36920, '<td valign="top">great photo<br/></td>', 'great photo', '2005-04-29 00:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340593, 171281, 9589, '<td valign="top">A little boring.  I think the fact that much of the photo is overexposed only hinders the rest.</td>', 'A little boring.  I think the fact that much of the photo is overexposed only hinders the rest.', '2005-04-29 00:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340596, 171064, 23278, '<td valign="top">Nice work. I would have used a much smaller border, but this is a great shot.</td>', 'Nice work. I would have used a much smaller border, but this is a great shot.', '2005-04-29 00:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340597, 171341, 23278, '<td valign="top">Pretty photo, border is too much.</td>', 'Pretty photo, border is too much.', '2005-04-29 00:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340598, 171367, 9589, '<td valign="top">I wish that all the plants were gone and all you could see was sand in it''s place, but the rest of the photo is pretty good.</td>', 'I wish that all the plants were gone and all you could see was sand in it''s place, but the rest of the photo is pretty good.', '2005-04-29 00:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340599, 171277, 24272, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but my eye was first drawn to the leaves...</td>', 'Nice photo, but my eye was first drawn to the leaves...', '2005-04-29 00:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340601, 171212, 37116, '<td valign="top">I like the composition!</td>', 'I like the composition!', '2005-04-29 00:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340604, 171045, 36528, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Perhaps would have considered cropping more off the top, but then you would have lost some of the sense of hight which is an appealing factor. Well done - one of the better entries I have come across so far.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Perhaps would have considered cropping more off the top, but then you would have lost some of the sense of hight which is an appealing factor. Well done - one of the better entries I have come across so far.', '2005-04-29 00:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340605, 171198, 9589, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea, even though it might be a little cliche, but I think that when all you have in a photo is one light source, you should use it as effectively as possible.  This just looks like someone holding a lamp to me.</td>', 'It''s a good idea, even though it might be a little cliche, but I think that when all you have in a photo is one light source, you should use it as effectively as possible.  This just looks like someone holding a lamp to me.', '2005-04-29 00:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340607, 170314, 14735, '<td valign="top">NOt sure if I like the hand in the refelction or not. Nice shot though, good lighting.</td>', 'NOt sure if I like the hand in the refelction or not. Nice shot though, good lighting.', '2005-04-29 00:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340610, 169573, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice and sffective visual with subject approaching the ebb. Bumping up.</td>', 'Very nice and sffective visual with subject approaching the ebb. Bumping up.', '2005-04-29 00:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340611, 169059, 22734, '<td valign="top">A nice caoture and well focused. A pleasing composition. Bumping up.</td>', 'A nice caoture and well focused. A pleasing composition. Bumping up.', '2005-04-29 00:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340614, 171286, 14735, '<td valign="top">I like the detail in the forground grass and the light falling on the house is very good for this shot. 8</td>', 'I like the detail in the forground grass and the light falling on the house is very good for this shot. 8', '2005-04-29 00:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340616, 170610, 15511, '<td valign="top">Good clarity, the colors could use some saturation, particularly the red. <br/>Looks like Northern California...</td>', 'Good clarity, the colors could use some saturation, particularly the red. Looks like Northern California...', '2005-04-29 00:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340618, 171082, 9589, '<td valign="top">Nice focus.  I like how the wall loses all texture to the right.  I don''t like such a long shadow though.</td>', 'Nice focus.  I like how the wall loses all texture to the right.  I don''t like such a long shadow though.', '2005-04-29 00:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340620, 171017, 37116, '<td valign="top">Captured an excellent view &amp; perfect minimalism--10</td>', 'Captured an excellent view & perfect minimalism--10', '2005-04-29 00:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340625, 170715, 36528, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The blown out highlights concern me. I would have preferred to see the blood droplet completely framed - perhaps it was intentional to crop off the left wire - just a personal preference. Overall an solid entry for this challange in my view.</td>', 'Nice idea. The blown out highlights concern me. I would have preferred to see the blood droplet completely framed - perhaps it was intentional to crop off the left wire - just a personal preference. Overall an solid entry for this challange in my view.', '2005-04-29 00:46:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1340627, 171124, 9589, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure you could have found a better angle for this.</td>', 'I''m pretty sure you could have found a better angle for this.', '2005-04-29 00:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340628, 169135, 24272, '<td valign="top">too bad you caught a little lens flare in the upper left corner.  Focus also seems to be a little off on the lady bug, but maybe some detail was just lost in down sizing.</td>', 'too bad you caught a little lens flare in the upper left corner.  Focus also seems to be a little off on the lady bug, but maybe some detail was just lost in down sizing.', '2005-04-29 00:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340629, 171277, 14735, '<td valign="top">The hanging branch over powers the squirrel which I believe to be your main subject. The branch is a bit large for minimalism, but still a very good shot. 6</td>', 'The hanging branch over powers the squirrel which I believe to be your main subject. The branch is a bit large for minimalism, but still a very good shot. 6', '2005-04-29 00:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340631, 171218, 8367, '<td valign="top">Great job. I love your framing and nice subject choice. bumping up</td>', 'Great job. I love your framing and nice subject choice. bumping up', '2005-04-29 00:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340633, 170439, 9589, '<td valign="top">Good concept, using a light as darkness.</td>', 'Good concept, using a light as darkness.', '2005-04-29 00:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340635, 170833, 24272, '<td valign="top">Too busy for the category.</td>', 'Too busy for the category.', '2005-04-29 00:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340636, 170847, 36920, '<td valign="top">great idea</td>', 'great idea', '2005-04-29 00:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340639, 171044, 36528, '<td valign="top">There was another similar entry to this and I will say the same thing: I think the image could have been enhanced with a subject on the hill such as a person, horse, building etc. I do like the cloud formations and the colour in the sky.</td>', 'There was another similar entry to this and I will say the same thing: I think the image could have been enhanced with a subject on the hill such as a person, horse, building etc. I do like the cloud formations and the colour in the sky.', '2005-04-29 00:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340640, 170805, 14735, '<td valign="top">Not sure what is your main subject here. If it is the blue button it does not stand out. The slight red is a bit of a distraction and the buttons are a bit over exposed.</td>', 'Not sure what is your main subject here. If it is the blue button it does not stand out. The slight red is a bit of a distraction and the buttons are a bit over exposed.', '2005-04-29 00:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340642, 170906, 24272, '<td valign="top">Blown highlights and I feel the light in the background distracts from the photo too.  Maybe waiting another 30 minutes to take the picture would have helped.</td>', 'Blown highlights and I feel the light in the background distracts from the photo too.  Maybe waiting another 30 minutes to take the picture would have helped.', '2005-04-29 00:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340643, 168831, 9589, '<td valign="top">Probably one of the most minimalist photos submitted.  If technical definition is what wins challenges, you''ve got a good shot.</td>', 'Probably one of the most minimalist photos submitted.  If technical definition is what wins challenges, you''ve got a good shot.', '2005-04-29 00:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340645, 170220, 36920, '<td valign="top">great.. looks like it''s walkin on water</td>', 'great.. looks like it''s walkin on water', '2005-04-29 00:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340646, 171270, 17837, '<td valign="top">the image is very very dark though I feel you meant for it that way.</td>', 'the image is very very dark though I feel you meant for it that way.', '2005-04-29 00:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340648, 171101, 36920, '<td valign="top">beautiful color contrast</td>', 'beautiful color contrast', '2005-04-29 00:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340649, 170439, 14735, '<td valign="top">Good compostion but the photo lacks any power to it. The sky needs more color or a more dramatic cloud cover. The post should be better lit.</td>', 'Good compostion but the photo lacks any power to it. The sky needs more color or a more dramatic cloud cover. The post should be better lit.', '2005-04-29 00:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340650, 170536, 15511, '<td valign="top">It''s great that you were able to capture the cat looking at something like cats do when they see an interesting object.<br/>There''s an unusual color cast to the image; this makes it look unnatural.</td>', 'It''s great that you were able to capture the cat looking at something like cats do when they see an interesting object.There''s an unusual color cast to the image; this makes it look unnatural.', '2005-04-29 00:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340652, 171299, 9589, '<td valign="top">Now up to bat, the worlds shortest player...<br/>Nice composition.</td>', 'Now up to bat, the worlds shortest player...Nice composition.', '2005-04-29 00:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340653, 171212, 36920, '<td valign="top">elegance &amp; candid</td>', 'elegance & candid', '2005-04-29 00:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340656, 170753, 17837, '<td valign="top">I dont feel the hair is the subject here, but more so the nose ring is. even so, you meet the topic. I think I would of cropped out the negative space as you dont really need it.</td>', 'I dont feel the hair is the subject here, but more so the nose ring is. even so, you meet the topic. I think I would of cropped out the negative space as you dont really need it.', '2005-04-29 00:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340657, 170976, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very cool image and creative composition'' The jagged network is great. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very cool image and creative composition'' The jagged network is great. Bumping up.', '2005-04-29 00:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340658, 171044, 24272, '<td valign="top">Very surreal looking clouds, but the clouds add too much to the photo.  I''m sure if Mother Nature would have cooperated and given you a clear day... :)</td>', 'Very surreal looking clouds, but the clouds add too much to the photo.  I''m sure if Mother Nature would have cooperated and given you a clear day... :)', '2005-04-29 00:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340660, 170937, 14735, '<td valign="top">That''s a silly question, follow the sign. I like the light in this shot, makes your subject stand out.</td>', 'That''s a silly question, follow the sign. I like the light in this shot, makes your subject stand out.', '2005-04-29 00:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340661, 169787, 9589, '<td valign="top">Good capture, but I don''t like the placement of the seed on the edge of the photo.</td>', 'Good capture, but I don''t like the placement of the seed on the edge of the photo.', '2005-04-29 00:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340663, 169135, 30608, '<td valign="top">Execellent Job in both meeting the challenge. The composition is great. Good job and good luck. 10</td>', 'Execellent Job in both meeting the challenge. The composition is great. Good job and good luck. 10', '2005-04-29 00:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340664, 170589, 36920, '<td valign="top">challenge concept well captured...great job</td>', 'challenge concept well captured...great job', '2005-04-29 00:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340666, 169783, 24272, '<td valign="top">I''m looking for a hotel room.... <br/> <br/>Couldn''t resist ;)  Bonus point for making me laugh!</td>', 'I''m looking for a hotel room....  Couldn''t resist ;)  Bonus point for making me laugh!', '2005-04-29 00:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340668, 171363, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great subject contained in this great vastness. The shadow adds an acute interest to complete the image. Good work. Bumping up.</td>', 'Great subject contained in this great vastness. The shadow adds an acute interest to complete the image. Good work. Bumping up.', '2005-04-29 00:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340669, 171340, 17837, '<td valign="top">The exposure in this is all wrong. The grass is way under exposed, the flower is over exposed. The only way you can change that is if you shed more light on to the grass to try and even out the exposure.</td>', 'The exposure in this is all wrong. The grass is way under exposed, the flower is over exposed. The only way you can change that is if you shed more light on to the grass to try and even out the exposure.', '2005-04-29 00:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340670, 170639, 14735, '<td valign="top">Wish the glove did not have the weed on it, but that could not be helped. The color and shadow make a good impact in this photo. The subject stands out well.</td>', 'Wish the glove did not have the weed on it, but that could not be helped. The color and shadow make a good impact in this photo. The subject stands out well.', '2005-04-29 00:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
