(1340679, 171112, 24272, '<td valign="top">Like the shot, but maybe a half a step to the right putting the helmet between the two players might help.  Where the helmet is in this shot is too distracting, my eye keeps going to the helmet.</td>', 'Like the shot, but maybe a half a step to the right putting the helmet between the two players might help.  Where the helmet is in this shot is too distracting, my eye keeps going to the helmet.', '2005-04-29 00:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340680, 171271, 22734, '<td valign="top">The old belly button. Of course there are two ways to go here: one is dead focus on the subject (the button) with a wide aperture to soften the upper part of the body or go for the controversial soft focus. Personally, I would have gone for the sharp because the skin tonal values are flat lit, that is, no overbearing shadows to detract. But, hey, the concept is good and you get one bump from 5 to 6.</td>', 'The old belly button. Of course there are two ways to go here: one is dead focus on the subject (the button) with a wide aperture to soften the upper part of the body or go for the controversial soft focus. Personally, I would have gone for the sharp because the skin tonal values are flat lit, that is, no overbearing shadows to detract. But, hey, the concept is good and you get one bump from 5 to 6.', '2005-04-29 00:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340681, 170419, 9589, '<td valign="top">Is that water in motion or ice on the end of the flower?  Nice shot.</td>', 'Is that water in motion or ice on the end of the flower?  Nice shot.', '2005-04-29 00:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
