(1340768, 171018, 6999, '<td valign="top">I somehow always think of minimalism being more stern than this - not so lighthearted. I don''t really know why, possibly because it seems such a cery intellectual philosophy. This is great though - image <i>and</i> title.</td>', 'I somehow always think of minimalism being more stern than this - not so lighthearted. I don''t really know why, possibly because it seems such a cery intellectual philosophy. This is great though - image and title.', '2005-04-29 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
