(1340824, 169945, 6999, '<td valign="top">Too extreme for my taste as an abstract, and lacking even the richness of shade that might have made me want to stop and look at it much, I''m afraid. I think you could have enhanced the impact of the whole image with some judicious brighness work - but I can''t pretend to be understanding of this approach, so must presume this is exactly what you wanted.</td>', 'Too extreme for my taste as an abstract, and lacking even the richness of shade that might have made me want to stop and look at it much, I''m afraid. I think you could have enhanced the impact of the whole image with some judicious brighness work - but I can''t pretend to be understanding of this approach, so must presume this is exactly what you wanted.', '2005-04-29 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
