(1340844, 170727, 6999, '<td valign="top">A very fine exposure/processing. Lovely detail and definition of the progression of light here. Can''t quite bring myself to acccept it as minimalism - there''s just too much going on. Though in another sense, of course, there''s only very simple processes, adding up to this complexity, which is entirely the remit of minimalism. I rest confused.</td>', 'A very fine exposure/processing. Lovely detail and definition of the progression of light here. Can''t quite bring myself to acccept it as minimalism - there''s just too much going on. Though in another sense, of course, there''s only very simple processes, adding up to this complexity, which is entirely the remit of minimalism. I rest confused.', '2005-04-29 01:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
