(1340945, 171291, 20324, '<td valign="top">interesting concept. I think i would have given this a border (i love borders). did you prepare this yourself, or was it like that already? (8)</td>', 'interesting concept. I think i would have given this a border (i love borders). did you prepare this yourself, or was it like that already? (8)', '2005-04-29 02:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
