(1340955, 170394, 20324, '<td valign="top">very nice atmosphere and composition. its too soft for my taste. what is that thing in the middle of the water? (7)</td>', 'very nice atmosphere and composition. its too soft for my taste. what is that thing in the middle of the water? (7)', '2005-04-29 02:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
