(1340966, 171165, 20324, '<td valign="top">i like it. very simplistic. but the grain bothers me as do the lines caught by the border. (8)</td>', 'i like it. very simplistic. but the grain bothers me as do the lines caught by the border. (8)', '2005-04-29 02:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340967, 170623, 36604, '<td valign="top">A light, trying vainly to fill the darkness.  I normally don''t care for monotone backgrounds, but this works well.</td>', 'A light, trying vainly to fill the darkness.  I normally don''t care for monotone backgrounds, but this works well.', '2005-04-29 02:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340969, 170809, 36965, '<td valign="top">crop out the bench and tree and would be much "more" minimal , hehehe</td>', 'crop out the bench and tree and would be much "more" minimal , hehehe', '2005-04-29 02:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340972, 171316, 36604, '<td valign="top">That''s a really colorful tongue!  The shot makes me smile, and wonder what the dog is thinking.  I like the framing of this as well.  Adding the eyes would have detracted from the image, I think, and there is enough texture in the background to keep it from being tedious.</td>', 'That''s a really colorful tongue!  The shot makes me smile, and wonder what the dog is thinking.  I like the framing of this as well.  Adding the eyes would have detracted from the image, I think, and there is enough texture in the background to keep it from being tedious.', '2005-04-29 02:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340973, 169135, 20324, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites in this challenge. the reflections/blotches in the upper part of the picture are distracting. but i''ll still give you a 10 for compostition, color, theme appropriateness.</td>', 'one of my favorites in this challenge. the reflections/blotches in the upper part of the picture are distracting. but i''ll still give you a 10 for compostition, color, theme appropriateness.', '2005-04-29 02:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
