(1340995, 169834, 20324, '<td valign="top">even though the lawn looks over-saturated, i like it. the city background is distracting from the park scenery. (7)</td>', 'even though the lawn looks over-saturated, i like it. the city background is distracting from the park scenery. (7)', '2005-04-29 02:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1340997, 169355, 36965, '<td valign="top">My Favorite !</td>', 'My Favorite !', '2005-04-29 02:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341001, 170877, 36604, '<td valign="top">Image seems slightly out of focus and the highlights seem blown on the light reflection, but the image reflection is nice, and the light against the background gives it just enough shading to make it interesting.  Overall, it''s a nice effect.</td>', 'Image seems slightly out of focus and the highlights seem blown on the light reflection, but the image reflection is nice, and the light against the background gives it just enough shading to make it interesting.  Overall, it''s a nice effect.', '2005-04-29 02:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341004, 170944, 20324, '<td valign="top">i like the lines and b&amp;w. did you consider cropping it above the line (on the floor) and making it square? perhaps a black border as well? (you see, i like borders :) ) 9</td>', 'i like the lines and b&w. did you consider cropping it above the line (on the floor) and making it square? perhaps a black border as well? (you see, i like borders :) ) 9', '2005-04-29 02:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341010, 170478, 20324, '<td valign="top">nice conceptual abstract. i like the colors, and the various textures. i know that you couldnt for this challenge, but i would clone out some imperfections/spots in the wood. and maybe a border would help. (10)</td>', 'nice conceptual abstract. i like the colors, and the various textures. i know that you couldnt for this challenge, but i would clone out some imperfections/spots in the wood. and maybe a border would help. (10)', '2005-04-29 02:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341015, 171342, 20324, '<td valign="top">the subject is similar to my picture. i like the colors, but the positioning / angle the picture was taken at.</td>', 'the subject is similar to my picture. i like the colors, but the positioning / angle the picture was taken at.', '2005-04-29 02:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341017, 171073, 36965, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot !!</td>', 'Awesome shot !!', '2005-04-29 02:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341019, 169385, 36604, '<td valign="top">Background is both harsh on the eyes and boring, and the mouse seems out of focus.  Making the mouse a little bit larger might have helped.</td>', 'Background is both harsh on the eyes and boring, and the mouse seems out of focus.  Making the mouse a little bit larger might have helped.', '2005-04-29 02:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341021, 169308, 20324, '<td valign="top">i like the texture, softness and mood. i dont get the title. i would crop it shorted from the top. (7)</td>', 'i like the texture, softness and mood. i dont get the title. i would crop it shorted from the top. (7)', '2005-04-29 02:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341023, 170976, 20324, '<td valign="top">interesting duo-tone. i like the angle this was taken at. it''s like the edge of the world.</td>', 'interesting duo-tone. i like the angle this was taken at. it''s like the edge of the world.', '2005-04-29 02:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341024, 169304, 36604, '<td valign="top">That is a truly ugly shade.  Was the ground really that color, or did you manipulate it?  The orange ring is kind of nice, but the subject is too small to make out any detail.</td>', 'That is a truly ugly shade.  Was the ground really that color, or did you manipulate it?  The orange ring is kind of nice, but the subject is too small to make out any detail.', '2005-04-29 02:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341026, 169817, 36604, '<td valign="top">A very nice idea, but not enough draws the eye to the final piece, other than the title.  I would have suggested shooting from one side, going for a very narrow depth of field, to bring that piece into sharper focus, and the rest of the puzzle blurring out.  Also, the left side seems a bit too bright, and glares somewhat.</td>', 'A very nice idea, but not enough draws the eye to the final piece, other than the title.  I would have suggested shooting from one side, going for a very narrow depth of field, to bring that piece into sharper focus, and the rest of the puzzle blurring out.  Also, the left side seems a bit too bright, and glares somewhat.', '2005-04-29 02:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341027, 171018, 20324, '<td valign="top">nice refraction. i like the colors of the water. perfect composition. is there a hidden meaning? (10)</td>', 'nice refraction. i like the colors of the water. perfect composition. is there a hidden meaning? (10)', '2005-04-29 02:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341029, 169969, 36604, '<td valign="top">A nice concept, and the eye is naturally drawn to it.</td>', 'A nice concept, and the eye is naturally drawn to it.', '2005-04-29 02:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341030, 169059, 20324, '<td valign="top">i wish the tail wasnt cut off, but other wise, a very good clear picture (8)</td>', 'i wish the tail wasnt cut off, but other wise, a very good clear picture (8)', '2005-04-29 02:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341032, 171278, 36604, '<td valign="top">The bright white of the table is a little harsh on the eyes, but the overall effect of white and black probably couldn''t be done without that happening.  Nice concept.  Something bothers me about the framing, but I''m not quite sure what, like the cup should either be closer to one side or at the center, but I can''t say exactly why.</td>', 'The bright white of the table is a little harsh on the eyes, but the overall effect of white and black probably couldn''t be done without that happening.  Nice concept.  Something bothers me about the framing, but I''m not quite sure what, like the cup should either be closer to one side or at the center, but I can''t say exactly why.', '2005-04-29 02:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341034, 169355, 20324, '<td valign="top">i like it alot, but i would crop it in a square. very nice warm golden colors and a beautiful capture of the bird. (9)</td>', 'i like it alot, but i would crop it in a square. very nice warm golden colors and a beautiful capture of the bird. (9)', '2005-04-29 02:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341037, 171309, 20324, '<td valign="top">very cool and original. i love the tones and somber feel. (10)</td>', 'very cool and original. i love the tones and somber feel. (10)', '2005-04-29 02:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341038, 171127, 36604, '<td valign="top">A very nice concept, and amusing.  The color glare on the screen provides an interesting background without being distracting or too harsh, and the spider is in good focus, with interesting colors and translucency.</td>', 'A very nice concept, and amusing.  The color glare on the screen provides an interesting background without being distracting or too harsh, and the spider is in good focus, with interesting colors and translucency.', '2005-04-29 02:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341040, 169971, 36604, '<td valign="top">The pure black background is dull.  Having at least a slight hint of cloud light or some dim stars would have helped break it up without being too distracting.  On the other hand, that''s a really nice shot of the moon.</td>', 'The pure black background is dull.  Having at least a slight hint of cloud light or some dim stars would have helped break it up without being too distracting.  On the other hand, that''s a really nice shot of the moon.', '2005-04-29 02:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341042, 169786, 20324, '<td valign="top">very interesting.  good composition and positioning. simple but effective (10)</td>', 'very interesting.  good composition and positioning. simple but effective (10)', '2005-04-29 02:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341045, 169561, 20324, '<td valign="top">it reminds me of one of my pictures. simplistic. but i wish the whole glass was in the picture. and probably a different tone of the yellow background wouldn''t hurt. (7)</td>', 'it reminds me of one of my pictures. simplistic. but i wish the whole glass was in the picture. and probably a different tone of the yellow background wouldn''t hurt. (7)', '2005-04-29 02:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341046, 170879, 36604, '<td valign="top">Bizarre, surreal colors, noisy background, and slightly out of focus image.  Try using Noise Ninja or some equivalent to clear up the background, and hue adjustment if the shot actually came out this way normally.</td>', 'Bizarre, surreal colors, noisy background, and slightly out of focus image.  Try using Noise Ninja or some equivalent to clear up the background, and hue adjustment if the shot actually came out this way normally.', '2005-04-29 02:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341050, 171085, 36604, '<td valign="top">Hidden is not so good in a minimalism challenge, where the eye should be naturally drawn to the subject.  That''s kind of the point of minimalism.</td>', 'Hidden is not so good in a minimalism challenge, where the eye should be naturally drawn to the subject.  That''s kind of the point of minimalism.', '2005-04-29 02:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341054, 169348, 20324, '<td valign="top">is this supposed to be minimalistic in the meaning? explanation please. im confused.</td>', 'is this supposed to be minimalistic in the meaning? explanation please. im confused.', '2005-04-29 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341057, 171344, 35764, '<td valign="top">would have been geat if that red car wasn''t there.</td>', 'would have been geat if that red car wasn''t there.', '2005-04-29 02:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341060, 170269, 20324, '<td valign="top">although i love borders, i dont like this one. the picture is beautiful, but it feels trapped in the heavy black border. very nice curvature and sky. nice composition (9)<br/>coming back, i cant resist giving you a 10</td>', 'although i love borders, i dont like this one. the picture is beautiful, but it feels trapped in the heavy black border. very nice curvature and sky. nice composition (9)coming back, i cant resist giving you a 10', '2005-04-29 02:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341066, 170430, 8292, '<td valign="top">it''s beautiful how this young child looks like a wise old man</td>', 'it''s beautiful how this young child looks like a wise old man', '2005-04-29 02:52:35.000000', NULL, 1);
