(1341336, 170715, 36722, '<td valign="top">I don''t really know why this photograph is not as absolutely brilliant as it could have been. The idea is great, the drops are wonderfully shiny. Maybe the red drop is placed in a too "static" place - I think it''s too close to the (vertical) middle. Wonderful photo all the same.</td>', 'I don''t really know why this photograph is not as absolutely brilliant as it could have been. The idea is great, the drops are wonderfully shiny. Maybe the red drop is placed in a too "static" place - I think it''s too close to the (vertical) middle. Wonderful photo all the same.', '2005-04-29 04:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
