(1341443, 169320, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very good indeed!  This is a very nice shot, still not breathtaking and lacks that "wow" factor for me personally but it would look good in a frame up on somebodys wall and I like it, gave it a 8.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very good indeed!  This is a very nice shot, still not breathtaking and lacks that "wow" factor for me personally but it would look good in a frame up on somebodys wall and I like it, gave it a 8.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-29 05:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
