(1341451, 171328, 35517, '<td valign="top">great idea... love the angle and position you have placed the money... 9</td>', 'great idea... love the angle and position you have placed the money... 9', '2005-04-29 05:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341454, 170474, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not that I have any experience taking photographs of airplanes but I have heard that if you use a shutterspeed that is faster than about 1/100-1/150 you "freeze" the propeller as you almost do here and there is something about wierd about the plane because of that, like it´s actually stalling and falling to the ground straight on it´s tail rather than climbing up into the sky.  Composition isn´t bad but could be much better, the centered composition isn´t working here IMHO.  Anyway, good shot, like that you included the ground in the frame and good colours and this is a pretty good shot, at least better than most in the challenge and I gave it a 6.</td>', 'Not that I have any experience taking photographs of airplanes but I have heard that if you use a shutterspeed that is faster than about 1/100-1/150 you "freeze" the propeller as you almost do here and there is something about wierd about the plane because of that, like it´s actually stalling and falling to the ground straight on it´s tail rather than climbing up into the sky.  Composition isn´t bad but could be much better, the centered composition isn´t working here IMHO.  Anyway, good shot, like that you included the ground in the frame and good colours and this is a pretty good shot, at least better than most in the challenge and I gave it a 6.', '2005-04-29 05:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341460, 170867, 31947, '<td valign="top">nice black and white with good composition</td>', 'nice black and white with good composition', '2005-04-29 05:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341467, 170023, 35517, '<td valign="top">great work... love the neutrals tones here... 9</td>', 'great work... love the neutrals tones here... 9', '2005-04-29 06:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341472, 171060, 27482, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 3 and felt you are entitled to an explanation as to why I gave it that score.<br/> <br/>I am sorry but I don´t find this particularly interesting although it fits the challenge.  The composition is way too centered and sometimes that works, but not here IMHO, to the photographs benefit.  That line in the bottom right is out of place and I can´t really connect with it or what it is, is it a power line?  Anyway, so far so good, not really a bad photograph at all and it fits the challenge but then there is that green sky.  I don´t know what part of the world you are in but I have never ever seen a green sky and I must say that I don´t care for it one bit at all...  Ended up giving you a 3 because while this fits the challenge I don´t find it interesting at all and porly composed and then there is that green sky wich really drags down the whole photograph.<br/> <br/>On the positive side this does fit the challenge and that is always good and the idea is not bad at all, just needs better composition, a little bit more clarity as the helicopter is slightly blurred (try using a faster shutter next time) and a more interesting or aesthetically pleasing sky and you would be well on your way.<br/> <br/>Anyway, not trying to offend you so I hope you only take this as one persons opinion.</td>', 'I gave this a 3 and felt you are entitled to an explanation as to why I gave it that score. I am sorry but I don´t find this particularly interesting although it fits the challenge.  The composition is way too centered and sometimes that works, but not here IMHO, to the photographs benefit.  That line in the bottom right is out of place and I can´t really connect with it or what it is, is it a power line?  Anyway, so far so good, not really a bad photograph at all and it fits the challenge but then there is that green sky.  I don´t know what part of the world you are in but I have never ever seen a green sky and I must say that I don´t care for it one bit at all...  Ended up giving you a 3 because while this fits the challenge I don´t find it interesting at all and porly composed and then there is that green sky wich really drags down the whole photograph. On the positive side this does fit the challenge and that is always good and the idea is not bad at all, just needs better composition, a little bit more clarity as the helicopter is slightly blurred (try using a faster shutter next time) and a more interesting or aesthetically pleasing sky and you would be well on your way. Anyway, not trying to offend you so I hope you only take this as one persons opinion.', '2005-04-29 06:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341475, 171284, 8682, '<td valign="top">Just great! I really like it. That´s an interesting idea and it was well executed. I hope you´ll got a good score with this one. Good luck. 10</td>', 'Just great! I really like it. That´s an interesting idea and it was well executed. I hope you´ll got a good score with this one. Good luck. 10', '2005-04-29 06:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341476, 171337, 35517, '<td valign="top">ha ha .. great idea... 10 from me.....</td>', 'ha ha .. great idea... 10 from me.....', '2005-04-29 06:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341480, 170698, 34154, '<td valign="top">i thought about it, sorry</td>', 'i thought about it, sorry', '2005-04-29 06:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341486, 169980, 8682, '<td valign="top">That´s absolutely great! I really love it. Good focus, really good composition, and colours are awesome. I´d like it to see that without the white "smoke" of the right. Good luck in the challenge. 9</td>', 'That´s absolutely great! I really love it. Good focus, really good composition, and colours are awesome. I´d like it to see that without the white "smoke" of the right. Good luck in the challenge. 9', '2005-04-29 06:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341488, 170765, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad Idea and a different take on a, well almost overdone subject.  Like the colours and contrast and tack sharp and the sky is interesting, I assume you used a polarizer and well pretty much techincally well done.  There ist just one thing that still bothers me and that is that even though I have seen it hundreds of times I feel as if this photograph has ben cut in half and the left part is what you used here, what I am trying to say is that I can´t help but want to see the rest of the bridge.  Anyway, like the shot and it´s one of the better ones in the challenge but doesn´t quite hit the spot so I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Not a bad Idea and a different take on a, well almost overdone subject.  Like the colours and contrast and tack sharp and the sky is interesting, I assume you used a polarizer and well pretty much techincally well done.  There ist just one thing that still bothers me and that is that even though I have seen it hundreds of times I feel as if this photograph has ben cut in half and the left part is what you used here, what I am trying to say is that I can´t help but want to see the rest of the bridge.  Anyway, like the shot and it´s one of the better ones in the challenge but doesn´t quite hit the spot so I gave it a 7.', '2005-04-29 06:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341491, 170699, 8682, '<td valign="top">Really good! I love it. That´s one of the most original ideas of this week. I love people who can innovate. 10</td>', 'Really good! I love it. That´s one of the most original ideas of this week. I love people who can innovate. 10', '2005-04-29 06:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
