(1341543, 171093, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well two things really about this shot that made me score a 4 and I felt you were entitled to as why I gave it a low score.  First off, the focus is more on the stairs behind him than on him, he looks slightly in front of the focus point in the image.  Secondly, in my opinion this is off topic, both as the subject isn´t 10-15% of the frame as it was stated and also there is nothing that I percieve as "minimalism" in the shot.  Anyway, don´t get me wrong, I like the shot and had it been in focus and in a "street photography" challenge or something like that I would have scored it probably double what I gave it here or an 8 and I don´t give yout many of those.</td>', 'Well two things really about this shot that made me score a 4 and I felt you were entitled to as why I gave it a low score.  First off, the focus is more on the stairs behind him than on him, he looks slightly in front of the focus point in the image.  Secondly, in my opinion this is off topic, both as the subject isn´t 10-15% of the frame as it was stated and also there is nothing that I percieve as "minimalism" in the shot.  Anyway, don´t get me wrong, I like the shot and had it been in focus and in a "street photography" challenge or something like that I would have scored it probably double what I gave it here or an 8 and I don´t give yout many of those.', '2005-04-29 06:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1341545, 170466, 10390, '<td valign="top">Very well seen motive, but if you would have just cut the shadow at the top off, then this image would be A LOT stronger, just try, maybe you will agree.</td>', 'Very well seen motive, but if you would have just cut the shadow at the top off, then this image would be A LOT stronger, just try, maybe you will agree.', '2005-04-29 06:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
