(1341905, 171333, 35548, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge definition. 0 don''t want to sound mean here but if I didn''t know what the rules were I would say this image is about the clouds.<br/>Meets definition of minimalism.  10   I believe this image puts in simple visual terms what sea and sky can say to the viewer.<br/>Technical.  4 Not enough clarity on the ocean horizon and lots of artifacts.<br/>Artifact. 8 I love this image and only wish it had the detail mentioned above working for it.  I like the mino tone color and admire anybody who can get a striagh horizon line.  If I were you I would do a study of clouds.<br/>Average score.....</td>', 'Meets challenge definition. 0 don''t want to sound mean here but if I didn''t know what the rules were I would say this image is about the clouds.Meets definition of minimalism.  10   I believe this image puts in simple visual terms what sea and sky can say to the viewer.Technical.  4 Not enough clarity on the ocean horizon and lots of artifacts.Artifact. 8 I love this image and only wish it had the detail mentioned above working for it.  I like the mino tone color and admire anybody who can get a striagh horizon line.  If I were you I would do a study of clouds.Average score.....', '2005-04-29 09:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
