(1341984, 170484, 29477, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, however the sky above the horizon is way overproccessed and negatively impacts the image.  The clouds also grab my attention as the strong point rather than the tree.  Good Luck.</td>', 'I like the composition, however the sky above the horizon is way overproccessed and negatively impacts the image.  The clouds also grab my attention as the strong point rather than the tree.  Good Luck.', '2005-04-29 10:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
