(1342023, 171263, 26505, '<td valign="top">nice. I love the fog!  Im not sure about the title..unless it is suposed to say morning...but maybe mooring is a sailor thing that I dont know about! :)</td>', 'nice. I love the fog!  Im not sure about the title..unless it is suposed to say morning...but maybe mooring is a sailor thing that I dont know about! :)', '2005-04-29 10:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342024, 171268, 26505, '<td valign="top">Awsome! Love this! 10+</td>', 'Awsome! Love this! 10+', '2005-04-29 10:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342025, 170071, 35548, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge description. 10<br/>Meets definition of minimalism. 5<br/>Technical. 4<br/>Artistic..............3  subject to close to center of frame.<br/> <br/>Average score, 5</td>', 'Meets challenge description. 10Meets definition of minimalism. 5Technical. 4Artistic..............3  subject to close to center of frame. Average score, 5', '2005-04-29 10:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342027, 169852, 34852, '<td valign="top">Out of focus</td>', 'Out of focus', '2005-04-29 10:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342028, 170275, 29477, '<td valign="top">Very nice compostion, however the focus is a little soft and the horizon needs to be straightened.  With the challenge focusing on your subject being the strong point, the foal gets a little lost being in front of the house.   Maybe a different angle, (i.e. without the house) or a little tigher cropping (for example have the foal framed in the upper right and straighten and crop the image to just above the fence) would have increased the focal point onto the foal.  This along with a little crisper result would improved your result in this challenge IMO.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Very nice compostion, however the focus is a little soft and the horizon needs to be straightened.  With the challenge focusing on your subject being the strong point, the foal gets a little lost being in front of the house.   Maybe a different angle, (i.e. without the house) or a little tigher cropping (for example have the foal framed in the upper right and straighten and crop the image to just above the fence) would have increased the focal point onto the foal.  This along with a little crisper result would improved your result in this challenge IMO.  Good Luck.', '2005-04-29 10:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342029, 169761, 19952, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this photo perfectly embodies the Minimalism challenge. It''s absolutely gorgeous - I can''t think of a single way to improve it.</td>', 'In my opinion, this photo perfectly embodies the Minimalism challenge. It''s absolutely gorgeous - I can''t think of a single way to improve it.', '2005-04-29 10:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342031, 170983, 7466, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Great lighting and nice composition.</td>', 'I like this.  Great lighting and nice composition.', '2005-04-29 10:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342033, 170699, 7466, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but the color is unappealing.</td>', 'Cute idea, but the color is unappealing.', '2005-04-29 10:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342035, 171224, 7466, '<td valign="top">I see where you wanted to go with this shot, but the footprints are too prominent, shifting the focus from the person to the sand.</td>', 'I see where you wanted to go with this shot, but the footprints are too prominent, shifting the focus from the person to the sand.', '2005-04-29 10:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342037, 170125, 7466, '<td valign="top">The lack of detail on the statue and the overall darkness of the shot leaves little of interest for the viewer.</td>', 'The lack of detail on the statue and the overall darkness of the shot leaves little of interest for the viewer.', '2005-04-29 10:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342042, 171212, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great image for this challenge.  I like the fact that you included the entire broken reflection as well as the framing of the image.  Okay...now the criticism.  The focus is soft and will prevent this image from being a ribbon winner IMO. I also find the border takes away from the result.  I still feel it will do better than most entires, however a crisper image would have put a bigger smile on your face.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Great image for this challenge.  I like the fact that you included the entire broken reflection as well as the framing of the image.  Okay...now the criticism.  The focus is soft and will prevent this image from being a ribbon winner IMO. I also find the border takes away from the result.  I still feel it will do better than most entires, however a crisper image would have put a bigger smile on your face.  Good Luck.', '2005-04-29 10:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342052, 171299, 29477, '<td valign="top">I wish the ball wasn''t on the mound.  Although it is not in focus, for me it is a distraction and the "strong point" of the image IMO (it is the first thing I am drawn to).  Good Luck.</td>', 'I wish the ball wasn''t on the mound.  Although it is not in focus, for me it is a distraction and the "strong point" of the image IMO (it is the first thing I am drawn to).  Good Luck.', '2005-04-29 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
