(1342099, 171153, 35207, '<td valign="top">Veyr pretty; very white but very pretty.   parts of the flower look like they may be slightly overexposed but an overall great shot.  Captured theme.  High score</td>', 'Veyr pretty; very white but very pretty.   parts of the flower look like they may be slightly overexposed but an overall great shot.  Captured theme.  High score', '2005-04-29 10:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
