(1342105, 170873, 33379, '<td valign="top">very very nice</td>', 'very very nice', '2005-04-29 10:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342106, 169204, 8970, '<td valign="top">Great smoke capture.  Always find it so difficult to take really good pictures of smoke.  The blue really helps to contrast it.  My only complaint is that I wish it wasn''t cropped overall so tight.</td>', 'Great smoke capture.  Always find it so difficult to take really good pictures of smoke.  The blue really helps to contrast it.  My only complaint is that I wish it wasn''t cropped overall so tight.', '2005-04-29 10:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342111, 169573, 35207, '<td valign="top">nice concept, excellent use of theme only wish it was a sunny day to get more color or contrast.  you should call and complain to the weather person to give you good weather on shooting days....high score</td>', 'nice concept, excellent use of theme only wish it was a sunny day to get more color or contrast.  you should call and complain to the weather person to give you good weather on shooting days....high score', '2005-04-29 10:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342113, 170464, 33504, '<td valign="top">Perfect!! 10</td>', 'Perfect!! 10', '2005-04-29 10:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342114, 170722, 8970, '<td valign="top">That crack in the ground is distracting.  It feels more like you are splitting up the photograph into two.  Don''t feel a connection between the upper 3/4 and the bottom 1/4.</td>', 'That crack in the ground is distracting.  It feels more like you are splitting up the photograph into two.  Don''t feel a connection between the upper 3/4 and the bottom 1/4.', '2005-04-29 10:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342116, 171305, 31628, '<td valign="top">While it certainly is minimal, it fails to draw an emotional reaction.  Why do I care about the button?  Good effort.</td>', 'While it certainly is minimal, it fails to draw an emotional reaction.  Why do I care about the button?  Good effort.', '2005-04-29 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342119, 169005, 33379, '<td valign="top">hey can u take another in macro and post it..i hate spiders but i bet it would look great!</td>', 'hey can u take another in macro and post it..i hate spiders but i bet it would look great!', '2005-04-29 10:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342122, 171366, 8970, '<td valign="top">If this shot was bigger maybe it would have some meaning...</td>', 'If this shot was bigger maybe it would have some meaning...', '2005-04-29 10:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342124, 171261, 33504, '<td valign="top">Original subject well done! 10</td>', 'Original subject well done! 10', '2005-04-29 10:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342126, 171266, 8970, '<td valign="top">This gives me a feeling like the plane is falling from the sun.  Kind of like Icarus losing his wings...</td>', 'This gives me a feeling like the plane is falling from the sun.  Kind of like Icarus losing his wings...', '2005-04-29 10:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342130, 171313, 31628, '<td valign="top">I am almost drawn more to the design of the bench than the bird.  Perhaps if it was doing something interesting...</td>', 'I am almost drawn more to the design of the bench than the bird.  Perhaps if it was doing something interesting...', '2005-04-29 10:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342131, 170134, 35207, '<td valign="top">nice idea, may have payed more attentition to the rule of thirds when framing the shot (house is fine im talking about the horizon)  and the sky seems a bit overexposed.  would have been nice to see more texture of the sky, but i am nit-picking   great shot</td>', 'nice idea, may have payed more attentition to the rule of thirds when framing the shot (house is fine im talking about the horizon)  and the sky seems a bit overexposed.  would have been nice to see more texture of the sky, but i am nit-picking   great shot', '2005-04-29 10:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342138, 170838, 8970, '<td valign="top">Where are all her friends?  I love the grey backgroun with the bright colors in the girl.  Nice choice with the yellow shirt and pink socks.  She feels so much smaller with that mass of gray.</td>', 'Where are all her friends?  I love the grey backgroun with the bright colors in the girl.  Nice choice with the yellow shirt and pink socks.  She feels so much smaller with that mass of gray.', '2005-04-29 10:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342139, 169503, 33379, '<td valign="top">great photo best beach shot i''ve seen and i''m almost done voting..Good Luck 10</td>', 'great photo best beach shot i''ve seen and i''m almost done voting..Good Luck 10', '2005-04-29 10:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342142, 169059, 31628, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  I''d like to see more detail in the cable and the bird''s belly.  Perhaps more texture in the sky (if a polarizer wasn''t used, I''d consider one).  Otherwise it meets the challenge requirements</td>', 'Interesting idea.  I''d like to see more detail in the cable and the bird''s belly.  Perhaps more texture in the sky (if a polarizer wasn''t used, I''d consider one).  Otherwise it meets the challenge requirements', '2005-04-29 10:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342146, 169329, 35207, '<td valign="top">great color, great lighting great fit in the theme<br/>it looks like you used two light sources to shoot this picture and my only complaint is that you may have wanted to try a third to eliminate the shadows of the doornob or have them 180 degrees apart from each other.   GREAT SHOT though.....9</td>', 'great color, great lighting great fit in the themeit looks like you used two light sources to shoot this picture and my only complaint is that you may have wanted to try a third to eliminate the shadows of the doornob or have them 180 degrees apart from each other.   GREAT SHOT though.....9', '2005-04-29 10:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342149, 170491, 34852, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! I like  the colours, the light, the atmosphere, everything is perfect! My favourite. 10.</td>', 'Fantastic! I like  the colours, the light, the atmosphere, everything is perfect! My favourite. 10.', '2005-04-29 11:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342152, 171284, 33379, '<td valign="top">love it good luck</td>', 'love it good luck', '2005-04-29 11:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342153, 170639, 31628, '<td valign="top">Do mermaids wear latex examination gloves?  I love the color contrast of the boat (?) hull and water.  Those create a strong image.  The glove detracts from the image in its incongruity.  Solid photo.</td>', 'Do mermaids wear latex examination gloves?  I love the color contrast of the boat (?) hull and water.  Those create a strong image.  The glove detracts from the image in its incongruity.  Solid photo.', '2005-04-29 11:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342155, 171236, 33379, '<td valign="top">love it</td>', 'love it', '2005-04-29 11:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342156, 169347, 33379, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2005-04-29 11:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342157, 171096, 35207, '<td valign="top">some of the ingerdients if the sushi look a bit overexposed but it is a great shot that fits the theme might have scored higher if the lighting was fixed and the sushi was a little smaller/farther away but an 8 is nothing to cry over</td>', 'some of the ingerdients if the sushi look a bit overexposed but it is a great shot that fits the theme might have scored higher if the lighting was fixed and the sushi was a little smaller/farther away but an 8 is nothing to cry over', '2005-04-29 11:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342160, 170109, 8970, '<td valign="top">All of the garbage on the ground is very distracting.  There is such great design in the ground and the posts.  So much is lost by the specks in the background</td>', 'All of the garbage on the ground is very distracting.  There is such great design in the ground and the posts.  So much is lost by the specks in the background', '2005-04-29 11:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342169, 171263, 35207, '<td valign="top">its a beautiful day in the neighborhood....   this is about the 5th picture that i have seen that has been fouled by wonderful weather.  i think the fog does help this picture but it drains the color out of the water and there is obviously no sky.  it looks like you saturated the color on the boat to make it stand out (which was needed).  my only other gripe is that i may have tried to remove the bouey (spelling?) but an overall great concept and awesome shot, too bad i live in a landlocked state.  high score</td>', 'its a beautiful day in the neighborhood....   this is about the 5th picture that i have seen that has been fouled by wonderful weather.  i think the fog does help this picture but it drains the color out of the water and there is obviously no sky.  it looks like you saturated the color on the boat to make it stand out (which was needed).  my only other gripe is that i may have tried to remove the bouey (spelling?) but an overall great concept and awesome shot, too bad i live in a landlocked state.  high score', '2005-04-29 11:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342178, 169706, 36006, '<td valign="top">nice lines, good neg. space, whites barely in, good blacks., nice movement</td>', 'nice lines, good neg. space, whites barely in, good blacks., nice movement', '2005-04-29 11:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342179, 169940, 35207, '<td valign="top">good thing that there arent any boogers!! nice shot and i like the b&amp;w....8</td>', 'good thing that there arent any boogers!! nice shot and i like the b&w....8', '2005-04-29 11:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342182, 169867, 36006, '<td valign="top">nice color, nice neg space, whites need work, blacks ok,</td>', 'nice color, nice neg space, whites need work, blacks ok,', '2005-04-29 11:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342183, 169500, 33379, '<td valign="top">great color &amp; focus but i dont like that big distracting shadow</td>', 'great color & focus but i dont like that big distracting shadow', '2005-04-29 11:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342190, 170842, 35207, '<td valign="top">im not sure if you were trying for a silouette or if this shot is severely underexposed.  the branches look allright but the bird is way too dark to be a regular shot but if it was a true silouette you would not have any detail on the front of the bird</td>', 'im not sure if you were trying for a silouette or if this shot is severely underexposed.  the branches look allright but the bird is way too dark to be a regular shot but if it was a true silouette you would not have any detail on the front of the bird', '2005-04-29 11:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342191, 171297, 33379, '<td valign="top">love the background with this</td>', 'love the background with this', '2005-04-29 11:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342192, 169834, 36006, '<td valign="top">very nice dof, nice color, whites need work, blacks ok,  theme up for interpretation, nice pix</td>', 'very nice dof, nice color, whites need work, blacks ok,  theme up for interpretation, nice pix', '2005-04-29 11:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342195, 170615, 36006, '<td valign="top">nice b&amp;w, nice lighting, good lines, nice comp</td>', 'nice b&w, nice lighting, good lines, nice comp', '2005-04-29 11:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
