(1342791, 169839, 34128, '<td valign="top">I think the use of color and brightness was effective in making your subject really stand out despite its being very small in the frame.  For me the picture would be better if it wasnt quite such a common scene.  I like the shapes of the branches coming up from the bottom of the picture but dont think the branches at the top add much to the picture (to me they take away from the picture).  This picture might have more impact if you really boost the saturation to make the blue really intense and the yellow/orange of the moon really stand out more.</td>', 'I think the use of color and brightness was effective in making your subject really stand out despite its being very small in the frame.  For me the picture would be better if it wasnt quite such a common scene.  I like the shapes of the branches coming up from the bottom of the picture but dont think the branches at the top add much to the picture (to me they take away from the picture).  This picture might have more impact if you really boost the saturation to make the blue really intense and the yellow/orange of the moon really stand out more.', '2005-04-29 13:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1342793, 171044, 11270, '<td valign="top">The clouds are more of a focal point than the land.</td>', 'The clouds are more of a focal point than the land.', '2005-04-29 13:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
