(1342816, 170451, 34128, '<td valign="top">The first thing that I notice when I look at this picture are the bright branches at the top of the branch and in the background.  Unfortunately they distract me strongly from the buds which I think are the subject of the photo.  The brightly lit bud in the back of the branch is also a bit distracting.  This picture might have been better with a tighter composition and more balanced lighting.</td>', 'The first thing that I notice when I look at this picture are the bright branches at the top of the branch and in the background.  Unfortunately they distract me strongly from the buds which I think are the subject of the photo.  The brightly lit bud in the back of the branch is also a bit distracting.  This picture might have been better with a tighter composition and more balanced lighting.', '2005-04-29 13:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
