(1343141, 169454, 35548, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge description.  5 Not sure which element is the subject.<br/>Meets the definition of Minimalism.....5 <br/>Technical......4 nothing seems to be very clear.<br/>Artistic......7 I like the feel of this image....although I don''t like vertical photoghraphs as a rule this image needs to be vertical.  I can see a couple of different ways to frame this and believe you did a fine job projecting your vision. good work<br/> <br/>Average score.  5</td>', 'Meets challenge description.  5 Not sure which element is the subject.Meets the definition of Minimalism.....5 Technical......4 nothing seems to be very clear.Artistic......7 I like the feel of this image....although I don''t like vertical photoghraphs as a rule this image needs to be vertical.  I can see a couple of different ways to frame this and believe you did a fine job projecting your vision. good work Average score.  5', '2005-04-29 14:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343143, 170633, 15982, '<td valign="top">Great picture! Too bad you couldn''t have taken out that power line, it''s a little distracting, but I don''t feel it is worth a significant reduction in score because if rules permitted, it would have been ommitted. However, I think it would have been a little more interesting if you could have had something to frame the bottom, like a piece of the pole/building it was attached to - just feels like it is missing something where the lamp ends at the edge of the pic. My personal opinion of course! But clarity and sharpness of the picture is wonderful, as is composition and adherence to the challenge - 7</td>', 'Great picture! Too bad you couldn''t have taken out that power line, it''s a little distracting, but I don''t feel it is worth a significant reduction in score because if rules permitted, it would have been ommitted. However, I think it would have been a little more interesting if you could have had something to frame the bottom, like a piece of the pole/building it was attached to - just feels like it is missing something where the lamp ends at the edge of the pic. My personal opinion of course! But clarity and sharpness of the picture is wonderful, as is composition and adherence to the challenge - 7', '2005-04-29 14:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343155, 170879, 30392, '<td valign="top">Lovely image but the quality isn''t the best. The sky  looks a bit grainy and maybe there''s too much contrast or saturation on the sea</td>', 'Lovely image but the quality isn''t the best. The sky  looks a bit grainy and maybe there''s too much contrast or saturation on the sea', '2005-04-29 14:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343174, 170905, 35548, '<td valign="top">I like this image based on its artist qualities.....I don''t think meets the description of the challenge or the definition of minimalism because if I was looking at this image alone without knowing the title the description of challenge, it would be a photograph of a tree lined road with a car, sidewalks and house in it.<br/> <br/>What I like about it is the way you have delt with the wieght of the trees and the road with the curves of the side walk. It is pleaseing to look at and says nothing profound...believe it our not I like that because it is images like that that allows me to image a story around the image. 6</td>', 'I like this image based on its artist qualities.....I don''t think meets the description of the challenge or the definition of minimalism because if I was looking at this image alone without knowing the title the description of challenge, it would be a photograph of a tree lined road with a car, sidewalks and house in it. What I like about it is the way you have delt with the wieght of the trees and the road with the curves of the side walk. It is pleaseing to look at and says nothing profound...believe it our not I like that because it is images like that that allows me to image a story around the image. 6', '2005-04-29 14:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
