(1343400, 171252, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lovely candle photo, good use of negative blackspace.</td>', 'Lovely candle photo, good use of negative blackspace.', '2005-04-29 15:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343401, 170983, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not sure the noise adds anything to this shot - the modern look is not one that lends itself to the grainy look. I like the composition, it has the right balance of white space to subject matter. White background could be more evenly lit.</td>', 'Not sure the noise adds anything to this shot - the modern look is not one that lends itself to the grainy look. I like the composition, it has the right balance of white space to subject matter. White background could be more evenly lit.', '2005-04-29 15:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343402, 168963, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lovely story, lighting and composition.</td>', 'Lovely story, lighting and composition.', '2005-04-29 15:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343404, 169155, 20115, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern of the water,but the stick as the focus of the photo does nothing for me.</td>', 'I like the pattern of the water,but the stick as the focus of the photo does nothing for me.', '2005-04-29 15:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343405, 171097, 27735, '<td valign="top">The mountains seem like the main subject to me, but overall a very nice shot.</td>', 'The mountains seem like the main subject to me, but overall a very nice shot.', '2005-04-29 15:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343406, 169538, 20115, '<td valign="top">Great action shot maybe, not sure about minimalizm.</td>', 'Great action shot maybe, not sure about minimalizm.', '2005-04-29 15:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343407, 169561, 20168, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition! Hope you do well.</td>', 'Excellent composition! Hope you do well.', '2005-04-29 15:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343409, 169353, 20115, '<td valign="top">I like this but looks a little over processed.</td>', 'I like this but looks a little over processed.', '2005-04-29 15:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343410, 170843, 20168, '<td valign="top">Good minimal composition, but the grainy finish hurts this photo.</td>', 'Good minimal composition, but the grainy finish hurts this photo.', '2005-04-29 15:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343411, 169151, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a fascinatingly strange image! Not only is the content bizaare but there is also some strange feeling of the ground being at an angle which puts me off balance. Compositionally too the image succeeds at putting the viewer off-kilter as the key sits neither on a third line nor centred but in a position refreshingly out of the ordinary. Sharpness of focus on the key itself could be better but... altogether a very interesting image!</td>', 'What a fascinatingly strange image! Not only is the content bizaare but there is also some strange feeling of the ground being at an angle which puts me off balance. Compositionally too the image succeeds at putting the viewer off-kilter as the key sits neither on a third line nor centred but in a position refreshingly out of the ordinary. Sharpness of focus on the key itself could be better but... altogether a very interesting image!', '2005-04-29 15:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343412, 169382, 27735, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this fits the challenge, but the balls are interesting.</td>', 'Not sure how this fits the challenge, but the balls are interesting.', '2005-04-29 15:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343413, 171333, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely sense of scale achieved by being daring and including only a sliver of land to balance that wonderful cloud formation.</td>', 'Lovely sense of scale achieved by being daring and including only a sliver of land to balance that wonderful cloud formation.', '2005-04-29 15:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343414, 171263, 20168, '<td valign="top">Fog works very well in this photo.  Great coloring.</td>', 'Fog works very well in this photo.  Great coloring.', '2005-04-29 15:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343416, 171261, 3087, '<td valign="top">What strangely coloured peas! Quirky, well composed, well presented.</td>', 'What strangely coloured peas! Quirky, well composed, well presented.', '2005-04-29 15:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343417, 169945, 20115, '<td valign="top">What is this--photos should make us feel something--awe, anger, sad, happy--no matter what the challenge.  Dots--I don''t get it.</td>', 'What is this--photos should make us feel something--awe, anger, sad, happy--no matter what the challenge.  Dots--I don''t get it.', '2005-04-29 15:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343418, 171070, 27735, '<td valign="top">This would be a great shot if not for the dark thing in the upper left.</td>', 'This would be a great shot if not for the dark thing in the upper left.', '2005-04-29 15:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343421, 169656, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely vibrant, rich background, beautifully out of focus and with lovely variations in shade. Border really lets this down for me as it makes the flower feel oddly cut off rather than simply out of frame.</td>', 'Lovely vibrant, rich background, beautifully out of focus and with lovely variations in shade. Border really lets this down for me as it makes the flower feel oddly cut off rather than simply out of frame.', '2005-04-29 15:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343422, 171262, 6532, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more details on this.... yet, it is an impressive capture....gj.</td>', 'I would like to see more details on this.... yet, it is an impressive capture....gj.', '2005-04-29 15:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343424, 169204, 20115, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been great as a larger photo--I don''t think the photo was suppose to be minimalistic.</td>', 'I think this would have been great as a larger photo--I don''t think the photo was suppose to be minimalistic.', '2005-04-29 15:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343426, 170429, 20168, '<td valign="top">Excellent duotone entry.  Good story in this photo.  One of my favs to win.</td>', 'Excellent duotone entry.  Good story in this photo.  One of my favs to win.', '2005-04-29 15:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343428, 169781, 27735, '<td valign="top">Great focus and reflection. I would try cropping so the bird isn''t centered.</td>', 'Great focus and reflection. I would try cropping so the bird isn''t centered.', '2005-04-29 15:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343429, 170812, 27735, '<td valign="top">Great focus and isolation of the subject.</td>', 'Great focus and isolation of the subject.', '2005-04-29 15:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343432, 169481, 27735, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrasting colors!</td>', 'Excellent contrasting colors!', '2005-04-29 15:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343433, 169023, 20168, '<td valign="top">Beautiful twilight photo and perfect for this challenge.  Hope you do well.</td>', 'Beautiful twilight photo and perfect for this challenge.  Hope you do well.', '2005-04-29 15:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343434, 170491, 6999, '<td valign="top">Forgiving the perspective distortion, and your slightly odd-seeming approach to dealing with it - I''d rather the more central part of the frame were vertical, than the extreme edge of one side - this is a great shot. Nothing wrong with it that wouldn''t be deal-able-with with more processing allowed.</td>', 'Forgiving the perspective distortion, and your slightly odd-seeming approach to dealing with it - I''d rather the more central part of the frame were vertical, than the extreme edge of one side - this is a great shot. Nothing wrong with it that wouldn''t be deal-able-with with more processing allowed.', '2005-04-29 15:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343435, 169355, 6532, '<td valign="top">This is really awesome...but, a bit oversaturated...the lines in the background give the overall image a more realistic feel... the interference on the reflection at the birds tail is distracting in a minor way.... yet, gj overall</td>', 'This is really awesome...but, a bit oversaturated...the lines in the background give the overall image a more realistic feel... the interference on the reflection at the birds tail is distracting in a minor way.... yet, gj overall', '2005-04-29 15:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343436, 171300, 20115, '<td valign="top">a stir fry--nice arrangement</td>', 'a stir fry--nice arrangement', '2005-04-29 15:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1343437, 170950, 6532, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Scoring it high - but, I will check back to finalize the vote after I vote on the rest.....</td>', 'Beautiful!  Scoring it high - but, I will check back to finalize the vote after I vote on the rest.....', '2005-04-29 15:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
