(1343998, 169573, 35548, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge description............5 I don''t know what the main subject of this image is because there is to many interesting elements to this image.<br/>Meets definition of Minimalism........5  for the same reason as above.<br/>Technical...........can''t tell if it is my computer or the image but it appears to have some artifacts in the area of surfers and sky,  everything else  looks okay to me though..........8<br/>Artistic........10......I like how you framed this image, the rock to the left if omitted my have made the image stronger, but in away I think it adds to the story of talking about the envornment that surfers live in.  I love the feel of the dark sand and the white of the foam, beautiful contrast..........I suppose I''m judging the artistic a little high because I am an old surfer with three boards in my back shed waiting for the New England weather to warm up the Atlantic........but we don''t have to tell anybody that....nice image...<br/> <br/>Average score 7<br/></td>', 'Meets challenge description............5 I don''t know what the main subject of this image is because there is to many interesting elements to this image.Meets definition of Minimalism........5  for the same reason as above.Technical...........can''t tell if it is my computer or the image but it appears to have some artifacts in the area of surfers and sky,  everything else  looks okay to me though..........8Artistic........10......I like how you framed this image, the rock to the left if omitted my have made the image stronger, but in away I think it adds to the story of talking about the envornment that surfers live in.  I love the feel of the dark sand and the white of the foam, beautiful contrast..........I suppose I''m judging the artistic a little high because I am an old surfer with three boards in my back shed waiting for the New England weather to warm up the Atlantic........but we don''t have to tell anybody that....nice image... Average score 7', '2005-04-29 18:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
