(1344339, 170712, 27901, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful scenery! The idea is also very good, not to use a surrounding that is one flat color. I am thinking a bit about the position of the yellow flower, it is not as catching as it could be if you had used the rule of thirds. It is of course better that you don''t have it totally centered but I would like it more close to one of the 4 corners, I suppose I would like to see it a bit up to the left. SAlso to have more focus on the flower itself. Still this is a very good picture!</td>', 'This is beautiful scenery! The idea is also very good, not to use a surrounding that is one flat color. I am thinking a bit about the position of the yellow flower, it is not as catching as it could be if you had used the rule of thirds. It is of course better that you don''t have it totally centered but I would like it more close to one of the 4 corners, I suppose I would like to see it a bit up to the left. SAlso to have more focus on the flower itself. Still this is a very good picture!', '2005-04-29 20:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
