(1344632, 169270, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful simplicity. So elogant --- great work.</td>', 'Beautiful simplicity. So elogant --- great work.', '2005-04-29 22:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344641, 171045, 18191, '<td valign="top">Fantabulous!!! This is such a great shot, there are so many beautiful aspects to it. I lov ehow there is just a small bit of detail in the space taking up the left part of the photograph; just enough to add a little interest. I love how the man is just happening upon a pool of light, and if not at the right time, with the right person, this photography would have been uninteresting. After scrutinizing this shot, I find the one electric lamp sticking out slightly distracting. This shot is the epitome of timing in conjunction with artistic ability and technicality. I have much to learn from you.</td>', 'Fantabulous!!! This is such a great shot, there are so many beautiful aspects to it. I lov ehow there is just a small bit of detail in the space taking up the left part of the photograph; just enough to add a little interest. I love how the man is just happening upon a pool of light, and if not at the right time, with the right person, this photography would have been uninteresting. After scrutinizing this shot, I find the one electric lamp sticking out slightly distracting. This shot is the epitome of timing in conjunction with artistic ability and technicality. I have much to learn from you.', '2005-04-29 22:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344647, 171045, 32997, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully simple and effective shot. My only wish is that the wires at the top weren''t there..and that is being really picky..well done.</td>', 'Wonderfully simple and effective shot. My only wish is that the wires at the top weren''t there..and that is being really picky..well done.', '2005-04-29 22:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344650, 171091, 18191, '<td valign="top">Wonderful timing. The horizon seems slightly tilted to the left but is only a nitpick. Very well done. 9.</td>', 'Wonderful timing. The horizon seems slightly tilted to the left but is only a nitpick. Very well done. 9.', '2005-04-29 22:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344652, 169940, 32997, '<td valign="top">I love it! Wonderful idea and execution! i love the lighting, and that partial shading..adds to the sneaking feeling...</td>', 'I love it! Wonderful idea and execution! i love the lighting, and that partial shading..adds to the sneaking feeling...', '2005-04-29 22:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344657, 170038, 18191, '<td valign="top">People will give this a 3--second scan and immediately conclude "Not Minimalism". I can probably say that you have gotten many comments and have been voted down for not meeting the challenge. However, after scrutinizing this image further, one recognizes the true brilliance of the shot. The few ambiguous figures in the distance give such a sense of scale that one wonders what the meaning of minimalism is to begin with. There could be a few technical improvements of this shot; I would start by dodging and burning more as well as bumping up the contrast (maybe a try in B&amp;W?), but these are easy alterations to do and I''d love to see what you do to this shot in the future. Beautiful work, don''t let the high-speed voters of DPC let you down. Hope this 10 bumps you up further!</td>', 'People will give this a 3--second scan and immediately conclude "Not Minimalism". I can probably say that you have gotten many comments and have been voted down for not meeting the challenge. However, after scrutinizing this image further, one recognizes the true brilliance of the shot. The few ambiguous figures in the distance give such a sense of scale that one wonders what the meaning of minimalism is to begin with. There could be a few technical improvements of this shot; I would start by dodging and burning more as well as bumping up the contrast (maybe a try in B&W?), but these are easy alterations to do and I''d love to see what you do to this shot in the future. Beautiful work, don''t let the high-speed voters of DPC let you down. Hope this 10 bumps you up further!', '2005-04-29 22:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344661, 171245, 32997, '<td valign="top">I like the feel here...it is nice how the fence is only fully exposed at the top. Glad to see a real sky, not a neat imaged version. Good job.</td>', 'I like the feel here...it is nice how the fence is only fully exposed at the top. Glad to see a real sky, not a neat imaged version. Good job.', '2005-04-29 22:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344663, 171117, 18191, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones and treatment to this image. The highlights are just held in --- this image is technically flawless. I like the new and fresh experimental type of composition, as well as a very different angle. Great way of working "outside of the box"!</td>', 'Wonderful tones and treatment to this image. The highlights are just held in --- this image is technically flawless. I like the new and fresh experimental type of composition, as well as a very different angle. Great way of working "outside of the box"!', '2005-04-29 22:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344665, 171243, 32997, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective..nice lonely feel to this shot.</td>', 'Simple and effective..nice lonely feel to this shot.', '2005-04-29 22:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344670, 169573, 32997, '<td valign="top">Love how the ocean looks cold and imposing...glad you didn''t neaten it up..nice crop, subject well placed.</td>', 'Love how the ocean looks cold and imposing...glad you didn''t neaten it up..nice crop, subject well placed.', '2005-04-29 22:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344672, 169761, 18191, '<td valign="top">I probably would have liked this image more in all black and white. This is not because I am "against" selective desaturation, but more, that I like your black and white treatmen a lot and I think this could be improved by having the entire image undergo that treatment. This is a very good shot and very well done for the challenge. I will give it very high marks. However there does seem to be some jpeg artifacts and "jaggies" that may be due to either over-sharpening or you may have had some problems in the actual compression of the original shot. If you would like help on compression, feel free to PM me and I will be glad to help you out so that you may submit the best quality shots. Good work, keep it up!</td>', 'I probably would have liked this image more in all black and white. This is not because I am "against" selective desaturation, but more, that I like your black and white treatmen a lot and I think this could be improved by having the entire image undergo that treatment. This is a very good shot and very well done for the challenge. I will give it very high marks. However there does seem to be some jpeg artifacts and "jaggies" that may be due to either over-sharpening or you may have had some problems in the actual compression of the original shot. If you would like help on compression, feel free to PM me and I will be glad to help you out so that you may submit the best quality shots. Good work, keep it up!', '2005-04-29 22:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344673, 169515, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very good setup and composition. I think this image would look even better with a darker black point and a lighter white point to increase the overall brightness and the richness of the colors, but it still looks really nice as is.</td>', 'Very good setup and composition. I think this image would look even better with a darker black point and a lighter white point to increase the overall brightness and the richness of the colors, but it still looks really nice as is.', '2005-04-29 22:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344681, 171363, 32997, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot..love the lighting.</td>', 'Wonderful shot..love the lighting.', '2005-04-29 22:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344683, 170157, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Clean, simple. Very peaceful. The border works on this one. Good color.</td>', 'Very nice. Clean, simple. Very peaceful. The border works on this one. Good color.', '2005-04-29 22:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344687, 170428, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and wonderful landscape. Would love to know where this is. Great use of mist compressoin to show depth and distance as well. I think that there could have been a stronger focal point in the foreground --- in comparison with the rest of the image, it just seems a little bland to me. Great shot either way, just some food for thought. Details rock, and colors are astounding. Top of the line work.</td>', 'Beautiful light and wonderful landscape. Would love to know where this is. Great use of mist compressoin to show depth and distance as well. I think that there could have been a stronger focal point in the foreground --- in comparison with the rest of the image, it just seems a little bland to me. Great shot either way, just some food for thought. Details rock, and colors are astounding. Top of the line work.', '2005-04-29 22:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344689, 170254, 35645, '<td valign="top">My five year old loves this - and so do I. Very nice shot. Meets the challenge &amp; is still very playful and lighthearted. Beautiful colors.</td>', 'My five year old loves this - and so do I. Very nice shot. Meets the challenge & is still very playful and lighthearted. Beautiful colors.', '2005-04-29 22:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344691, 169329, 35645, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I like it. The contrasting colors and diagonal line give it movemet. Good find. Good shot.</td>', 'Interesting. I like it. The contrasting colors and diagonal line give it movemet. Good find. Good shot.', '2005-04-29 22:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344692, 170483, 32997, '<td valign="top">Love how you have lit this...composition is excellent. Very interesting.</td>', 'Love how you have lit this...composition is excellent. Very interesting.', '2005-04-29 22:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344693, 170950, 35645, '<td valign="top">Great macro. I like the reflected light in the droplets. Great texture on the petal. Beautiful red.</td>', 'Great macro. I like the reflected light in the droplets. Great texture on the petal. Beautiful red.', '2005-04-29 22:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344695, 170401, 35645, '<td valign="top">Wow. This guy''s kinda creepy. Puts me in mind of Boris Karloff. I love the texture in the feathers. Great composition.</td>', 'Wow. This guy''s kinda creepy. Puts me in mind of Boris Karloff. I love the texture in the feathers. Great composition.', '2005-04-29 22:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344696, 170809, 32997, '<td valign="top">I can''t see how anything but the bench could be the subject here..the tree even brings your eye to it by framing it. A nice shot nonetheless.</td>', 'I can''t see how anything but the bench could be the subject here..the tree even brings your eye to it by framing it. A nice shot nonetheless.', '2005-04-29 22:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344698, 169839, 32997, '<td valign="top">I love how the branches seem to be supporting the moon...nic efeel to this shot. Strong composition.</td>', 'I love how the branches seem to be supporting the moon...nic efeel to this shot. Strong composition.', '2005-04-29 22:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344707, 171073, 35970, '<td valign="top">I love this little insect...I wish there was a little less of the white highlights on the right. The right side could be cropped more.</td>', 'I love this little insect...I wish there was a little less of the white highlights on the right. The right side could be cropped more.', '2005-04-29 22:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344708, 170447, 35739, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The clarity of the moon and the color is excellent.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The clarity of the moon and the color is excellent.', '2005-04-29 22:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344709, 171101, 22379, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture, thankfully you used a black background for a nice change! Unfortunatly, the subject takes up a third of the image, which just doesnt match the challenges requirements, so i can''t give you the high score the image otherwise deserves.</td>', 'beautiful picture, thankfully you used a black background for a nice change! Unfortunatly, the subject takes up a third of the image, which just doesnt match the challenges requirements, so i can''t give you the high score the image otherwise deserves.', '2005-04-29 22:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344710, 171194, 32997, '<td valign="top">Technically a nice shot..would be more inteesting if I got a sense of why, or how they were feeling..maybe having the person looking slightly off to the side..any sort of context to add interest. well done nonetheless.</td>', 'Technically a nice shot..would be more inteesting if I got a sense of why, or how they were feeling..maybe having the person looking slightly off to the side..any sort of context to add interest. well done nonetheless.', '2005-04-29 22:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344713, 170493, 35739, '<td valign="top">Idea, perhaps cropping out the shadow?  Excellent capture.</td>', 'Idea, perhaps cropping out the shadow?  Excellent capture.', '2005-04-29 22:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344716, 171284, 32997, '<td valign="top">Interesting..nice take on the challenge!</td>', 'Interesting..nice take on the challenge!', '2005-04-29 22:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344717, 171064, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great sense of scale. My only criticism is that the horizon seems slightly tilted to the right. Awesome shot that is just an amazing location!</td>', 'Great sense of scale. My only criticism is that the horizon seems slightly tilted to the right. Awesome shot that is just an amazing location!', '2005-04-29 22:53:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1344718, 170444, 35645, '<td valign="top">Every time I look at this , I bump it up a point. This is very clean and simple in its lines. A very serene photgraph - almost zen. I think the border helps put the focus onto the flower, and I really like the fact that the background is not all stark white.</td>', 'Every time I look at this , I bump it up a point. This is very clean and simple in its lines. A very serene photgraph - almost zen. I think the border helps put the focus onto the flower, and I really like the fact that the background is not all stark white.', '2005-04-29 22:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344720, 171249, 22379, '<td valign="top">i do not understand? the subject takes up the whole frame.</td>', 'i do not understand? the subject takes up the whole frame.', '2005-04-29 22:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344721, 170429, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo - almost looks like a line drawing. Definately meets the challenge. I find myself almost mesmerised by this. It''s very captivating. Good shot.</td>', 'Very interesting photo - almost looks like a line drawing. Definately meets the challenge. I find myself almost mesmerised by this. It''s very captivating. Good shot.', '2005-04-29 22:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344723, 168822, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very interesting play of light and shadows, but it feels a little too busy to meet the challenge description, and the main subject takes up a lot of space.</td>', 'Very interesting play of light and shadows, but it feels a little too busy to meet the challenge description, and the main subject takes up a lot of space.', '2005-04-29 22:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344725, 171064, 35970, '<td valign="top">This is one seems to fit the challenge well. Is the horizon tripping a little tiny bit down on the right side...or have I seen one too many photos? Anyway, the photo is a lot of fun.</td>', 'This is one seems to fit the challenge well. Is the horizon tripping a little tiny bit down on the right side...or have I seen one too many photos? Anyway, the photo is a lot of fun.', '2005-04-29 22:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344727, 170879, 35645, '<td valign="top">I like this one. The water seems a little too sharp and the boat a little too out of ofcus though. Also, I would have scored this higher had the horizon line not been in the center of the pic - slightly lower or higher would have given it more ''zing''.</td>', 'I like this one. The water seems a little too sharp and the boat a little too out of ofcus though. Also, I would have scored this higher had the horizon line not been in the center of the pic - slightly lower or higher would have given it more ''zing''.', '2005-04-29 23:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344730, 171224, 35970, '<td valign="top">this photo has an engaging quality to it. the footprints tell an unseen story. and the man stretching adds some movement.</td>', 'this photo has an engaging quality to it. the footprints tell an unseen story. and the man stretching adds some movement.', '2005-04-29 23:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344731, 170168, 22379, '<td valign="top">i looked at this image for a good minute  wondering what the subject was - and i even had to look longer after i saw the title. My eye was drawn to the window, not the butterfly. Admittedly i had just woken up, but still the subject should not so hard to find imho.</td>', 'i looked at this image for a good minute  wondering what the subject was - and i even had to look longer after i saw the title. My eye was drawn to the window, not the butterfly. Admittedly i had just woken up, but still the subject should not so hard to find imho.', '2005-04-29 23:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344732, 169440, 35645, '<td valign="top">The background colors on this, especially the yellow/gold, are overwhelming the bubble. This is a really neat photo, though, and I like the light reflected in the bubble. Meets the challenge quite well, but I think softer colors (or fewer colors) would have worked better.</td>', 'The background colors on this, especially the yellow/gold, are overwhelming the bubble. This is a really neat photo, though, and I like the light reflected in the bubble. Meets the challenge quite well, but I think softer colors (or fewer colors) would have worked better.', '2005-04-29 23:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344734, 171341, 35970, '<td valign="top">it''s hard to try to decide on what I think is the best in this competition, but maybe this is it.<br/>the tree seems insignificant in view of the immense sky.</td>', 'it''s hard to try to decide on what I think is the best in this competition, but maybe this is it.the tree seems insignificant in view of the immense sky.', '2005-04-29 23:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
