(1344741, 169135, 35970, '<td valign="top">I love the fact that the subject is entirely in focus and no part of the green stem blurs out.<br/>the focus enables my eye to travel up and down the spiral stem comfortably.</td>', 'I love the fact that the subject is entirely in focus and no part of the green stem blurs out.the focus enables my eye to travel up and down the spiral stem comfortably.', '2005-04-29 23:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
