(1344970, 170476, 31628, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and texture.  This works very well in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Great contrast and texture.  This works very well in B&W.', '2005-04-29 23:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344971, 170873, 18349, '<td valign="top">Simplistic beauty always works well.  Great tree, great light, great post processing.  :o)</td>', 'Simplistic beauty always works well.  Great tree, great light, great post processing.  :o)', '2005-04-29 23:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344973, 169370, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice and clear.  Good placement of the subject.  Good lighting.</td>', 'Great shot, nice and clear.  Good placement of the subject.  Good lighting.', '2005-04-29 23:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344975, 168822, 30605, '<td valign="top">After 1 minutes starring at the picture, I still can''t tell what I am looking at. Looks blurry also.</td>', 'After 1 minutes starring at the picture, I still can''t tell what I am looking at. Looks blurry also.', '2005-04-29 23:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344977, 170138, 31628, '<td valign="top">This is a good image.  Sepia was a very appropriate choice and the lighting is interesting.  Good job.</td>', 'This is a good image.  Sepia was a very appropriate choice and the lighting is interesting.  Good job.', '2005-04-29 23:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344978, 170211, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the crop of this shot.  I am assuming that the seagull is the subject, and so my only suggestion is that the subject is not quite as clear as it could be.  It almost looks as if the focus is on the rock, rather than the bird.  Other than that, great shot.  Good lighting.</td>', 'I like the crop of this shot.  I am assuming that the seagull is the subject, and so my only suggestion is that the subject is not quite as clear as it could be.  It almost looks as if the focus is on the rock, rather than the bird.  Other than that, great shot.  Good lighting.', '2005-04-29 23:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344981, 169168, 35513, '<td valign="top">One of the few borders in this challenge that really enhances the shot.  Nice choice.  There''s good detail on the subject, but I would be curious to see how it would come out on an ivory background as opposed to stark white.  The only thing with the whiite is that it can be hard to look at, though I think that it works better with this shot than with others.</td>', 'One of the few borders in this challenge that really enhances the shot.  Nice choice.  There''s good detail on the subject, but I would be curious to see how it would come out on an ivory background as opposed to stark white.  The only thing with the whiite is that it can be hard to look at, though I think that it works better with this shot than with others.', '2005-04-29 23:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344982, 170409, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice deep greens in this picture; that''s the most striking feature of this picture.</td>', 'Nice deep greens in this picture; that''s the most striking feature of this picture.', '2005-04-29 23:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344986, 170826, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good use of shallow DOF.</td>', 'Good use of shallow DOF.', '2005-04-30 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344987, 169135, 31628, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors.  This definitely fits the challenge.  Too bad you weren''t allowed to spot edit...  Good job.</td>', 'Excellent colors.  This definitely fits the challenge.  Too bad you weren''t allowed to spot edit...  Good job.', '2005-04-30 00:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344988, 169839, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the texture that the trees give in this shot.  And the blue of the sky is very mellow.  If the moon were just a tad bit higher, I''d say perfection!  So hurry up and move that moon already! :-)  Great shot.</td>', 'I like the texture that the trees give in this shot.  And the blue of the sky is very mellow.  If the moon were just a tad bit higher, I''d say perfection!  So hurry up and move that moon already! :-)  Great shot.', '2005-04-30 00:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344990, 171070, 36914, '<td valign="top">The rock in the upper left tends steal the scene. But after looking at this for awhile I got the meaning. Kind of looks like the end is near for the kite flyer, that the rock is falling out of the sky to end it all.   Is that what you were after?</td>', 'The rock in the upper left tends steal the scene. But after looking at this for awhile I got the meaning. Kind of looks like the end is near for the kite flyer, that the rock is falling out of the sky to end it all.   Is that what you were after?', '2005-04-30 00:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344991, 171245, 31628, '<td valign="top">Where''s the subject to grab my attention?  Needs a point of focus.</td>', 'Where''s the subject to grab my attention?  Needs a point of focus.', '2005-04-30 00:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344993, 171175, 35513, '<td valign="top">Don''t know WHERE you found this bottle, but I love it!  What a great subject!  Good gradient in the background and I think you chose a background color that really compliments the subject.  The lighting seems a little extreme on the label of the bottle, but other than that, great!</td>', 'Don''t know WHERE you found this bottle, but I love it!  What a great subject!  Good gradient in the background and I think you chose a background color that really compliments the subject.  The lighting seems a little extreme on the label of the bottle, but other than that, great!', '2005-04-30 00:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344994, 171183, 22340, '<td valign="top">one of my top 5 favorites in this challenge .. i like the varying  horizontal wave amplitudes of the road, fence posts, and hilltop ... this nicely supports the vertical curve of the windblown tree focal point</td>', 'one of my top 5 favorites in this challenge .. i like the varying  horizontal wave amplitudes of the road, fence posts, and hilltop ... this nicely supports the vertical curve of the windblown tree focal point', '2005-04-30 00:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1344996, 171364, 35513, '<td valign="top">I think my favorite thing about this shot is the movement of the water....such a graceful texture.  I think that perhaps the rock could stand out a bit more clearly.  But a lovely shot nonetheless.</td>', 'I think my favorite thing about this shot is the movement of the water....such a graceful texture.  I think that perhaps the rock could stand out a bit more clearly.  But a lovely shot nonetheless.', '2005-04-30 00:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345001, 170817, 35513, '<td valign="top">What an incredible sky!  I love the contrast between the clouds, the ocean, and the sand.  Wonderful subject choice.  I love this shot.</td>', 'What an incredible sky!  I love the contrast between the clouds, the ocean, and the sand.  Wonderful subject choice.  I love this shot.', '2005-04-30 00:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345002, 170598, 36914, '<td valign="top">Nice web shot.</td>', 'Nice web shot.', '2005-04-30 00:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345003, 169132, 31628, '<td valign="top">This is definitely minimal, though I would suggest losing the border next time.  Nice work.</td>', 'This is definitely minimal, though I would suggest losing the border next time.  Nice work.', '2005-04-30 00:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345004, 170429, 28299, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, eye definitely drawn to boat and water. 8</td>', 'Very nice composition, eye definitely drawn to boat and water. 8', '2005-04-30 00:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345005, 171253, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great focus on the car (which MUST be going at incredible speeds!).  I like the placement of the subject as well.</td>', 'Great focus on the car (which MUST be going at incredible speeds!).  I like the placement of the subject as well.', '2005-04-30 00:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345008, 171284, 28299, '<td valign="top">Maximum uniqueness! Great contrast and clarity. 8</td>', 'Maximum uniqueness! Great contrast and clarity. 8', '2005-04-30 00:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345009, 170558, 35513, '<td valign="top">You must have remarkable timing!  I really like this shot.  Good choice in chips.  Nice quick fingers!  The lighting really shows off the shadows of the different subjects.</td>', 'You must have remarkable timing!  I really like this shot.  Good choice in chips.  Nice quick fingers!  The lighting really shows off the shadows of the different subjects.', '2005-04-30 00:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345010, 171297, 36914, '<td valign="top">Almost seems like somthing is missing.  I was looking for the bug in the right cornter.</td>', 'Almost seems like somthing is missing.  I was looking for the bug in the right cornter.', '2005-04-30 00:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345011, 170959, 31628, '<td valign="top">?  Needs more context to make sense.  Also, it needs to be in focus.</td>', '?  Needs more context to make sense.  Also, it needs to be in focus.', '2005-04-30 00:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345012, 169320, 28299, '<td valign="top">Beautiful texture, yet so simply done. 8</td>', 'Beautiful texture, yet so simply done. 8', '2005-04-30 00:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345013, 170983, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good soft lighting here. Good composition here.</td>', 'Good soft lighting here. Good composition here.', '2005-04-30 00:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345014, 171263, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wonderful focus on the boat.  You may (or may not) get some comments about wanting more color in the background, but I like it.  It speaks of the day.  There''s something soothing about this shot.  Reminds me of the Pacific Northwest.</td>', 'Wonderful focus on the boat.  You may (or may not) get some comments about wanting more color in the background, but I like it.  It speaks of the day.  There''s something soothing about this shot.  Reminds me of the Pacific Northwest.', '2005-04-30 00:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345016, 171309, 31628, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  If the handle was sharply in focus this would be close to a 10.  This image works.</td>', 'Great idea.  If the handle was sharply in focus this would be close to a 10.  This image works.', '2005-04-30 00:05:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1345017, 170798, 28299, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. Would prefer the flower slightly lower and away from the edge but still offcenter. 8</td>', 'Nice colors. Would prefer the flower slightly lower and away from the edge but still offcenter. 8', '2005-04-30 00:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345018, 171212, 35513, '<td valign="top">The only suggestion I have with this shot is that the duck is mostly in focus, but is just a tad indistinct.  I like the lighting, especially where the duck is lifting its wing.  Good depth of field.</td>', 'The only suggestion I have with this shot is that the duck is mostly in focus, but is just a tad indistinct.  I like the lighting, especially where the duck is lifting its wing.  Good depth of field.', '2005-04-30 00:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345019, 171093, 31628, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t fit challenge requirements...</td>', 'Doesn''t fit challenge requirements...', '2005-04-30 00:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345020, 170313, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Rich colors, red and green. Would be better if bird wasn''t placed dead center in the frame IMO.</td>', 'Good capture. Rich colors, red and green. Would be better if bird wasn''t placed dead center in the frame IMO.', '2005-04-30 00:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345021, 170615, 28299, '<td valign="top">Well, that''s unique! A one-pin burlesque show! 7</td>', 'Well, that''s unique! A one-pin burlesque show! 7', '2005-04-30 00:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345022, 171341, 35513, '<td valign="top">A tremendous sky.  I really like the B&amp;W for this photo.  Lovely lovely.  I like it a lot!</td>', 'A tremendous sky.  I really like the B&W for this photo.  Lovely lovely.  I like it a lot!', '2005-04-30 00:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345024, 170397, 31628, '<td valign="top">This is almost opposite the intent of the challenge...attention is drawn everywhere but the main subject.  Otherwise interesting lighting on the water.</td>', 'This is almost opposite the intent of the challenge...attention is drawn everywhere but the main subject.  Otherwise interesting lighting on the water.', '2005-04-30 00:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345025, 170395, 28299, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and composition. Eye stays focused on the animals. Wish we had some of those here instead of squirrels and bunnies! 8</td>', 'Nice capture and composition. Eye stays focused on the animals. Wish we had some of those here instead of squirrels and bunnies! 8', '2005-04-30 00:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345028, 171266, 36914, '<td valign="top">Once in a long time shot.  Was it good timing with the clouds or was a filter used to minimize the sun?</td>', 'Once in a long time shot.  Was it good timing with the clouds or was a filter used to minimize the sun?', '2005-04-30 00:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345029, 171142, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Don''t know if it was the effet your were after, but the strong shadow is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Good composition. Don''t know if it was the effet your were after, but the strong shadow is a bit distracting.', '2005-04-30 00:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345032, 170501, 31628, '<td valign="top">If the subject were proportionally smaller and off-center this would be a 9 or 10.  Great colors and focus.</td>', 'If the subject were proportionally smaller and off-center this would be a 9 or 10.  Great colors and focus.', '2005-04-30 00:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345034, 169132, 28299, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo; eye stays focused on the ant action (it is an ant?)</td>', 'Interesting photo; eye stays focused on the ant action (it is an ant?)', '2005-04-30 00:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345036, 170877, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection.</td>', 'Nice reflection.', '2005-04-30 00:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345038, 170211, 36914, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and good use of vertical spacing and love the color balance.</td>', 'Nice capture and good use of vertical spacing and love the color balance.', '2005-04-30 00:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345040, 171184, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Insect too tiny to be very interesting I think.</td>', 'Good capture. Insect too tiny to be very interesting I think.', '2005-04-30 00:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345043, 171153, 28299, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition; only a slight vignetting on upper left (at least on my monitor). Delicate and simple. 8</td>', 'Excellent composition; only a slight vignetting on upper left (at least on my monitor). Delicate and simple. 8', '2005-04-30 00:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345045, 171314, 31628, '<td valign="top">Right idea, but not very interesting.</td>', 'Right idea, but not very interesting.', '2005-04-30 00:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345046, 170784, 28299, '<td valign="top">Nice color arrangement and lines. 8</td>', 'Nice color arrangement and lines. 8', '2005-04-30 00:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345048, 171145, 30605, '<td valign="top">I really like this picutre. Good framing. Excellent use of shallow DOF. Well exposed. Great job. 8</td>', 'I really like this picutre. Good framing. Excellent use of shallow DOF. Well exposed. Great job. 8', '2005-04-30 00:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345049, 171198, 31628, '<td valign="top">I suppose we aren''t to know what "it" is - if the subject was in focus this image would work.</td>', 'I suppose we aren''t to know what "it" is - if the subject was in focus this image would work.', '2005-04-30 00:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345051, 169789, 28299, '<td valign="top">Adorable! A little more clarity on the little guy would have made it a superb capture. Nice use of lines and texture also. 8</td>', 'Adorable! A little more clarity on the little guy would have made it a superb capture. Nice use of lines and texture also. 8', '2005-04-30 00:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345052, 169204, 36914, '<td valign="top">Cool use of theme.</td>', 'Cool use of theme.', '2005-04-30 00:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345053, 171363, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Well exposed. I don''t think b&amp;w convertion serve the picture; looks too monochromatic. If it were the effect you wanted, it''s a success. Still a good picture.</td>', 'Good composition. Well exposed. I don''t think b&w convertion serve the picture; looks too monochromatic. If it were the effect you wanted, it''s a success. Still a good picture.', '2005-04-30 00:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345055, 170447, 31628, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This works well - I like the framing, and the color is amazing.</td>', 'Wow.  This works well - I like the framing, and the color is amazing.', '2005-04-30 00:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345057, 170846, 30605, '<td valign="top">Love the warm color balance and shallow depth of field.</td>', 'Love the warm color balance and shallow depth of field.', '2005-04-30 00:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345061, 171190, 31628, '<td valign="top">Well, it certainly is minimal...  But not very intriguing.</td>', 'Well, it certainly is minimal...  But not very intriguing.', '2005-04-30 00:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345063, 171121, 30605, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, the tilted horizon ruins an otherwise great picture. 6</td>', 'In my opinion, the tilted horizon ruins an otherwise great picture. 6', '2005-04-30 00:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345065, 169945, 28299, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but having trouble figuring it out.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but having trouble figuring it out.', '2005-04-30 00:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345067, 169329, 31628, '<td valign="top">Colors are overpowering.  They draw away from Pee Wee''s door handle.</td>', 'Colors are overpowering.  They draw away from Pee Wee''s door handle.', '2005-04-30 00:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345068, 169355, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good framing. I like the warm color tone. Nice reflection.</td>', 'Good framing. I like the warm color tone. Nice reflection.', '2005-04-30 00:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345069, 170838, 31628, '<td valign="top">Definitely fits challenge.  Subject needs more expression.</td>', 'Definitely fits challenge.  Subject needs more expression.', '2005-04-30 00:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345072, 170397, 28299, '<td valign="top">If the sillohette of the duck stood out more and the water less, this would have been a stronger capture.</td>', 'If the sillohette of the duck stood out more and the water less, this would have been a stronger capture.', '2005-04-30 00:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345074, 169422, 28299, '<td valign="top">Busy. I was looking toward simplicity.</td>', 'Busy. I was looking toward simplicity.', '2005-04-30 00:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345077, 171266, 28299, '<td valign="top">Eye not sure where to stay focused.</td>', 'Eye not sure where to stay focused.', '2005-04-30 00:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345078, 171184, 31628, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s a busy frame.  Not really minimal.  Is that a tick?  In a different challenge this may be more appropriate.</td>', 'Wow, that''s a busy frame.  Not really minimal.  Is that a tick?  In a different challenge this may be more appropriate.', '2005-04-30 00:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345080, 169422, 36914, '<td valign="top">To busy the ant is lost.   Take a quick look at the picture notice where your eyes focus.  From the definition minimalism I would say the brown leaf in the right or the brown spot just down from the top would be the minimalism focus point.</td>', 'To busy the ant is lost.   Take a quick look at the picture notice where your eyes focus.  From the definition minimalism I would say the brown leaf in the right or the brown spot just down from the top would be the minimalism focus point.', '2005-04-30 00:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345082, 171064, 30605, '<td valign="top">Stunning overall picture. Great background, deep blue sky and reflection. I think you sacrifice too much detail for that borader though. 8 because of the border</td>', 'Stunning overall picture. Great background, deep blue sky and reflection. I think you sacrifice too much detail for that borader though. 8 because of the border', '2005-04-30 00:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345083, 171272, 28299, '<td valign="top">A little fuzzy and lacking intensity.</td>', 'A little fuzzy and lacking intensity.', '2005-04-30 00:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345084, 171291, 31628, '<td valign="top">This works well.  Fits the challenge and is engaging.</td>', 'This works well.  Fits the challenge and is engaging.', '2005-04-30 00:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345086, 169007, 31628, '<td valign="top">Too much beauty around the main subject.  Not really minimal, more pastoral.</td>', 'Too much beauty around the main subject.  Not really minimal, more pastoral.', '2005-04-30 00:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345090, 169440, 31628, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge well.  Good use of color.</td>', 'Fits the challenge well.  Good use of color.', '2005-04-30 00:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345091, 171337, 28299, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh!</td>', 'Made me laugh!', '2005-04-30 00:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345092, 170817, 30605, '<td valign="top">Sky look menacing. Nice colors; don''t know if it was post processed for the see to look green and beach yellow, but very pleasing.</td>', 'Sky look menacing. Nice colors; don''t know if it was post processed for the see to look green and beach yellow, but very pleasing.', '2005-04-30 00:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345093, 171366, 28299, '<td valign="top">Needs to be larger. No one could deny that it''s minimal!</td>', 'Needs to be larger. No one could deny that it''s minimal!', '2005-04-30 00:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345096, 170837, 28299, '<td valign="top">This is busy and hard to follow.</td>', 'This is busy and hard to follow.', '2005-04-30 00:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345098, 170044, 28299, '<td valign="top">Sort of busy for minimalism.</td>', 'Sort of busy for minimalism.', '2005-04-30 00:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345099, 169863, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. Very clean and sharp. However, I think the blade is too predominant; not very minimalist. 5</td>', 'Nice macro. Very clean and sharp. However, I think the blade is too predominant; not very minimalist. 5', '2005-04-30 00:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345101, 169817, 28299, '<td valign="top">I see where you''re coming from, but I think this is a little too "busy."</td>', 'I see where you''re coming from, but I think this is a little too "busy."', '2005-04-30 00:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345104, 170001, 28299, '<td valign="top">A little over-saturated and busy.</td>', 'A little over-saturated and busy.', '2005-04-30 00:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345108, 171224, 28299, '<td valign="top">I like the water and the sillohette, it''s just that all the footprints detract.</td>', 'I like the water and the sillohette, it''s just that all the footprints detract.', '2005-04-30 00:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345111, 170610, 28299, '<td valign="top">Very busy (for minimalism). Could use a little more saturation.</td>', 'Very busy (for minimalism). Could use a little more saturation.', '2005-04-30 00:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345112, 169916, 36914, '<td valign="top">Nice angled macro, makes me want to blow.</td>', 'Nice angled macro, makes me want to blow.', '2005-04-30 00:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345115, 170817, 28299, '<td valign="top">The clouds make this shot! 7</td>', 'The clouds make this shot! 7', '2005-04-30 00:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345120, 171355, 36914, '<td valign="top">Good looking moon shot.</td>', 'Good looking moon shot.', '2005-04-30 00:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345122, 169785, 28299, '<td valign="top">I consider this a good minimalistic interpretation. Simplicity in the lines and color. I just think it needs to be a little crisper focus and without the shadowing. 7</td>', 'I consider this a good minimalistic interpretation. Simplicity in the lines and color. I just think it needs to be a little crisper focus and without the shadowing. 7', '2005-04-30 00:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345125, 169761, 28299, '<td valign="top">Nice lines, curves. I think it would have been good even without the child. 7</td>', 'Nice lines, curves. I think it would have been good even without the child. 7', '2005-04-30 00:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345127, 171279, 36914, '<td valign="top">The feel of speed interesting use of focus.</td>', 'The feel of speed interesting use of focus.', '2005-04-30 00:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345130, 171341, 28299, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Bold contrast and a little busy (but only for this challenge). I love the composition. 7</td>', 'Nice capture. Bold contrast and a little busy (but only for this challenge). I love the composition. 7', '2005-04-30 00:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345137, 170873, 28299, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, this is like a painting. Beautiful capture.</td>', 'Ahhh, this is like a painting. Beautiful capture.', '2005-04-30 00:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345140, 169955, 28299, '<td valign="top">Well this definitely meets the challenge. Nice lines, shapes and simplicity of color.</td>', 'Well this definitely meets the challenge. Nice lines, shapes and simplicity of color.', '2005-04-30 00:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
