(1345385, 170397, 22479, '<td valign="top">Great composition with the silhouette of the water fowl in sharp contrast to the very interesting waves. Sharp, detailed, clean processing. Overall this is fabulous! 9</td>', 'Great composition with the silhouette of the water fowl in sharp contrast to the very interesting waves. Sharp, detailed, clean processing. Overall this is fabulous! 9', '2005-04-30 02:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
