(1345775, 170695, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like the colors a lot. However, it seems like maybe the image could use a little more color contrast, for  example to make the black shirt a stronger black and the green in the tree a little stronger. The lines created by the floor, the wall, and the tree "stump" are really nice. The image seems plenty sharp, too.</td>', 'I like the colors a lot. However, it seems like maybe the image could use a little more color contrast, for  example to make the black shirt a stronger black and the green in the tree a little stronger. The lines created by the floor, the wall, and the tree "stump" are really nice. The image seems plenty sharp, too.', '2005-04-30 07:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345777, 170395, 17126, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful. It''s so incredibly refreshing when a picture like this pops up - I think the 10''s are the photos you know immediately are worth it. 10</td>', 'This is just beautiful. It''s so incredibly refreshing when a picture like this pops up - I think the 10''s are the photos you know immediately are worth it. 10', '2005-04-30 07:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345778, 170428, 31133, '<td valign="top">I love this image - color saturation, contrast, and sharpness all seem perfect. Fits the challenge nicely, too. The only thing that would improve this is if it could be a huge image - and I know you''ve used the whole 640 pixels. I''d love to see it at about 900 pixels: I bet it would be beautiful as a print. 9</td>', 'I love this image - color saturation, contrast, and sharpness all seem perfect. Fits the challenge nicely, too. The only thing that would improve this is if it could be a huge image - and I know you''ve used the whole 640 pixels. I''d love to see it at about 900 pixels: I bet it would be beautiful as a print. 9', '2005-04-30 07:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345780, 170807, 17126, '<td valign="top">I would prefer the background to be all one color. Perhaps if you step back and take it from a lower angle, the background would be all the lighter color there.<br/> <br/>Anyway, it''s also a very original idea, and i definitely see the bird. :) 7</td>', 'I would prefer the background to be all one color. Perhaps if you step back and take it from a lower angle, the background would be all the lighter color there. Anyway, it''s also a very original idea, and i definitely see the bird. :) 7', '2005-04-30 07:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345782, 170386, 28299, '<td valign="top">Different, nice textures, great capture!</td>', 'Different, nice textures, great capture!', '2005-04-30 07:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345784, 169429, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space, and good color combinations. I''d love to see a little stronger focus on the blooms, especially the big one facing the viewer. I also like the angle of the stem, that it''s not perfectly straight up and down. I wonder if people will comment that the subject is not sufficiently minimal - for me, it''s on the border, so I am not going to vote this one according to whether the subject is minimal, but on the image itself.<br/> <br/>(edit was just to correct a spelling error)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-04 14:12:11.</i></td>', 'Nice use of negative space, and good color combinations. I''d love to see a little stronger focus on the blooms, especially the big one facing the viewer. I also like the angle of the stem, that it''s not perfectly straight up and down. I wonder if people will comment that the subject is not sufficiently minimal - for me, it''s on the border, so I am not going to vote this one according to whether the subject is minimal, but on the image itself. (edit was just to correct a spelling error)', '2005-04-30 07:23:53.000000', '2005-05-04 15:12:11.000000', 1),
(1345785, 171217, 17126, '<td valign="top">Your title acts as an explanation for what exactly is supposed to be the "minimal" thing in the photo.Though i do like the texture of the grass and the clouds. The sky color is interesting. 4 (because I know it''s just a picture you thought could squeeze into the challenge instead of one you went out and took FOR the challenge.)</td>', 'Your title acts as an explanation for what exactly is supposed to be the "minimal" thing in the photo.Though i do like the texture of the grass and the clouds. The sky color is interesting. 4 (because I know it''s just a picture you thought could squeeze into the challenge instead of one you went out and took FOR the challenge.)', '2005-04-30 07:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
