(1345788, 171356, 31133, '<td valign="top">I love, love, love the subject and the colors - the only things that distract for me are the border (I like it, but it''s a little too strong for my taste) and the crane in the lower left, which takes my eye away from that beautiful sillouhette of bird and lamp.</td>', 'I love, love, love the subject and the colors - the only things that distract for me are the border (I like it, but it''s a little too strong for my taste) and the crane in the lower left, which takes my eye away from that beautiful sillouhette of bird and lamp.', '2005-04-30 07:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345791, 170322, 17126, '<td valign="top">To me, I think this would be more interesting if the duck was not in the center of the picture. Also, there are competing reflections of color here, white and yellow. You could make this black &amp; white since the darkest and lightest tones in the picture are in the duck itself, and i think that would eliminate the distraction of the color. Nice effort though. 6 (if this didn''t make sense, let me know, and i''ll try to explain it better.)</td>', 'To me, I think this would be more interesting if the duck was not in the center of the picture. Also, there are competing reflections of color here, white and yellow. You could make this black & white since the darkest and lightest tones in the picture are in the duck itself, and i think that would eliminate the distraction of the color. Nice effort though. 6 (if this didn''t make sense, let me know, and i''ll try to explain it better.)', '2005-04-30 07:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345792, 169304, 31133, '<td valign="top">Perfect for this challenge. I don''t get the title, but I don''t vote according to titles :-) The only thing I could wish for this is that the only background was the huge playing field, which would cause the subject to not have his head in the brown and grey of the field''s edge.</td>', 'Perfect for this challenge. I don''t get the title, but I don''t vote according to titles :-) The only thing I could wish for this is that the only background was the huge playing field, which would cause the subject to not have his head in the brown and grey of the field''s edge.', '2005-04-30 07:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345794, 169577, 31133, '<td valign="top">These soft pastel pinks and purples draw my eye right down to the subject. Very well done and nice composition.</td>', 'These soft pastel pinks and purples draw my eye right down to the subject. Very well done and nice composition.', '2005-04-30 07:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345795, 171249, 17126, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, but I feel like I''ve seen it 100 times. Usually I''m ok with that, it''s just that it does take the punch out of seeing it when I''ve seen so many just like it.<br/> <br/>Also, the eye is more attracted to the feathers than the body of the bird, so i''d say the subject is the feathers more than the body, and in that case, it wouldn''t fit the challenge.<br/> <br/>But I''m sure you didn''t mean it that way, so I''ll just give you a 5.</td>', 'I like this picture, but I feel like I''ve seen it 100 times. Usually I''m ok with that, it''s just that it does take the punch out of seeing it when I''ve seen so many just like it. Also, the eye is more attracted to the feathers than the body of the bird, so i''d say the subject is the feathers more than the body, and in that case, it wouldn''t fit the challenge. But I''m sure you didn''t mean it that way, so I''ll just give you a 5.', '2005-04-30 07:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
