(1345818, 170489, 17126, '<td valign="top">hmm... I looked at it for a while trying to decide what it was, and I''m still not sure i know. Then i looked at the title again, and it didn''t help explain at all. Sorry. I just don''t get what it is. Though it is an attractive photograph.</td>', 'hmm... I looked at it for a while trying to decide what it was, and I''m still not sure i know. Then i looked at the title again, and it didn''t help explain at all. Sorry. I just don''t get what it is. Though it is an attractive photograph.', '2005-04-30 07:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345820, 170838, 17126, '<td valign="top">This would be better in black &amp; white (i know i know, but you could change the title, too).   :)<br/> <br/>Also, the angle at which you took this is kind of tragic. I see that you are standing to the side a bit so that she''s not in the center of the photograph, but you should still aim the camera perpindicular to the wall so that the line where the wall meets the ground is horizontal and so that she''s sitting completely vertical -- The way you took it means that if you rotate it a few degrees to straighten up that line, she''ll be tilted a little bit.<br/> <br/>Still a good effort. 5</td>', 'This would be better in black & white (i know i know, but you could change the title, too).   :) Also, the angle at which you took this is kind of tragic. I see that you are standing to the side a bit so that she''s not in the center of the photograph, but you should still aim the camera perpindicular to the wall so that the line where the wall meets the ground is horizontal and so that she''s sitting completely vertical -- The way you took it means that if you rotate it a few degrees to straighten up that line, she''ll be tilted a little bit. Still a good effort. 5', '2005-04-30 07:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1345821, 169409, 17126, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors, but the focus issues and the fact that it''s not horizontal... tragic... 4</td>', 'beautiful colors, but the focus issues and the fact that it''s not horizontal... tragic... 4', '2005-04-30 07:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
