(1345830, 171212, 17126, '<td valign="top">I''m loving it - and i like that the reflections are minimal too, and the color in the water is really consistant. the only thing distracting is the bottom left reflection, but water reflects, so I''ll give you the 9 anyway because you did a nice job of avoiding too much reflection. And you caught the bird in motion and still got some nice texture. :)</td>', 'I''m loving it - and i like that the reflections are minimal too, and the color in the water is really consistant. the only thing distracting is the bottom left reflection, but water reflects, so I''ll give you the 9 anyway because you did a nice job of avoiding too much reflection. And you caught the bird in motion and still got some nice texture. :)', '2005-04-30 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
