(1345836, 171117, 17126, '<td valign="top">I like the color of the car, and I guess if there MUST be a car in the picture, at least it''s a gray one and blends nicely with the road. It does distract from the little sign, though I think, all things considered, the photo is actually very technically good, with a nice range of values, some awesome textures, and no blownout highlights.<br/> <br/>Overall, I see what you''re getting at, and I think you did it pretty well. :)  7</td>', 'I like the color of the car, and I guess if there MUST be a car in the picture, at least it''s a gray one and blends nicely with the road. It does distract from the little sign, though I think, all things considered, the photo is actually very technically good, with a nice range of values, some awesome textures, and no blownout highlights. Overall, I see what you''re getting at, and I think you did it pretty well. :)  7', '2005-04-30 08:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
