(1346423, 171349, 17837, '<td valign="top">cool photo, though it seems too flat to me. Maybe a punch in contrast would help the tones in this image.</td>', 'cool photo, though it seems too flat to me. Maybe a punch in contrast would help the tones in this image.', '2005-04-30 13:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
