(1346519, 169914, 31042, '<td valign="top">anyone can take a picture of something incredibly small in the frame, but it takes thought, imagination, and creativity to come up with something that is SMALL in the frame, but also provokes INTEREST and APPEAL to the viewers.  If the shot isn''t appealling, but still fits the challenge, then it isn''t really a great shot, as with this one, 1</td>', 'anyone can take a picture of something incredibly small in the frame, but it takes thought, imagination, and creativity to come up with something that is SMALL in the frame, but also provokes INTEREST and APPEAL to the viewers.  If the shot isn''t appealling, but still fits the challenge, then it isn''t really a great shot, as with this one, 1', '2005-04-30 13:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
