(1346943, 171254, 31813, '<td valign="top">Nice, crisp focus.  However, I would prefer the composition of the subject to have  the empty space in front of it rather than behind the bird.  You have given it \"minimal\" space to fly within the frame.  Maybe that was the point.</td>', 'Nice, crisp focus.  However, I would prefer the composition of the subject to have  the empty space in front of it rather than behind the bird.  You have given it \"minimal\" space to fly within the frame.  Maybe that was the point.', '2005-04-30 15:53:34.000000', NULL, 1);
