(1346952, 169787, 25655, '<td valign="top">So beautiful.<br/>I think it could improve a little if there was a little space under the seed to make it look completely floating in the air. But still a nice take on the challenge. 8</td>', 'So beautiful.I think it could improve a little if there was a little space under the seed to make it look completely floating in the air. But still a nice take on the challenge. 8', '2005-04-30 15:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
