(1346955, 170274, 8970, '<td valign="top">Such nice sky color.  The plant would feel much more out of place is more of the barren land was shown.  I understand going for minimal, but even another 1/8 in height of that corner being land would have helped.</td>', 'Such nice sky color.  The plant would feel much more out of place is more of the barren land was shown.  I understand going for minimal, but even another 1/8 in height of that corner being land would have helped.', '2005-04-30 15:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
