(1347428, 170570, 35548, '<td valign="top">Okay I know I am being picky...but why in the world did you title this "Blue Sky".. What you title your images is what you want the viewer to believe your main subject is.   I believe you subject as defined by the challenge description  is suppose to be the smallest part of your image.  That being said I won''t judge you by your title......:-)<br/> <br/>Meets challenge description.....................10<br/>Meets definition of minimalism...................10<br/>Technical....................................................9 not sure if it is my screen or the image but there appears to be noise or artifacts in it.<br/>Artistic........................................................5  I don''t know why this image is not placed more to the center of the photograph.<br/> <br/>Average score 8</td>', 'Okay I know I am being picky...but why in the world did you title this "Blue Sky".. What you title your images is what you want the viewer to believe your main subject is.   I believe you subject as defined by the challenge description  is suppose to be the smallest part of your image.  That being said I won''t judge you by your title......:-) Meets challenge description.....................10Meets definition of minimalism...................10Technical....................................................9 not sure if it is my screen or the image but there appears to be noise or artifacts in it.Artistic........................................................5  I don''t know why this image is not placed more to the center of the photograph. Average score 8', '2005-04-30 19:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
