(1347820, 171051, 25397, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool picture, one of my favourites so far to tell you the truth. The only downfall that''s going to cost you high votes is the weird noise to it. I like it as it is, with the weird baby stroller...It''s great!  (I''ve added it to favourites)</td>', 'This is a really cool picture, one of my favourites so far to tell you the truth. The only downfall that''s going to cost you high votes is the weird noise to it. I like it as it is, with the weird baby stroller...It''s great!  (I''ve added it to favourites)', '2005-04-30 21:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347823, 169972, 35467, '<td valign="top">I think the bird is to small with everything else happening. A strong subject was required</td>', 'I think the bird is to small with everything else happening. A strong subject was required', '2005-04-30 21:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347824, 170826, 29904, '<td valign="top">A little over exposed, esp on top.  Nice detail.</td>', 'A little over exposed, esp on top.  Nice detail.', '2005-04-30 21:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347825, 171127, 35467, '<td valign="top">An interesting place for a spider - great back light</td>', 'An interesting place for a spider - great back light', '2005-04-30 21:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347826, 169817, 25397, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, however it just seems that the whole picture itself is the poster. Maybe if you included a better angle and some drama like a hand picking up the piece, it would have been a higher scoring picture</td>', 'Very good idea, however it just seems that the whole picture itself is the poster. Maybe if you included a better angle and some drama like a hand picking up the piece, it would have been a higher scoring picture', '2005-04-30 21:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347827, 170324, 25397, '<td valign="top">It''s a tad overcompressed, but I have a feeling you have a thousand comments have told you that already</td>', 'It''s a tad overcompressed, but I have a feeling you have a thousand comments have told you that already', '2005-04-30 21:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347828, 170811, 29904, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Nice detail, contrast, and color.</td>', 'Cool.  Nice detail, contrast, and color.', '2005-04-30 21:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347829, 170274, 35467, '<td valign="top">Subject really needed to be stronger 5</td>', 'Subject really needed to be stronger 5', '2005-04-30 21:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
