(1347844, 169138, 25397, '<td valign="top">I''m so used to those picturesque blue waters, you snapped me back to reality<br/>Thanks man :-)</td>', 'I''m so used to those picturesque blue waters, you snapped me back to realityThanks man :-)', '2005-04-30 21:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
