(1347867, 171070, 29904, '<td valign="top">Not quite enough clarity of your subject, and the trunk is destracting because it is too much of an undifined dark mass.  Otherwise a really great idea, and lovely sky.</td>', 'Not quite enough clarity of your subject, and the trunk is destracting because it is too much of an undifined dark mass.  Otherwise a really great idea, and lovely sky.', '2005-04-30 21:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347870, 170038, 35517, '<td valign="top">beautfiul landscape... breathtaking actually... the slope towards the right  bothers me a tad, and maybe the people are a little bit too minimal....</td>', 'beautfiul landscape... breathtaking actually... the slope towards the right  bothers me a tad, and maybe the people are a little bit too minimal....', '2005-04-30 21:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
