(1347877, 169135, 29904, '<td valign="top">Perfect!  Beautiful composition contrast lighing color clarity and background.</td>', 'Perfect!  Beautiful composition contrast lighing color clarity and background.', '2005-04-30 21:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347879, 170397, 35517, '<td valign="top">excellent idea, and maybe just a little too dark...</td>', 'excellent idea, and maybe just a little too dark...', '2005-04-30 21:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347882, 169717, 35517, '<td valign="top">very very nice... love the three simple colours here, great job.... 8</td>', 'very very nice... love the three simple colours here, great job.... 8', '2005-04-30 21:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347886, 170658, 35517, '<td valign="top">beauty amoung the trash... even though i would normally say there just seems to be too much in the photo for my eyes to focus on the ''subject'', this one works well, as the minimal subject is such a bright colour and a different contrast to the background.... nicely seen....</td>', 'beauty amoung the trash... even though i would normally say there just seems to be too much in the photo for my eyes to focus on the ''subject'', this one works well, as the minimal subject is such a bright colour and a different contrast to the background.... nicely seen....', '2005-04-30 21:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347889, 169834, 30605, '<td valign="top">Beautifull picture</td>', 'Beautifull picture', '2005-04-30 21:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347891, 170813, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good composition. You even manage to get start in your picture, nice.</td>', 'Good composition. You even manage to get start in your picture, nice.', '2005-04-30 21:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347897, 170483, 30605, '<td valign="top">I don''t think a macro shot doesn''t belongs to minimalism. I believe the subject should occupy a small portion of the frame, instead of a small portion of the subject that fill the frame.</td>', 'I don''t think a macro shot doesn''t belongs to minimalism. I believe the subject should occupy a small portion of the frame, instead of a small portion of the subject that fill the frame.', '2005-04-30 21:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347899, 169429, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on the flowers, good composition. However, I am starting to get bored by flat black background. 6</td>', 'Nice lighting on the flowers, good composition. However, I am starting to get bored by flat black background. 6', '2005-04-30 21:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347900, 171177, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good lighting. Original picture with good composition. However, I am getting bored with flat black background. 6</td>', 'Good lighting. Original picture with good composition. However, I am getting bored with flat black background. 6', '2005-04-30 21:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347903, 171314, 30605, '<td valign="top">Good composition and good perspective; makes the shot "moves". 7</td>', 'Good composition and good perspective; makes the shot "moves". 7', '2005-04-30 21:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347905, 171284, 33817, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and starkness of this a lot -- while thinking the whole time that I''m missing the ''message'' of the Symbolism the title alludes to.  Nonetheless, I keep looking at it and finding the isolated and apparently disembodied head and hand most fascinating.  Well done!</td>', 'I like the simplicity and starkness of this a lot -- while thinking the whole time that I''m missing the ''message'' of the Symbolism the title alludes to.  Nonetheless, I keep looking at it and finding the isolated and apparently disembodied head and hand most fascinating.  Well done!', '2005-04-30 21:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347907, 171136, 18080, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot. Not a ten because of the distracting blurred leaves on the right. How annoying, because it''s a stunning photograph.</td>', 'What a beautiful shot. Not a ten because of the distracting blurred leaves on the right. How annoying, because it''s a stunning photograph.', '2005-04-30 21:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347912, 171321, 18080, '<td valign="top">The longer I look at this picture, the more I like it. The hand tells me a thousand stories.</td>', 'The longer I look at this picture, the more I like it. The hand tells me a thousand stories.', '2005-04-30 21:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347913, 170976, 29904, '<td valign="top">Lovely contrast tones and composition</td>', 'Lovely contrast tones and composition', '2005-04-30 21:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347916, 170446, 33817, '<td valign="top">My understanding of Minimalism is almost surely insufficient to judge the purest aspects of whether or not any particular image meets or misses the classic spirit of the genre.  And yet this photo looks and feels just like something I''d tried and failed to accomplish.  In noting my failure, I''m forced to salute your success .. thanks for showing me one way that I might have approached it had I been better prepared and clearer in my thoughts.  My attempt was based on my thoughts that this idea would work -- that it would qualify -- and in the end, that this would succeed.  Here''s hoping your degree of success with it is all it should be.</td>', 'My understanding of Minimalism is almost surely insufficient to judge the purest aspects of whether or not any particular image meets or misses the classic spirit of the genre.  And yet this photo looks and feels just like something I''d tried and failed to accomplish.  In noting my failure, I''m forced to salute your success .. thanks for showing me one way that I might have approached it had I been better prepared and clearer in my thoughts.  My attempt was based on my thoughts that this idea would work -- that it would qualify -- and in the end, that this would succeed.  Here''s hoping your degree of success with it is all it should be.', '2005-04-30 21:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347917, 171269, 18080, '<td valign="top">The red... something.... is very distracting.</td>', 'The red... something.... is very distracting.', '2005-04-30 21:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347918, 171235, 9589, '<td valign="top">Way too dark on the ground.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Way too dark on the ground.  Nice composition.', '2005-04-30 21:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347919, 171344, 9589, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, especially how the football and car match.</td>', 'Nice colors, especially how the football and car match.', '2005-04-30 21:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347921, 171341, 9589, '<td valign="top">It looks like the contrast is too high.</td>', 'It looks like the contrast is too high.', '2005-04-30 21:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347922, 171279, 31005, '<td valign="top">interesting shot</td>', 'interesting shot', '2005-04-30 21:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347923, 169259, 31005, '<td valign="top">reminds me of my walk tonight with my son.  great blue sky.</td>', 'reminds me of my walk tonight with my son.  great blue sky.', '2005-04-30 21:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347924, 171091, 33817, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured!  If this were anything but an Open Challenge, I''d hope you''d have cloned out the sign just to the man''s left as it does pose a bit of distraction -- but basic editing is basic editing and I''ll take the image at face value.  I don''t know what''s out of frame to the right so suggesting a split second later exposure would be presumptuous and do you little good at this point.  Constraints aside, this very nicely makes the man the strong subject called for by virtue of his stark absence of features amid the amply lit background.  Conspicuous by their absence, his features would only distract while his silhouette stands on its own.  Nice work!</td>', 'Very nicely captured!  If this were anything but an Open Challenge, I''d hope you''d have cloned out the sign just to the man''s left as it does pose a bit of distraction -- but basic editing is basic editing and I''ll take the image at face value.  I don''t know what''s out of frame to the right so suggesting a split second later exposure would be presumptuous and do you little good at this point.  Constraints aside, this very nicely makes the man the strong subject called for by virtue of his stark absence of features amid the amply lit background.  Conspicuous by their absence, his features would only distract while his silhouette stands on its own.  Nice work!', '2005-04-30 21:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347925, 171091, 9589, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and variation in light.</td>', 'Nice lines and variation in light.', '2005-04-30 21:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347928, 170715, 31005, '<td valign="top">second time looking at this one.  I like it.</td>', 'second time looking at this one.  I like it.', '2005-04-30 21:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347932, 170544, 29904, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes, and detail!  The white is a little too washed out.  Otherwise lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes, and detail!  The white is a little too washed out.  Otherwise lovely.', '2005-04-30 22:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347935, 169893, 9589, '<td valign="top">Great visual contrast between this boat and the larger ones in the background.</td>', 'Great visual contrast between this boat and the larger ones in the background.', '2005-04-30 22:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347937, 171309, 33817, '<td valign="top">I can''t study this shot without wondering if it would rise or fall without the shadow.  I like the shadow and the context and perspective it adds while wishing I could see the photo without it.  Having said that -- it''s really my problem perceptually and doesn''t stop me from admiring the shot.  Clean ... simple ... minimal.  That IS after all, what we were after ... and you''ve done a great job achieving it.  Best of luck!</td>', 'I can''t study this shot without wondering if it would rise or fall without the shadow.  I like the shadow and the context and perspective it adds while wishing I could see the photo without it.  Having said that -- it''s really my problem perceptually and doesn''t stop me from admiring the shot.  Clean ... simple ... minimal.  That IS after all, what we were after ... and you''ve done a great job achieving it.  Best of luck!', '2005-04-30 22:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347939, 170752, 31005, '<td valign="top">nice flower, I saw a thread where they said it wasn''t a macro challenge.  I submitted one too.  I wish you luck.</td>', 'nice flower, I saw a thread where they said it wasn''t a macro challenge.  I submitted one too.  I wish you luck.', '2005-04-30 22:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347940, 169761, 31005, '<td valign="top">awesome view.</td>', 'awesome view.', '2005-04-30 22:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347948, 169867, 9589, '<td valign="top">Part of the blossoms is overexposed, but I like the rest.</td>', 'Part of the blossoms is overexposed, but I like the rest.', '2005-04-30 22:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347950, 170841, 29904, '<td valign="top">Great detail lighting and composition.  Good choice of background.  I''m only bothered by the lack of definition between the upper head and ''shoulder'', but probably can''t be helped. -9</td>', 'Great detail lighting and composition.  Good choice of background.  I''m only bothered by the lack of definition between the upper head and ''shoulder'', but probably can''t be helped. -9', '2005-04-30 22:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347956, 170395, 29904, '<td valign="top">A little too hot for me.  Nice composition and capture</td>', 'A little too hot for me.  Nice composition and capture', '2005-04-30 22:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347957, 170615, 33817, '<td valign="top">Looking at this, I can see myself taking several dozen photos in an attempt to accomplish what you''ve managed in one.  Whether it was the only effort or one in a hundred, it stirs a wee bit of envy here and that inspires and motivates.  I suppose this all means that if I wished I''d thought of it .. and accept I''d have struggled to achieve it then I must commend your effort and success.  Funny thing that ... it may easily have fallen onto your sensor with less effort than a sneeze -- it still looks great to these eyes . . .</td>', 'Looking at this, I can see myself taking several dozen photos in an attempt to accomplish what you''ve managed in one.  Whether it was the only effort or one in a hundred, it stirs a wee bit of envy here and that inspires and motivates.  I suppose this all means that if I wished I''d thought of it .. and accept I''d have struggled to achieve it then I must commend your effort and success.  Funny thing that ... it may easily have fallen onto your sensor with less effort than a sneeze -- it still looks great to these eyes . . .', '2005-04-30 22:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347967, 171326, 33817, '<td valign="top">Borders generally don''t do much for me .. but as I look at this again, it dawns on me that without the border, I wouldn''t like it so much.  Oh, I''d still like it -- the exposure is technically very nicely done and the details nicely evident despite the small size.  What strikes me is that the border -- particularly the pale line that separates the ground from the border proper -- supports and holds the subject neatly within the frame.  Deliberate or accidental ... it works and complements the subject extremely well.  An already fine image is elevated by its inclusion and that''s a great touch!</td>', 'Borders generally don''t do much for me .. but as I look at this again, it dawns on me that without the border, I wouldn''t like it so much.  Oh, I''d still like it -- the exposure is technically very nicely done and the details nicely evident despite the small size.  What strikes me is that the border -- particularly the pale line that separates the ground from the border proper -- supports and holds the subject neatly within the frame.  Deliberate or accidental ... it works and complements the subject extremely well.  An already fine image is elevated by its inclusion and that''s a great touch!', '2005-04-30 22:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347971, 171101, 9589, '<td valign="top">Very nice color</td>', 'Very nice color', '2005-04-30 22:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1347973, 170431, 33817, '<td valign="top">Okay .. I''m stumped.  I sit here wanting to ''contribute'' and comment in some useful way.  I can''t.  Dammit.  This is too good and that''s that ... *sigh*</td>', 'Okay .. I''m stumped.  I sit here wanting to ''contribute'' and comment in some useful way.  I can''t.  Dammit.  This is too good and that''s that ... *sigh*', '2005-04-30 22:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
