(1347982, 168963, 33817, '<td valign="top">Sometimes, the setting is out of our control -- and especially when it''s person "A" looking at a photo taken by person "B".  I wasn''t there and haven''t a clue what''s ahead of or behind your subject(s).  I can *wish* there were more room on the left and less room on the right, but alas, it''s just as I see it here and as I see it, it''s strikingly well presented.  Perhaps just a little sharper than some might like but size restrictions do play a part here as well.  Good luck with this ... it''s well deserved.</td>', 'Sometimes, the setting is out of our control -- and especially when it''s person "A" looking at a photo taken by person "B".  I wasn''t there and haven''t a clue what''s ahead of or behind your subject(s).  I can *wish* there were more room on the left and less room on the right, but alas, it''s just as I see it here and as I see it, it''s strikingly well presented.  Perhaps just a little sharper than some might like but size restrictions do play a part here as well.  Good luck with this ... it''s well deserved.', '2005-04-30 22:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
