(1348047, 171101, 6349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting, beautiful colors, beautiful flower.  Curious if this is getting doesn''t meet the challenge topics due to its size.  Personally, I think it''s fine and an excellent entry.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting, beautiful colors, beautiful flower.  Curious if this is getting doesn''t meet the challenge topics due to its size.  Personally, I think it''s fine and an excellent entry.', '2005-04-30 22:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
