(1348092, 171326, 6349, '<td valign="top">The flower is too close to the borders for my tastes.  It need a little room to breathe.  It would be alright where it is if the white border line wasn''t there.  Otherwise, very nice.  Good lighting.  Good for the challenge.</td>', 'The flower is too close to the borders for my tastes.  It need a little room to breathe.  It would be alright where it is if the white border line wasn''t there.  Otherwise, very nice.  Good lighting.  Good for the challenge.', '2005-04-30 23:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
