(1348099, 170391, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Truly adorable.  I would have a play with the color balance as the background water seems a bit unnatural.  Not sure if it''s the green or the pink/magenta or what but i''m sure it would be a pretty easy fix.  I''d crop a tiny bit off the top to get rid of the distracting wave forms in the upper left.  Just being constructively picky, hope you don''t mind.  Love the photo.</td>', 'Great capture!  Truly adorable.  I would have a play with the color balance as the background water seems a bit unnatural.  Not sure if it''s the green or the pink/magenta or what but i''m sure it would be a pretty easy fix.  I''d crop a tiny bit off the top to get rid of the distracting wave forms in the upper left.  Just being constructively picky, hope you don''t mind.  Love the photo.', '2005-04-30 23:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
