(1348239, 169573, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great scene.  It''s amazing how many people try to compose the perfect shots and are afraid to take a photo of what they really see out there.  This has a very natural feeling to it and the yellow really helps draw the attention to your subject.  I like that you can see the others out in the water that they are going to meet up with.</td>', 'Great scene.  It''s amazing how many people try to compose the perfect shots and are afraid to take a photo of what they really see out there.  This has a very natural feeling to it and the yellow really helps draw the attention to your subject.  I like that you can see the others out in the water that they are going to meet up with.', '2005-04-30 23:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
