(1348732, 171121, 34247, '<td valign="top">I like this shot quite a lot, and perhaps one of a very few in the entire challenge that actually infused humor and originality. Such a simple thing to do, but so few would think of it. Great dof, the two trees add a scale factor, the crack and road surface give off a great texture, and the tilt conveys speed. Cruisin it is. 10</td>', 'I like this shot quite a lot, and perhaps one of a very few in the entire challenge that actually infused humor and originality. Such a simple thing to do, but so few would think of it. Great dof, the two trees add a scale factor, the crack and road surface give off a great texture, and the tilt conveys speed. Cruisin it is. 10', '2005-05-01 02:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348733, 170715, 35547, '<td valign="top">Would''ve voted higher if you didn''t place it on the edge.</td>', 'Would''ve voted higher if you didn''t place it on the edge.', '2005-05-01 02:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
