(1348768, 171326, 19831, '<td valign="top">A good  shot here. Lighting and focus are great. I like the b/w conversion, very well done. There is very nice detail and texture to the flower. I think the size of it is good, definitely fits the challenge IMO. Compositionally, I''m not crazy about how the flower is framed so tight into the corner, I''m wondering if it were out just a bit, it might be a much stronger presentation?</td>', 'A good  shot here. Lighting and focus are great. I like the b/w conversion, very well done. There is very nice detail and texture to the flower. I think the size of it is good, definitely fits the challenge IMO. Compositionally, I''m not crazy about how the flower is framed so tight into the corner, I''m wondering if it were out just a bit, it might be a much stronger presentation?', '2005-05-01 03:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
