(1348771, 169370, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice job here. Great composition. Your subject, the ball, stands out and forces attention very nicely. I really like the lighting you''ve used, sets a good mood for the shot, a sense of drama kind of. Fits the challenge very well IMO. Well done.</td>', 'Nice job here. Great composition. Your subject, the ball, stands out and forces attention very nicely. I really like the lighting you''ve used, sets a good mood for the shot, a sense of drama kind of. Fits the challenge very well IMO. Well done.', '2005-05-01 03:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
