(1348781, 171136, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wow! (with a capitol W) What a terrifically beautiful shot. You''ve taken what could be a very busy scene, and almost magically with focus, lighting and the composition made it work magnificantly for this challenge IMO. The composition is wonderful. My attention is definitely drawn powerfully to the fisherman, there amidst a totally gorgeous scene. I find myself forcing my attention off the main subject to let my eye wander and take in the rich tones, textures and details of the surroundings, and then I''m drawn right back to the person. The photo tells a pleasingly wonderful story, I''m left feeling a yearning to be out on the water casting a line of my own. What an awesome job, I love it. Very well done.</td>', 'Wow! (with a capitol W) What a terrifically beautiful shot. You''ve taken what could be a very busy scene, and almost magically with focus, lighting and the composition made it work magnificantly for this challenge IMO. The composition is wonderful. My attention is definitely drawn powerfully to the fisherman, there amidst a totally gorgeous scene. I find myself forcing my attention off the main subject to let my eye wander and take in the rich tones, textures and details of the surroundings, and then I''m drawn right back to the person. The photo tells a pleasingly wonderful story, I''m left feeling a yearning to be out on the water casting a line of my own. What an awesome job, I love it. Very well done.', '2005-05-01 03:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1348782, 170655, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nicely crisp and clear, really like the space above, makes the image all the more special...</td>', 'Nicely crisp and clear, really like the space above, makes the image all the more special...', '2005-05-01 03:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
