(1349330, 171372, 16488, '<td valign="top">The light in this image is fascinating.  I love the way it cuts through the submerged boat!  It does, however, come off as a bit oversharped near the top of the image--it may be an artifact of post-processing or perhaps a very fast shutter speed... Nicely done and intriguing image!</td>', 'The light in this image is fascinating.  I love the way it cuts through the submerged boat!  It does, however, come off as a bit oversharped near the top of the image--it may be an artifact of post-processing or perhaps a very fast shutter speed... Nicely done and intriguing image!', '2005-05-01 13:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
