(1349599, 171132, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I think that as far as "minimalism" is concerned, the story here is the sailor saluting the flag.  The sailor is a very integral part of the picture.  I think that the picture works, but not so much for minimalism.  ~6</td>', 'I like the idea, but I think that as far as "minimalism" is concerned, the story here is the sailor saluting the flag.  The sailor is a very integral part of the picture.  I think that the picture works, but not so much for minimalism.  ~6', '2005-05-01 16:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349600, 171321, 5112, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good idea, and the light on the grain of rice is very appropriate.  I also think that the hand is a bit too much of an "attention getter" for this to properly work in minimalism.  Not sure, but that''s my impression.  ~6</td>', 'I think this is a good idea, and the light on the grain of rice is very appropriate.  I also think that the hand is a bit too much of an "attention getter" for this to properly work in minimalism.  Not sure, but that''s my impression.  ~6', '2005-05-01 16:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
