(1349646, 170766, 5112, '<td valign="top">I am not sure about how this shot works for minimalism.  Is the bird getting overpowered by all the buildings?  If so, IMO the buildings are simply way too prominent for this to work in "minimalism".  And, they are a very strong part of the story told here.  I think the concept is good, and the picture quite lovely, but as an entry to minimalism I don''t think it really works.</td>', 'I am not sure about how this shot works for minimalism.  Is the bird getting overpowered by all the buildings?  If so, IMO the buildings are simply way too prominent for this to work in "minimalism".  And, they are a very strong part of the story told here.  I think the concept is good, and the picture quite lovely, but as an entry to minimalism I don''t think it really works.', '2005-05-01 16:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349649, 171335, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like the "horizon" line formed by the darker lowest row of bricks.  Beautiful "found" picture.  The textures on the bricks are fun to look at.  ~7</td>', 'I like the "horizon" line formed by the darker lowest row of bricks.  Beautiful "found" picture.  The textures on the bricks are fun to look at.  ~7', '2005-05-01 16:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349652, 171259, 5112, '<td valign="top">I think the idea is OK, but you need a bit more "information" here.  Just the tops of 4 trees and 2 lights doesn''t quite do it IMHO.  Maybe go back a bit further and have a bit more of the parking lot included, up to about the same height where the tree tops are now?  It''s just an idea.</td>', 'I think the idea is OK, but you need a bit more "information" here.  Just the tops of 4 trees and 2 lights doesn''t quite do it IMHO.  Maybe go back a bit further and have a bit more of the parking lot included, up to about the same height where the tree tops are now?  It''s just an idea.', '2005-05-01 16:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349657, 169715, 5112, '<td valign="top">It took me a moment to see the bird.  The leaves/branches/sky are quite lovely in this shot.  Actually, I like his picture quite a bit, it gives the bird and info about where the bird is.  But, as "minimalism", I don''t know, it seems that the branches/leaves are just too much part of the story for this to entirely work.  ~7</td>', 'It took me a moment to see the bird.  The leaves/branches/sky are quite lovely in this shot.  Actually, I like his picture quite a bit, it gives the bird and info about where the bird is.  But, as "minimalism", I don''t know, it seems that the branches/leaves are just too much part of the story for this to entirely work.  ~7', '2005-05-01 16:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349658, 170937, 35804, '<td valign="top">So simple and understated...love the rich warm hues and subtle textures. This really fits the challenge...there is no guessing about the subect of this picture is, at least for me that is...great title too. Very nicely done.</td>', 'So simple and understated...love the rich warm hues and subtle textures. This really fits the challenge...there is no guessing about the subect of this picture is, at least for me that is...great title too. Very nicely done.', '2005-05-01 16:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
