(1349663, 171250, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like this as a concept for minimalist.  However, IMO the picture might work better if the bottom 1/8 to 1/6 were eliminated (move camera up a little).  But that''s just an idea.</td>', 'I like this as a concept for minimalist.  However, IMO the picture might work better if the bottom 1/8 to 1/6 were eliminated (move camera up a little).  But that''s just an idea.', '2005-05-01 16:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
