(1349678, 171283, 35804, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is about this picture but I love it...for some reason it has a really cool, hep, mid century feel to it in my biased opinion ( I love all things that smack of mid-centuryishness)...maybe it''s the 8 ball? Nice, clean, simple.</td>', 'I don''t know what it is about this picture but I love it...for some reason it has a really cool, hep, mid century feel to it in my biased opinion ( I love all things that smack of mid-centuryishness)...maybe it''s the 8 ball? Nice, clean, simple.', '2005-05-01 16:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
