(1349689, 171129, 35804, '<td valign="top">Ohhh....this is beautiful...the velvet texture of the flower surrounded by a lush coolness...is it water...is it ice...I do not know but I do know it is lovely...beautiful light.</td>', 'Ohhh....this is beautiful...the velvet texture of the flower surrounded by a lush coolness...is it water...is it ice...I do not know but I do know it is lovely...beautiful light.', '2005-05-01 16:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349690, 171174, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is so desolate...I love it...the limited color pallette, the sad little bear, the beautifully textured grass, the ominous gray sky...very effective.</td>', 'This is so desolate...I love it...the limited color pallette, the sad little bear, the beautifully textured grass, the ominous gray sky...very effective.', '2005-05-01 16:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349691, 169422, 5112, '<td valign="top">I see it :)  I think your idea is good, but the picture is too busy to work for minimalism (or to showcase the ant).</td>', 'I see it :)  I think your idea is good, but the picture is too busy to work for minimalism (or to showcase the ant).', '2005-05-01 16:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349693, 170536, 5112, '<td valign="top">Ahh, I like the idea, very much!  Actually, this is an excellent composition.  I am not sure it quite works for "minimalism", as there are (at least) two points of interest, but it''s a great idea.  Also, the background is so beautiful that it takes away attention from the cat.  Hmmmm.  You should try many more pictures at this place :)  ~7</td>', 'Ahh, I like the idea, very much!  Actually, this is an excellent composition.  I am not sure it quite works for "minimalism", as there are (at least) two points of interest, but it''s a great idea.  Also, the background is so beautiful that it takes away attention from the cat.  Hmmmm.  You should try many more pictures at this place :)  ~7', '2005-05-01 16:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349695, 170297, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, quick reflexes!</td>', 'Wow, quick reflexes!', '2005-05-01 16:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
