(1349771, 168944, 34154, '<td valign="top">i love how much space is above and below him, this is a nice shot. the stop light is a little busy but it sort of helps to make the open air seem more open</td>', 'i love how much space is above and below him, this is a nice shot. the stop light is a little busy but it sort of helps to make the open air seem more open', '2005-05-01 17:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1349774, 171279, 16488, '<td valign="top">This is a powerful way to address a centered composition....however...<br/>It would be nice to see better focus on the flower since there is little rest for the eye, I just want some reward for all the work my mind must do.  Unfortunately, there are points to rest on and they seem to be bits of sensor dust.  In an advance editing challenge those could be easily addressed with cloning, of course.</td>', 'This is a powerful way to address a centered composition....however...It would be nice to see better focus on the flower since there is little rest for the eye, I just want some reward for all the work my mind must do.  Unfortunately, there are points to rest on and they seem to be bits of sensor dust.  In an advance editing challenge those could be easily addressed with cloning, of course.', '2005-05-01 17:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
