(1350041, 171000, 16488, '<td valign="top">Chickadees are some of my favorite birds!  Great use of DOF!  To be more perfect the tip of the tail would have to be present.  Still one of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Chickadees are some of my favorite birds!  Great use of DOF!  To be more perfect the tip of the tail would have to be present.  Still one of my favorites in this challenge.', '2005-05-01 19:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
