(1350073, 171268, 27901, '<td valign="top">Well it would surprise me a LOT if this is not in Iceland. Great picture, lightning and the lava makes great life in it in contrast with the powerful clouds.</td>', 'Well it would surprise me a LOT if this is not in Iceland. Great picture, lightning and the lava makes great life in it in contrast with the powerful clouds.', '2005-05-01 19:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
