(1351404, 170371, 24549, '<td valign="top">now that''s minimal....</td>', 'now that''s minimal....', '2005-05-02 03:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351477, 169353, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks like it''s been processed to death. If it starts out so fuzzy that it takes this much USM to make it sharp you might be better off trying to make the blur look intentional / artistic. The colors look rather washed-out / overexposed / under-saturated. I think that the composition in general is good; all of the elements seem to direct my attention to the stone arch on the right. Had the rules allowed it, giving that some kind of special treatment in post-processing (making it pitch black to add an air of mystery, etc.) would have enhanced the image. <br/></td>', 'This looks like it''s been processed to death. If it starts out so fuzzy that it takes this much USM to make it sharp you might be better off trying to make the blur look intentional / artistic. The colors look rather washed-out / overexposed / under-saturated. I think that the composition in general is good; all of the elements seem to direct my attention to the stone arch on the right. Had the rules allowed it, giving that some kind of special treatment in post-processing (making it pitch black to add an air of mystery, etc.) would have enhanced the image. ', '2005-05-02 03:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351508, 170150, 10261, '<td valign="top">The horizon is level or darn close to it, but something about this composition makes it look tilted to the left. I like the shadow idea, but in minimalism there''s so little to look at that everything has to work well, and somehow this doesn''t feel right. Maybe it''s the oddly parted fingers or the angle of the arm. Placing the focal point in the center of the frame divides it in half and makes me focus on the sides of the image (which contain slightly dirty tiles) rather than the shadow. Given the grid-like background, you probably should try to keep the shadows either as linear as possible (echoing the background) or as non-linear as possible (to be complemented by the background). Given the bland color of the tiles you might have been better off going to B&amp;W or throwing in a flower or something as an isolated spot of color.<br/> <br/></td>', 'The horizon is level or darn close to it, but something about this composition makes it look tilted to the left. I like the shadow idea, but in minimalism there''s so little to look at that everything has to work well, and somehow this doesn''t feel right. Maybe it''s the oddly parted fingers or the angle of the arm. Placing the focal point in the center of the frame divides it in half and makes me focus on the sides of the image (which contain slightly dirty tiles) rather than the shadow. Given the grid-like background, you probably should try to keep the shadows either as linear as possible (echoing the background) or as non-linear as possible (to be complemented by the background). Given the bland color of the tiles you might have been better off going to B&W or throwing in a flower or something as an isolated spot of color. ', '2005-05-02 04:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351516, 169789, 10261, '<td valign="top">The light here is a little harsh, and the dynamic range of the scene is a bit more than your camera can handle. I realize that small rabbits can be quite skittish, but a fill flash or something to bounce some light onto the near side of the rabbit would have helped to even out the illumination. The B&amp;W really brings out the textures in the scene.<br/></td>', 'The light here is a little harsh, and the dynamic range of the scene is a bit more than your camera can handle. I realize that small rabbits can be quite skittish, but a fill flash or something to bounce some light onto the near side of the rabbit would have helped to even out the illumination. The B&W really brings out the textures in the scene.', '2005-05-02 04:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351524, 171268, 10261, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition; the yellow mile markers do a nice job of framing the image and accentuating the depth of the scene. The figure would be easier to see if he didn''t blend in with the mountain in the background, but I imagine that the mountain was unwilling to move. Perhaps it would help if the model were wearing a different color of clothing.</td>', 'I really like this composition; the yellow mile markers do a nice job of framing the image and accentuating the depth of the scene. The figure would be easier to see if he didn''t blend in with the mountain in the background, but I imagine that the mountain was unwilling to move. Perhaps it would help if the model were wearing a different color of clothing.', '2005-05-02 04:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351528, 171101, 10261, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Is this the flower''s real color? My only criticism is that there are a few dents in the top two petals which I find a little bit distracting.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Is this the flower''s real color? My only criticism is that there are a few dents in the top two petals which I find a little bit distracting.', '2005-05-02 04:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351537, 171372, 10261, '<td valign="top">Without the title I may not have even figured out what this was. The ripples in the water look blocky; I imagine that if you fiddled with the settings for awhile longer you could reduce the compression and still stay under the file size restriction.<br/></td>', 'Without the title I may not have even figured out what this was. The ripples in the water look blocky; I imagine that if you fiddled with the settings for awhile longer you could reduce the compression and still stay under the file size restriction.', '2005-05-02 04:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351540, 170875, 10261, '<td valign="top">The contrast works well here. I think that I would have preferred to see this framed horizontally rather than vertically.</td>', 'The contrast works well here. I think that I would have preferred to see this framed horizontally rather than vertically.', '2005-05-02 04:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351543, 169301, 36722, '<td valign="top">cannot see what this has to do with the challenge - unless you mean the boat, which does not attract any attention. photo is OK but just not minimalist at all.</td>', 'cannot see what this has to do with the challenge - unless you mean the boat, which does not attract any attention. photo is OK but just not minimalist at all.', '2005-05-02 04:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351546, 171089, 10261, '<td valign="top">The light is rather harsh; placing a piece of paper below the camera to bounce some light back onto the near side of the flowers would have helped quite a bit, but you probably would have had better results if this wasn''t done so close to noon. I find the leaves in the bottom left corner distracting.</td>', 'The light is rather harsh; placing a piece of paper below the camera to bounce some light back onto the near side of the flowers would have helped quite a bit, but you probably would have had better results if this wasn''t done so close to noon. I find the leaves in the bottom left corner distracting.', '2005-05-02 04:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351548, 171293, 36722, '<td valign="top">well done - meets the challenge well, good title, good subject matter, nice title. just could have been a tad sharper.</td>', 'well done - meets the challenge well, good title, good subject matter, nice title. just could have been a tad sharper.', '2005-05-02 04:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351551, 169023, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the gradient in the sky, but I would have preferred this without the moon. I''m sure it looked very nice in person, but the moon always looks very small in photographs unless it''s the only thing in the photo (Google for "moon illusion" for information on why).</td>', 'I like the gradient in the sky, but I would have preferred this without the moon. I''m sure it looked very nice in person, but the moon always looks very small in photographs unless it''s the only thing in the photo (Google for "moon illusion" for information on why).', '2005-05-02 04:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351553, 169429, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that a touch more light from the right side would have made me like this a little better.</td>', 'I think that a touch more light from the right side would have made me like this a little better.', '2005-05-02 04:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351556, 169270, 36722, '<td valign="top">i really like it - the cups are very much there and still not the most important part of the photo, which is definitely the flower. an original twist to the challenge.</td>', 'i really like it - the cups are very much there and still not the most important part of the photo, which is definitely the flower. an original twist to the challenge.', '2005-05-02 04:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351559, 169573, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that I would have chopped off a lot more on the edges to emphasize the depth of the scene.</td>', 'I think that I would have chopped off a lot more on the edges to emphasize the depth of the scene.', '2005-05-02 04:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351560, 170570, 10261, '<td valign="top">I realize that this is probably what it looked like in person, but the fuzzy cloud makes the focus look overly-soft.</td>', 'I realize that this is probably what it looked like in person, but the fuzzy cloud makes the focus look overly-soft.', '2005-05-02 04:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351564, 169996, 36722, '<td valign="top">not really out of focus, but for a photo like this it needs to be brilliantly sharp and it isn''t. and the positioning could have been made more interesting - this way the moon doesn''t interact with the rest of the photo.</td>', 'not really out of focus, but for a photo like this it needs to be brilliantly sharp and it isn''t. and the positioning could have been made more interesting - this way the moon doesn''t interact with the rest of the photo.', '2005-05-02 04:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351565, 170874, 10261, '<td valign="top">If the break contained some recognizable element (such as a barb on a barbed wire fence) I''d appreciate it''s contribution to the image. As it is it''s just kind of distracting.</td>', 'If the break contained some recognizable element (such as a barb on a barbed wire fence) I''d appreciate it''s contribution to the image. As it is it''s just kind of distracting.', '2005-05-02 04:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351567, 171177, 36722, '<td valign="top">nice and i guess it''s minimal, but not in the way it was phrased in this challenge.</td>', 'nice and i guess it''s minimal, but not in the way it was phrased in this challenge.', '2005-05-02 04:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351572, 169577, 10261, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to see the boats a little higher in the frame. The border really stands out from the image; since I feel that borders are usually supposed to unobtrusively complement the image, this may not be a good thing.</td>', 'I would have preferred to see the boats a little higher in the frame. The border really stands out from the image; since I feel that borders are usually supposed to unobtrusively complement the image, this may not be a good thing.', '2005-05-02 04:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351575, 171283, 36722, '<td valign="top">bottom of the photo is too cluttered, and the sky above the ball has no function.</td>', 'bottom of the photo is too cluttered, and the sky above the ball has no function.', '2005-05-02 04:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351582, 171077, 10261, '<td valign="top">Placing the trap near the center of the image seems kind of boring. Viewing the trap from the side or from the perspective of an approaching rodent might have really improved this shot, but probably would have reduced it''s minimalism.</td>', 'Placing the trap near the center of the image seems kind of boring. Viewing the trap from the side or from the perspective of an approaching rodent might have really improved this shot, but probably would have reduced it''s minimalism.', '2005-05-02 04:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351583, 170168, 36722, '<td valign="top">in this photo, the attention is drawn to the opening, not to the butterfly.</td>', 'in this photo, the attention is drawn to the opening, not to the butterfly.', '2005-05-02 04:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351587, 170598, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that I''d like this better without the bug. But then you''d probably have to shoot this closer to the web to render it recognizable. The border is a little thick, but I like it.</td>', 'I think that I''d like this better without the bug. But then you''d probably have to shoot this closer to the web to render it recognizable. The border is a little thick, but I like it.', '2005-05-02 04:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351588, 169794, 36722, '<td valign="top">please reread the challenge - nothing minimal about this photo. and couldn''t you think of anything more original to photograph than a dandelion?</td>', 'please reread the challenge - nothing minimal about this photo. and couldn''t you think of anything more original to photograph than a dandelion?', '2005-05-02 04:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351589, 170056, 10261, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh</td>', 'Nice bokeh', '2005-05-02 04:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351590, 170833, 36722, '<td valign="top">technical i see, but where is the minmalism?</td>', 'technical i see, but where is the minmalism?', '2005-05-02 04:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351591, 168989, 36722, '<td valign="top">good photo, not minimal.</td>', 'good photo, not minimal.', '2005-05-02 04:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351593, 170802, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is a little _too_ minimalistic for my tastes. Perhaps a few drips of lemon juice or a lime on the other edge of the frame would have helped.</td>', 'This is a little _too_ minimalistic for my tastes. Perhaps a few drips of lemon juice or a lime on the other edge of the frame would have helped.', '2005-05-02 04:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351595, 171266, 10261, '<td valign="top">The crop is a little too tight for my taste; it seems to create tension,  drawing my attention out of the frame in two conflicting directions.</td>', 'The crop is a little too tight for my taste; it seems to create tension,  drawing my attention out of the frame in two conflicting directions.', '2005-05-02 04:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351597, 170711, 36722, '<td valign="top">depends too much on the title - you shouldn''t have to tell viewers that someone''s there, they should see it. show, not tell.</td>', 'depends too much on the title - you shouldn''t have to tell viewers that someone''s there, they should see it. show, not tell.', '2005-05-02 04:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351599, 170617, 10261, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W does a good job of bringing out the textures. The flower seems a bit overexposed though.</td>', 'B&W does a good job of bringing out the textures. The flower seems a bit overexposed though.', '2005-05-02 04:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351605, 171175, 10261, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred this without the bizarre colors. Nice composition.</td>', 'I would have preferred this without the bizarre colors. Nice composition.', '2005-05-02 04:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351609, 170832, 36722, '<td valign="top">i hate to be picky about a brilliant and difficult photo like this, but it really needs to be even sharper at the drop.</td>', 'i hate to be picky about a brilliant and difficult photo like this, but it really needs to be even sharper at the drop.', '2005-05-02 04:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351615, 171259, 36722, '<td valign="top">there is nothing i want to see on this photo, and it still manages to get cluttered. it would already improve a lot if you''d have just one or two trees or lampposts instead of five.</td>', 'there is nothing i want to see on this photo, and it still manages to get cluttered. it would already improve a lot if you''d have just one or two trees or lampposts instead of five.', '2005-05-02 04:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351617, 169480, 36722, '<td valign="top">too dark. you probably had a reason for it but it does not work for me.</td>', 'too dark. you probably had a reason for it but it does not work for me.', '2005-05-02 04:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351620, 169768, 36722, '<td valign="top">putting something smack in the middle of the photo is not an interesting way to attract attention to it. and the rest of the photo should be  cleaner than this, or possibly more interesting.</td>', 'putting something smack in the middle of the photo is not an interesting way to attract attention to it. and the rest of the photo should be  cleaner than this, or possibly more interesting.', '2005-05-02 04:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351623, 170478, 36722, '<td valign="top">seems out of focus.</td>', 'seems out of focus.', '2005-05-02 04:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351625, 170394, 36722, '<td valign="top">this works.<br/>the boat is a strong enough image to handle both  the wave in the foreground and the clouds.<br/>strong, simple, clean.</td>', 'this works.the boat is a strong enough image to handle both  the wave in the foreground and the clouds.strong, simple, clean.', '2005-05-02 04:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351626, 170269, 34852, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Just the border is a ititle bit to thick.. or it would have been better without?.... Anyway a good shot!</td>', 'Beautiful! Just the border is a ititle bit to thick.. or it would have been better without?.... Anyway a good shot!', '2005-05-02 04:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351628, 170314, 36722, '<td valign="top">strong image - and then the hand pulls you in even deeper. like it a lot.<br/></td>', 'strong image - and then the hand pulls you in even deeper. like it a lot.', '2005-05-02 04:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351629, 171321, 34852, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. Great impact! [9]</td>', 'Very interesting. Great impact! [9]', '2005-05-02 04:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351630, 170269, 21202, '<td valign="top">I do not see the subject.  So I cannot determine if it is a strong point nor if it is very small.  I like the picture very much however,  although the border overwhelms.  A 4 is ths best I can give.</td>', 'I do not see the subject.  So I cannot determine if it is a strong point nor if it is very small.  I like the picture very much however,  although the border overwhelms.  A 4 is ths best I can give.', '2005-05-02 04:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351633, 169658, 36722, '<td valign="top">nice try - i wish i could articulate more clearly what it should do. just boring.</td>', 'nice try - i wish i could articulate more clearly what it should do. just boring.', '2005-05-02 04:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351636, 171296, 36722, '<td valign="top">i think the base is too large for the challenge. otherwise excellent photo.</td>', 'i think the base is too large for the challenge. otherwise excellent photo.', '2005-05-02 05:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351683, 169422, 36722, '<td valign="top">too cluttered. subject is not "the strong point of the image".</td>', 'too cluttered. subject is not "the strong point of the image".', '2005-05-02 05:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351687, 170071, 36722, '<td valign="top">nice try.<br/>would be more interesting if the subject had some kind of shape, and/or if it were positioned a bit more off-center.</td>', 'nice try.would be more interesting if the subject had some kind of shape, and/or if it were positioned a bit more off-center.', '2005-05-02 05:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351688, 171180, 36722, '<td valign="top">very beautiful photo. just not sure what it''s doing in this challenge.</td>', 'very beautiful photo. just not sure what it''s doing in this challenge.', '2005-05-02 05:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351689, 170906, 36722, '<td valign="top">nice photo, not minimal.</td>', 'nice photo, not minimal.', '2005-05-02 05:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351691, 170712, 34852, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The colours are great, the light and shadows too... The leafs look like brush strokes in a painting. Well executed photo.</td>', 'Beautiful! The colours are great, the light and shadows too... The leafs look like brush strokes in a painting. Well executed photo.', '2005-05-02 05:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351693, 170633, 36722, '<td valign="top">pity it''s basic editing here - could have done without the wire.<br/>otherwise good photo.</td>', 'pity it''s basic editing here - could have done without the wire.otherwise good photo.', '2005-05-02 05:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351694, 169308, 29474, '<td valign="top">This is out of focus.</td>', 'This is out of focus.', '2005-05-02 05:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351697, 170274, 36722, '<td valign="top">the color on the sky is overdone, and it probably would even detract too much from the subject if it wasn''t.</td>', 'the color on the sky is overdone, and it probably would even detract too much from the subject if it wasn''t.', '2005-05-02 05:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351699, 171266, 36722, '<td valign="top">seems strange to say, but this picture needs more space. with both the sun and the plane so near the edge it looks like you had a hard time getting them both in the picture.</td>', 'seems strange to say, but this picture needs more space. with both the sun and the plane so near the edge it looks like you had a hard time getting them both in the picture.', '2005-05-02 05:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351702, 171132, 36722, '<td valign="top">read the challenge description better and then go voice your patriotism somewhere else please.<br/>the flag is out of focus, too.</td>', 'read the challenge description better and then go voice your patriotism somewhere else please.the flag is out of focus, too.', '2005-05-02 05:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351704, 170397, 36722, '<td valign="top">much too dark.</td>', 'much too dark.', '2005-05-02 05:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
