(1353632, 169382, 6999, '<td valign="top">This has those elements of repetition and subtle variation that I associate with minimalism, absolutely. It lacks, however, an overall sense of simplicity: also a strong element; that may only be an impossibility of framing it against a more simple background - those big lines hurt the composition for me.</td>', 'This has those elements of repetition and subtle variation that I associate with minimalism, absolutely. It lacks, however, an overall sense of simplicity: also a strong element; that may only be an impossibility of framing it against a more simple background - those big lines hurt the composition for me.', '2005-05-02 20:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1353636, 171173, 6999, '<td valign="top">This I like: the merest hint of a real world beneath those clouds, and the near-abstract sun - for all of which weirdness an absolutely believeable reality. I suspect you''ve takn it too far from the real for the audience, but we shall see.</td>', 'This I like: the merest hint of a real world beneath those clouds, and the near-abstract sun - for all of which weirdness an absolutely believeable reality. I suspect you''ve takn it too far from the real for the audience, but we shall see.', '2005-05-02 20:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1353641, 171271, 6999, '<td valign="top">Impenetrable, I find this. Your distribution of focus seems perverse, and it lacks much sense of grace, photographically. That may well be absolutely as you intended ...</td>', 'Impenetrable, I find this. Your distribution of focus seems perverse, and it lacks much sense of grace, photographically. That may well be absolutely as you intended ...', '2005-05-02 20:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1353646, 170431, 6999, '<td valign="top">Impeccable composition - very clever to use that slight drift from the very strong lines of frame to impose a near-invisibility on your subject, and yet maintaining great detail, and wonderful tonality through the frame. It would, i suspect, be a hit as a print. It diesn''t actually speak of minimalsim in the srtistic sense, but certainly within our challenge description, it does: the subject is too uncomplicated for the art guys, I would say.</td>', 'Impeccable composition - very clever to use that slight drift from the very strong lines of frame to impose a near-invisibility on your subject, and yet maintaining great detail, and wonderful tonality through the frame. It would, i suspect, be a hit as a print. It diesn''t actually speak of minimalsim in the srtistic sense, but certainly within our challenge description, it does: the subject is too uncomplicated for the art guys, I would say.', '2005-05-02 20:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1353661, 171136, 22046, '<td valign="top">Beautiful atmosphere in this photo. Love the lighting and color. I find the object in the right forground to be distracting. I think it would help to clone or crop it out.</td>', 'Beautiful atmosphere in this photo. Love the lighting and color. I find the object in the right forground to be distracting. I think it would help to clone or crop it out.', '2005-05-02 20:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1353665, 171275, 32932, '<td valign="top">Good picture good colors perfectly balanced</td>', 'Good picture good colors perfectly balanced', '2005-05-02 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1353666, 171134, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that this works for me: sure, it absolutely meets the challenge description - but it isn''t within the spirit of minimalism for me - it wasn''t as simple as all this, I don''t think; it isn''t absence of information, rather the precise control of very limited, but nevertheless very important, information - yur big high-key background is simply a photographic nothingness. Accomplished shooting, doubtless, but ...</td>', 'I''m not sure that this works for me: sure, it absolutely meets the challenge description - but it isn''t within the spirit of minimalism for me - it wasn''t as simple as all this, I don''t think; it isn''t absence of information, rather the precise control of very limited, but nevertheless very important, information - yur big high-key background is simply a photographic nothingness. Accomplished shooting, doubtless, but ...', '2005-05-02 20:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1353672, 169863, 32932, '<td valign="top">very artistic, what is this? paper or?</td>', 'very artistic, what is this? paper or?', '2005-05-02 20:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1353674, 171174, 16790, '<td valign="top">Wow.. this reminds me of a photo I took awhile back!  This one''s way better, though - awesome tones, I like the desaturated feel, and the sharpness is fantastic.  I see a bit of grain, which I also really like for this shot.  Composition works for me, and it meets the challenge well - nice work!</td>', 'Wow.. this reminds me of a photo I took awhile back!  This one''s way better, though - awesome tones, I like the desaturated feel, and the sharpness is fantastic.  I see a bit of grain, which I also really like for this shot.  Composition works for me, and it meets the challenge well - nice work!', '2005-05-02 20:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1353681, 171243, 16790, '<td valign="top">I would love to see a bit more drama in the colour/tones of this, or (alternatively) a black and white conversion - sharpness is great, and it meets the challenge on both levels well.  Good job.</td>', 'I would love to see a bit more drama in the colour/tones of this, or (alternatively) a black and white conversion - sharpness is great, and it meets the challenge on both levels well.  Good job.', '2005-05-02 20:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
