(1354881, 171043, 25652, '<td valign="top">I''ve taken shots like this before, I applaud you on getting it in such low light conditions! However, I think the plane wing takes away from its minimalism, so I gotta drop my vote to 6. Sorry. It''s a tough shot to get, but compositionally it''s weak.</td>', 'I''ve taken shots like this before, I applaud you on getting it in such low light conditions! However, I think the plane wing takes away from its minimalism, so I gotta drop my vote to 6. Sorry. It''s a tough shot to get, but compositionally it''s weak.', '2005-05-03 03:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
