(1354920, 170168, 10261, '<td valign="top">If not for the title I probably would have missed the butterfly entirely. A shallower DOF would have helped to guide the viewer to the intended focal point. Because of the composition I was looking for a subject through the stone opening.</td>', 'If not for the title I probably would have missed the butterfly entirely. A shallower DOF would have helped to guide the viewer to the intended focal point. Because of the composition I was looking for a subject through the stone opening.', '2005-05-03 04:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
