(1355151, 170711, 21466, '<td valign="top">I''m failing to see how this qualifies for minimalism. I would like to point out that your entire building seems to be leaning to the right. Perhaps a quick visit in photoshop, crop, and rotate slightly to the right would have corrected this. <br/> <br/>Other than that it''s a nice picture of a church.</td>', 'I''m failing to see how this qualifies for minimalism. I would like to point out that your entire building seems to be leaning to the right. Perhaps a quick visit in photoshop, crop, and rotate slightly to the right would have corrected this.  Other than that it''s a nice picture of a church.', '2005-05-03 09:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1355154, 171098, 145, '<td valign="top">The hen is a small part of the picture, but I''m not sure of the minimalistic angle here. 4</td>', 'The hen is a small part of the picture, but I''m not sure of the minimalistic angle here. 4', '2005-05-03 09:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
