(1355181, 171177, 34247, '<td valign="top">fits quite well, imho, with the challenge theme, although no doubt some philistine would have said to you that this is too big to be minimal. bah. I like the way the light falls on the yellow, as well as some of the visible texturing on that cloth. 8, but bumping to 9 to overcompensate.</td>', 'fits quite well, imho, with the challenge theme, although no doubt some philistine would have said to you that this is too big to be minimal. bah. I like the way the light falls on the yellow, as well as some of the visible texturing on that cloth. 8, but bumping to 9 to overcompensate.', '2005-05-03 10:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1355182, 170658, 36499, '<td valign="top">IMO the tulips are very pretty but the tires just dont make for a nice photo. The vines make the photo cluttered looking and compete with the tires and the tulips for equal eye attention. love the title and what i think ur vision was for this photo. this might have been better with just a grass background instead(at least for me) i like that u didnt use negitive space...good luck...bumping up after sitting here looking at it :o)</td>', 'IMO the tulips are very pretty but the tires just dont make for a nice photo. The vines make the photo cluttered looking and compete with the tires and the tulips for equal eye attention. love the title and what i think ur vision was for this photo. this might have been better with just a grass background instead(at least for me) i like that u didnt use negitive space...good luck...bumping up after sitting here looking at it :o)', '2005-05-03 10:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1355184, 171091, 34247, '<td valign="top">I like this silhouette a lot. Nice minimalist pattern as background, and the polished floor does wonders with the light. 9</td>', 'I like this silhouette a lot. Nice minimalist pattern as background, and the polished floor does wonders with the light. 9', '2005-05-03 10:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
