(1356530, 170131, 27789, '<td valign="top">the leaves feel a little hot, and it would be nice if they filled up the entire background, rather than the orange-ish color.</td>', 'the leaves feel a little hot, and it would be nice if they filled up the entire background, rather than the orange-ish color.', '2005-05-03 19:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356531, 171098, 37226, '<td valign="top">I like it, but my eye begs for a wider angle on the right edge.  The idea seems cut off.</td>', 'I like it, but my eye begs for a wider angle on the right edge.  The idea seems cut off.', '2005-05-03 19:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356532, 171212, 37320, '<td valign="top">Is that really the word for when they do that.  If this wasnt the 12th duck shot Ive seen in this challenge I''d give you an 8.</td>', 'Is that really the word for when they do that.  If this wasnt the 12th duck shot Ive seen in this challenge I''d give you an 8.', '2005-05-03 19:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356534, 170841, 37226, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fabulous.</td>', 'Absolutely fabulous.', '2005-05-03 19:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356535, 169605, 37320, '<td valign="top">Another flower?</td>', 'Another flower?', '2005-05-03 19:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356538, 171220, 27789, '<td valign="top">normally i wouldn''t care for a subject right in the middle, but this one seems to work, where the texture of the field is interesting in and of itself.  It might be nice to be closer to the bird, but then that wasn''t the point of the challenge i guess</td>', 'normally i wouldn''t care for a subject right in the middle, but this one seems to work, where the texture of the field is interesting in and of itself.  It might be nice to be closer to the bird, but then that wasn''t the point of the challenge i guess', '2005-05-03 19:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356541, 170398, 37320, '<td valign="top">10 for photography, 3 for originality, 4 for subject size, 7 for composition.  Your average = 6</td>', '10 for photography, 3 for originality, 4 for subject size, 7 for composition.  Your average = 6', '2005-05-03 19:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356545, 169329, 27789, '<td valign="top">a good exploration of color and line</td>', 'a good exploration of color and line', '2005-05-03 19:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356547, 169785, 37320, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I woulda like to have seen a merlot and more background features.</td>', 'I like it, but I woulda like to have seen a merlot and more background features.', '2005-05-03 19:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356552, 169346, 37226, '<td valign="top">This is a great pic that leaves me begging for a slightly longer exposure.</td>', 'This is a great pic that leaves me begging for a slightly longer exposure.', '2005-05-03 19:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356553, 171278, 27789, '<td valign="top">lovely shot, good choice of B&amp;W</td>', 'lovely shot, good choice of B&W', '2005-05-03 19:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356554, 170623, 37320, '<td valign="top">Halogen burns longer and more efficient and the blue glow would add something your photo is missing.</td>', 'Halogen burns longer and more efficient and the blue glow would add something your photo is missing.', '2005-05-03 19:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356555, 169489, 37226, '<td valign="top">This is a great pic that would have more impact if the subject was farther away.</td>', 'This is a great pic that would have more impact if the subject was farther away.', '2005-05-03 19:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356561, 170479, 37320, '<td valign="top">That really looks like The Shell  gasoline shell, do a series of these with slogans of engine cleaning properties and talk to me later.  Sincerely, Exxon gas</td>', 'That really looks like The Shell  gasoline shell, do a series of these with slogans of engine cleaning properties and talk to me later.  Sincerely, Exxon gas', '2005-05-03 19:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356566, 170558, 37320, '<td valign="top">The new quarters lack the charm of the old ones, but that doesn''t detract too much from your photo.</td>', 'The new quarters lack the charm of the old ones, but that doesn''t detract too much from your photo.', '2005-05-03 19:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356570, 170817, 37320, '<td valign="top">This photo would be righteous if his surfboard was bright blue.  Check Ebay before you do this again it will really add to your picture, plus it will only set you back a few hundred dollars.</td>', 'This photo would be righteous if his surfboard was bright blue.  Check Ebay before you do this again it will really add to your picture, plus it will only set you back a few hundred dollars.', '2005-05-03 19:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356573, 169379, 37320, '<td valign="top">This spot is okay, but he is more likely to get some if he took her to Ipanema beach.  You''d be more likely to get a higher score as well.</td>', 'This spot is okay, but he is more likely to get some if he took her to Ipanema beach.  You''d be more likely to get a higher score as well.', '2005-05-03 19:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356576, 169482, 37320, '<td valign="top">I knew someone would capture the essence of all those duck photos without scaring those poor waterfowl.</td>', 'I knew someone would capture the essence of all those duck photos without scaring those poor waterfowl.', '2005-05-03 19:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356582, 171367, 37320, '<td valign="top">I like everything about your photo except the subject, I almost felt like I was on a deserted island.  put a computer set where the dog is and a unicycle where the jogger is and you''re in business.</td>', 'I like everything about your photo except the subject, I almost felt like I was on a deserted island.  put a computer set where the dog is and a unicycle where the jogger is and you''re in business.', '2005-05-03 19:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356585, 170474, 37320, '<td valign="top">Good subject, but poor background,  To avoid stalling gradually pull up especially under those conditions.</td>', 'Good subject, but poor background,  To avoid stalling gradually pull up especially under those conditions.', '2005-05-03 19:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356586, 170386, 19780, '<td valign="top">Wonderful textures, strong composition. 8</td>', 'Wonderful textures, strong composition. 8', '2005-05-03 19:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356587, 169787, 8860, '<td valign="top">Sweet idea, but I wish the seed was actually drifting inside the frame rather than stuck [supported?] outside.</td>', 'Sweet idea, but I wish the seed was actually drifting inside the frame rather than stuck [supported?] outside.', '2005-05-03 19:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356589, 171118, 37226, '<td valign="top">Oversaturated in my opinion, but enjoyable nonetheless.</td>', 'Oversaturated in my opinion, but enjoyable nonetheless.', '2005-05-03 19:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356591, 170801, 37320, '<td valign="top">Not enough minimalization, Im no gardener but I would have cut the other plants from the picture.</td>', 'Not enough minimalization, Im no gardener but I would have cut the other plants from the picture.', '2005-05-03 19:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356592, 170401, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint and comp.</td>', 'Great viewpoint and comp.', '2005-05-03 19:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356597, 169656, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very green! Wonderful contrast and colors. I was wondering if you tried the composition squared or with just slightly less negative space or perhaps didn''t crop the bottom so tightly.</td>', 'Very green! Wonderful contrast and colors. I was wondering if you tried the composition squared or with just slightly less negative space or perhaps didn''t crop the bottom so tightly.', '2005-05-03 19:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356599, 170639, 37320, '<td valign="top">Musta been one of them harbor-orthidontist mermaids, because typically they wear hockey gloves (its a cultural thing)</td>', 'Musta been one of them harbor-orthidontist mermaids, because typically they wear hockey gloves (its a cultural thing)', '2005-05-03 19:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356601, 170980, 8860, '<td valign="top">I hope this doesn''t get voted as low as I expect it to. It''s one of the most interesting in the challenge. It''s not typical, perfect fayre and the comp is not ideal but there''s something to look at here and I like the exposure, although a little longer could have given you more interesting light effects.</td>', 'I hope this doesn''t get voted as low as I expect it to. It''s one of the most interesting in the challenge. It''s not typical, perfect fayre and the comp is not ideal but there''s something to look at here and I like the exposure, although a little longer could have given you more interesting light effects.', '2005-05-03 19:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356603, 170805, 19780, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject. The highlights are a little blown out. Also, the subject is a little dusty - I often use a little paintbrush to dust off macro subjects.</td>', 'An interesting subject. The highlights are a little blown out. Also, the subject is a little dusty - I often use a little paintbrush to dust off macro subjects.', '2005-05-03 19:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356605, 171305, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very nice, simple composition. I like that I can see the red through the holes in the button. The red is a little blown out on the lower left. I''m curious if you experimented with different directions for the weave of the fabric. This is not as pleasing as it could be since it''s not really diagonal or vertical.</td>', 'Very nice, simple composition. I like that I can see the red through the holes in the button. The red is a little blown out on the lower left. I''m curious if you experimented with different directions for the weave of the fabric. This is not as pleasing as it could be since it''s not really diagonal or vertical.', '2005-05-03 19:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356607, 171128, 33002, '<td valign="top">love the color</td>', 'love the color', '2005-05-03 19:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356609, 169789, 37320, '<td valign="top">I knew breeding kittens with rabbits was a bad idea, but not as bad as choosing wood for a background</td>', 'I knew breeding kittens with rabbits was a bad idea, but not as bad as choosing wood for a background', '2005-05-03 19:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356610, 169706, 33002, '<td valign="top">What a great shot easy 10</td>', 'What a great shot easy 10', '2005-05-03 19:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356611, 169348, 37320, '<td valign="top">Minimize!</td>', 'Minimize!', '2005-05-03 19:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356612, 169515, 19780, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve got the right idea here, the idea of repetition and then the object that''s different as the subject. I wanted the iPod to pop a bit more, it''s a little small and a little dull looking (did you try it with the screen on?)</td>', 'I think you''ve got the right idea here, the idea of repetition and then the object that''s different as the subject. I wanted the iPod to pop a bit more, it''s a little small and a little dull looking (did you try it with the screen on?)', '2005-05-03 19:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356614, 169913, 33002, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, really like the color</td>', 'Nice shot, really like the color', '2005-05-03 19:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356615, 170599, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the stark background and the spiky thorns. I think I''d like to see more of the subject in the frame, they''re just a little too cut off for a pleasing composition for my taste.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the stark background and the spiky thorns. I think I''d like to see more of the subject in the frame, they''re just a little too cut off for a pleasing composition for my taste.', '2005-05-03 19:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356616, 170536, 33002, '<td valign="top">The door being out of focus, just doesn''t do it for me, other then that great shot</td>', 'The door being out of focus, just doesn''t do it for me, other then that great shot', '2005-05-03 19:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356619, 171354, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of an off centered composition with the kid on a blanket. I''m not sure about the gingham though, it seems to demand too much attention. Did you try having the baby in the frame a bit more, or less background?</td>', 'I like the idea of an off centered composition with the kid on a blanket. I''m not sure about the gingham though, it seems to demand too much attention. Did you try having the baby in the frame a bit more, or less background?', '2005-05-03 19:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356623, 171175, 19780, '<td valign="top">A very interesting take on this challenge, I like how the bottle has changed color and shape to play upon our expectations of what a coke bottle should look like.</td>', 'A very interesting take on this challenge, I like how the bottle has changed color and shape to play upon our expectations of what a coke bottle should look like.', '2005-05-03 19:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356625, 171236, 37320, '<td valign="top">I wish you would step back from that ledge my friend.  You could cut ties with all the lies that you''ve been living in..and if you would change your into more meaningful  attire..I would understand</td>', 'I wish you would step back from that ledge my friend.  You could cut ties with all the lies that you''ve been living in..and if you would change your into more meaningful  attire..I would understand', '2005-05-03 19:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356626, 169577, 33002, '<td valign="top">Nice I like the "clear-ness" and the colors</td>', 'Nice I like the "clear-ness" and the colors', '2005-05-03 19:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356629, 170727, 37320, '<td valign="top">Hey I see it now!</td>', 'Hey I see it now!', '2005-05-03 19:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356631, 171094, 33002, '<td valign="top">It seems to be a hard shot, but still it seems out of focus</td>', 'It seems to be a hard shot, but still it seems out of focus', '2005-05-03 19:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356632, 170564, 19780, '<td valign="top">I thought about marbles on concrete as a subject and was happy to see you chose it as a subject. It''s a nice marble and the strip of red in it is a great flash of color for this otherwise monotone picture. I''d like to see it a little more saturated. I''m not sure the dark and light helps the composition in this photo.</td>', 'I thought about marbles on concrete as a subject and was happy to see you chose it as a subject. It''s a nice marble and the strip of red in it is a great flash of color for this otherwise monotone picture. I''d like to see it a little more saturated. I''m not sure the dark and light helps the composition in this photo.', '2005-05-03 19:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356640, 171182, 33002, '<td valign="top">I also have a bird shot, these are always my fav. great job</td>', 'I also have a bird shot, these are always my fav. great job', '2005-05-03 19:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356642, 171118, 19780, '<td valign="top">The saturation of color is really fun. The composition is a little off to my eye, the steeple needs to be in or out a bit more to be balanced.</td>', 'The saturation of color is really fun. The composition is a little off to my eye, the steeple needs to be in or out a bit more to be balanced.', '2005-05-03 19:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356643, 170971, 37320, '<td valign="top">I would have used a bowling hat, those sun hats are soooo 1996</td>', 'I would have used a bowling hat, those sun hats are soooo 1996', '2005-05-03 19:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356644, 169875, 19780, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting idea - the composition is well done, the door and frame seem to disappear as the viewer focuses completely on what they can see through the crack in the door. There seems to be a bit of noise in teh photo, especially in the expanses of gray. The red towel is a nice plus.</td>', 'It''s an interesting idea - the composition is well done, the door and frame seem to disappear as the viewer focuses completely on what they can see through the crack in the door. There seems to be a bit of noise in teh photo, especially in the expanses of gray. The red towel is a nice plus.', '2005-05-03 19:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356645, 171128, 37320, '<td valign="top">Actually thats a Honeysickle, midnight blues are similar but are strictly a sub-tropical species.  Good framing.</td>', 'Actually thats a Honeysickle, midnight blues are similar but are strictly a sub-tropical species.  Good framing.', '2005-05-03 19:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356649, 170270, 19780, '<td valign="top">The backlight seems blown out and makes the squirrel appear fuzzy. The composition isn''t really minimalist, but I do appreciate the squirrel''s casual pose with his paw up on the tree.</td>', 'The backlight seems blown out and makes the squirrel appear fuzzy. The composition isn''t really minimalist, but I do appreciate the squirrel''s casual pose with his paw up on the tree.', '2005-05-03 19:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356650, 171124, 37320, '<td valign="top">Now here is a picture with some balls to it!</td>', 'Now here is a picture with some balls to it!', '2005-05-03 19:56:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1356652, 169235, 37320, '<td valign="top">I like your subject, good face for this piece.</td>', 'I like your subject, good face for this piece.', '2005-05-03 19:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356655, 169978, 19780, '<td valign="top">I really wanted to like this photo more. I like the idea of it, but the colors just aren''t compelling enough to draw me in. The fluorescent floater just doesn''t pop for me. I like that you caught such a glassy reflection.</td>', 'I really wanted to like this photo more. I like the idea of it, but the colors just aren''t compelling enough to draw me in. The fluorescent floater just doesn''t pop for me. I like that you caught such a glassy reflection.', '2005-05-03 19:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356656, 169945, 37320, '<td valign="top">This is what I felt like last night, however this picture does not make me want to hurl and hit on ugly people.  I like it.</td>', 'This is what I felt like last night, however this picture does not make me want to hurl and hit on ugly people.  I like it.', '2005-05-03 19:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356657, 171069, 37320, '<td valign="top">Im still hungry.....for more!</td>', 'Im still hungry.....for more!', '2005-05-03 19:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356658, 171223, 19780, '<td valign="top">I think the composition is a bit too muddled with all the different types of lines going through (the branches and sticks). If it were the same tree and same type of lines, I think it would help the minimalism (reducing the elements). The photo looks oversharpened.</td>', 'I think the composition is a bit too muddled with all the different types of lines going through (the branches and sticks). If it were the same tree and same type of lines, I think it would help the minimalism (reducing the elements). The photo looks oversharpened.', '2005-05-03 19:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356661, 171091, 37320, '<td valign="top">They perfer to be called elderly.</td>', 'They perfer to be called elderly.', '2005-05-03 19:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356665, 169815, 19780, '<td valign="top">The photo has a late night "surprise!" feel to it. The colors and detail are muddy and the lighting too dim yet harsh. But your composition is solid if those oher elements were fixed - I like how blocky the frame is laid out.</td>', 'The photo has a late night "surprise!" feel to it. The colors and detail are muddy and the lighting too dim yet harsh. But your composition is solid if those oher elements were fixed - I like how blocky the frame is laid out.', '2005-05-03 20:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356666, 171153, 37320, '<td valign="top">Im tired of flower pictures but you get points for knowing the name of the species.</td>', 'Im tired of flower pictures but you get points for knowing the name of the species.', '2005-05-03 20:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356668, 169975, 19780, '<td valign="top">What a fun subject. I wish the photo had more contrast. I like the gradient of light across the wall and think that more of a pop on the little door would help.</td>', 'What a fun subject. I wish the photo had more contrast. I like the gradient of light across the wall and think that more of a pop on the little door would help.', '2005-05-03 20:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356674, 171328, 37320, '<td valign="top">Thats unfortunate, in CA we get 6.75, but then again we also have a higher cost of living.  You should have photographed the equivilent in Yen, Euros, or shillings because there are other money ones out there.</td>', 'Thats unfortunate, in CA we get 6.75, but then again we also have a higher cost of living.  You should have photographed the equivilent in Yen, Euros, or shillings because there are other money ones out there.', '2005-05-03 20:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356675, 171174, 37226, '<td valign="top">You captured the emotion brilliantly.</td>', 'You captured the emotion brilliantly.', '2005-05-03 20:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356683, 169557, 37320, '<td valign="top">Bengs are not in anymore.  Bottom right framing of young kids isn''t that new either.</td>', 'Bengs are not in anymore.  Bottom right framing of young kids isn''t that new either.', '2005-05-03 20:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356688, 171344, 37320, '<td valign="top">No way, all blacks all the way, if this wasnt a good picture Id give you a bad grade.</td>', 'No way, all blacks all the way, if this wasnt a good picture Id give you a bad grade.', '2005-05-03 20:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356689, 170698, 37320, '<td valign="top">Take off the sweater, how lazy can you be??</td>', 'Take off the sweater, how lazy can you be??', '2005-05-03 20:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356691, 171081, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very cute little fella and a nice shot too. Crop is a tad too tight at the bottom and I wonder if you should have cropped it along the straight edge of the reed and rotated slightly to horizontal. Cute.</td>', 'Very cute little fella and a nice shot too. Crop is a tad too tight at the bottom and I wonder if you should have cropped it along the straight edge of the reed and rotated slightly to horizontal. Cute.', '2005-05-03 20:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356692, 170109, 37320, '<td valign="top">Hurdle this...a 6</td>', 'Hurdle this...a 6', '2005-05-03 20:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356710, 170711, 20068, '<td valign="top">I keep wanting to tilt my head to the right just a bit.  The haze along top left works for me, as does the person in front of the door.</td>', 'I keep wanting to tilt my head to the right just a bit.  The haze along top left works for me, as does the person in front of the door.', '2005-05-03 20:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356716, 170817, 34134, '<td valign="top">Great sky. This looks VERY familiar.</td>', 'Great sky. This looks VERY familiar.', '2005-05-03 20:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356723, 171103, 20068, '<td valign="top">I like it, but it is a little too centered for me.</td>', 'I like it, but it is a little too centered for me.', '2005-05-03 20:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356733, 171076, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed.  I think that a different time of day with the lighting conditions just perfect this could be an awesome shot.  Is this a location that you can scope out first thing in the mornning and late in the evening to see where the sunlight falls on the crucifix?  It''s just the way that it is here is a little too monotone and your subject is lost in the textures...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely composed.  I think that a different time of day with the lighting conditions just perfect this could be an awesome shot.  Is this a location that you can scope out first thing in the mornning and late in the evening to see where the sunlight falls on the crucifix?  It''s just the way that it is here is a little too monotone and your subject is lost in the textures...TC', '2005-05-03 20:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356738, 169761, 9906, '<td valign="top">Lovely leading lines.  Maybe just a touch too contrasty.  Too bad your subject isn''t the strong point of the shot per the challenge directive...<br/>TC</td>', 'Lovely leading lines.  Maybe just a touch too contrasty.  Too bad your subject isn''t the strong point of the shot per the challenge directive...TC', '2005-05-03 20:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356746, 171013, 20068, '<td valign="top">looks noisy on my screen, which may be the plan, but the small flare and the speck in front of hand are distracting.</td>', 'looks noisy on my screen, which may be the plan, but the small flare and the speck in front of hand are distracting.', '2005-05-03 20:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356758, 171328, 30208, '<td valign="top">very crisp image.  I think it is the USM tool.  :)  I like it.</td>', 'very crisp image.  I think it is the USM tool.  :)  I like it.', '2005-05-03 20:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356771, 171102, 30208, '<td valign="top">right idea, but the subject could be better.</td>', 'right idea, but the subject could be better.', '2005-05-03 20:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356780, 171296, 9906, '<td valign="top">The harsh lighting and the placement of the players foot against the shadows makes this look almost unnatural.  Almost like the shoe is not in the right place...<br/>TC</td>', 'The harsh lighting and the placement of the players foot against the shadows makes this look almost unnatural.  Almost like the shoe is not in the right place...TC', '2005-05-03 20:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356783, 170088, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great concept, but you have a couple of minor flaws.  Too many unneeded objects in the frame (lawn chairs and whatever is below the sink on the right.  Also your subject needs much more light to make him the true focal point of the shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'Great concept, but you have a couple of minor flaws.  Too many unneeded objects in the frame (lawn chairs and whatever is below the sink on the right.  Also your subject needs much more light to make him the true focal point of the shot.TC', '2005-05-03 20:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356785, 171254, 9906, '<td valign="top">Shots of birds flying out of the frame always look unbalanced to me.  This would be perfect if he was flying into the frame...<br/>TC</td>', 'Shots of birds flying out of the frame always look unbalanced to me.  This would be perfect if he was flying into the frame...TC', '2005-05-03 20:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356787, 170371, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m confused.  Where is the subject?<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m confused.  Where is the subject?TC', '2005-05-03 20:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356792, 171193, 9906, '<td valign="top">A little more light on your subject and this would be damn near perfect.  Was this a candid or staged?  If it was staged, having a helper just outside of the frame with a big white piece of white poster board or some other reflector puting light on him would make this much more effective.<br/>TC</td>', 'A little more light on your subject and this would be damn near perfect.  Was this a candid or staged?  If it was staged, having a helper just outside of the frame with a big white piece of white poster board or some other reflector puting light on him would make this much more effective.TC', '2005-05-03 20:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356795, 169132, 9906, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  I just wish there was a little more focus and detail on the ant.  The edge of the ball is a little fuzzy too.<br/>TC</td>', 'Not bad.  I just wish there was a little more focus and detail on the ant.  The edge of the ball is a little fuzzy too.TC', '2005-05-03 20:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356799, 171263, 9906, '<td valign="top">Incredible!  Great take on the challenge.  You have minimalism down on both the artistic and the challenge details with this shot.  After the challenge, clone out that damn bouey and make this a print!<br/>TC</td>', 'Incredible!  Great take on the challenge.  You have minimalism down on both the artistic and the challenge details with this shot.  After the challenge, clone out that damn bouey and make this a print!TC', '2005-05-03 20:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356804, 171270, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  I''m a tad bit put off by the darkness of the background on the left.  It makes the shot seem just a bit off balanced.  Also for a shot like this I think you need to be much sharper on the flower (front to back) or go for a soft focus effect.  This looks stuck in between.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely composed.  I''m a tad bit put off by the darkness of the background on the left.  It makes the shot seem just a bit off balanced.  Also for a shot like this I think you need to be much sharper on the flower (front to back) or go for a soft focus effect.  This looks stuck in between.TC', '2005-05-03 20:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356806, 169355, 22046, '<td valign="top">Superb color and right on target for the topic</td>', 'Superb color and right on target for the topic', '2005-05-03 20:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356808, 168963, 22046, '<td valign="top">Yes this is right on target for the topic. Love the color. I might have included just a bit more of the ground but that is just a nit. Excellent work.</td>', 'Yes this is right on target for the topic. Love the color. I might have included just a bit more of the ground but that is just a nit. Excellent work.', '2005-05-03 20:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356813, 170551, 9906, '<td valign="top">I understand what you are going for here, but I''m put off a bit by the narrowness of the crop.  Your subject IMHO needs to be a touch sharper (maybe a bit more light on the subject and a bit less on the background would help here?)  Also, your bold border doesn''t add anything IMHO and pulls your eye to the outside instead of directing it to the image itself.<br/>TC</td>', 'I understand what you are going for here, but I''m put off a bit by the narrowness of the crop.  Your subject IMHO needs to be a touch sharper (maybe a bit more light on the subject and a bit less on the background would help here?)  Also, your bold border doesn''t add anything IMHO and pulls your eye to the outside instead of directing it to the image itself.TC', '2005-05-03 20:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356814, 169320, 22046, '<td valign="top">Good color and interesting balance.</td>', 'Good color and interesting balance.', '2005-05-03 20:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356817, 170479, 22046, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to take a walk along the beach. The spot of color in the shell makes this special.</td>', 'Makes me want to take a walk along the beach. The spot of color in the shell makes this special.', '2005-05-03 20:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356818, 171117, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and unusual perspective.  Crosswalk?<br/>TC</td>', 'Very interesting and unusual perspective.  Crosswalk?TC', '2005-05-03 20:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
