(1356826, 171321, 22046, '<td valign="top">What a unique approach to this theme. I really love the idea. The only thing that bothers me just a bit is the cleaner spot on his palm around the grain of rice. I still am giving this a 9 because I love the idea and the approach you took and the focus and colors are dead on.</td>', 'What a unique approach to this theme. I really love the idea. The only thing that bothers me just a bit is the cleaner spot on his palm around the grain of rice. I still am giving this a 9 because I love the idea and the approach you took and the focus and colors are dead on.', '2005-05-03 20:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356827, 171284, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re trying to say something by having the shot oriented in this way.  However; when I turn my head 90 degrees to the right, I see a much more powerfull composition.  Call me traditional...<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m sure you''re trying to say something by having the shot oriented in this way.  However; when I turn my head 90 degrees to the right, I see a much more powerfull composition.  Call me traditional...TC', '2005-05-03 20:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
