(1356911, 170655, 9906, '<td valign="top">I love your patriotism, but this shot lacks something to make it pop.  Also, how did you resize this for the site?  You have some very distinct color banding going on in the sky which looks kinda unnatural.<br/>TC</td>', 'I love your patriotism, but this shot lacks something to make it pop.  Also, how did you resize this for the site?  You have some very distinct color banding going on in the sky which looks kinda unnatural.TC', '2005-05-03 21:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
