(1357195, 170269, 8891, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit busy in the sky, but the exposure is excellent and I love the great colors and composition. 10.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit busy in the sky, but the exposure is excellent and I love the great colors and composition. 10.', '2005-05-03 23:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357196, 169783, 145, '<td valign="top">Nice color in the gnome. 6</td>', 'Nice color in the gnome. 6', '2005-05-03 23:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357198, 170401, 145, '<td valign="top">Maybe it is just my monitor, but the colors look a little flat. 6</td>', 'Maybe it is just my monitor, but the colors look a little flat. 6', '2005-05-03 23:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357200, 169482, 8891, '<td valign="top">Sublime. Like the composition and contrast of the feather to the smooth rolling water and the muted reflections. Like the feather reflection as well. 10.</td>', 'Sublime. Like the composition and contrast of the feather to the smooth rolling water and the muted reflections. Like the feather reflection as well. 10.', '2005-05-03 23:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357205, 169355, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great golden hues and superb reflections. Like the composition as well. I do not know your feeling about the lines in the upper third of the image. I sort of wish they were not there, but knowing that there was no way to lose them, legally, and there are faint enough, I let them go. 10. .....still my favorite. Hope you ribbon.</td>', 'Great golden hues and superb reflections. Like the composition as well. I do not know your feeling about the lines in the upper third of the image. I sort of wish they were not there, but knowing that there was no way to lose them, legally, and there are faint enough, I let them go. 10. .....still my favorite. Hope you ribbon.', '2005-05-03 23:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357206, 171177, 20068, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color.  If I saw this in a gallery, I would ask if the artist had a version with the fabric stretching the length of the frame, but I still find this a strong and dramatic piece.  There are a few lines or wrinkles in the fabric that distracted me just the slightest amount, but I suppose they give it  abit of character.  Good work.</td>', 'Beautiful color.  If I saw this in a gallery, I would ask if the artist had a version with the fabric stretching the length of the frame, but I still find this a strong and dramatic piece.  There are a few lines or wrinkles in the fabric that distracted me just the slightest amount, but I suppose they give it  abit of character.  Good work.', '2005-05-03 23:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357207, 170493, 145, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The shadow of the ball really adds to the shot. 6</td>', 'Nice idea. The shadow of the ball really adds to the shot. 6', '2005-05-03 23:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357211, 170599, 20068, '<td valign="top">like the subject.  I keep wanting to se emore light on the foreground, but the white gives it a wintery look, so maybe more light would change the mood.</td>', 'like the subject.  I keep wanting to se emore light on the foreground, but the white gives it a wintery look, so maybe more light would change the mood.', '2005-05-04 00:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
