(1357240, 171333, 20068, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this more with only one bird.  Like the clouds over the desolate-looking land.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this more with only one bird.  Like the clouds over the desolate-looking land.', '2005-05-04 00:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
