(1357390, 170753, 17507, '<td valign="top">Yay for submitting!<br/> <br/>Don''t be discouraged by the poor finish; my first showing was lousy, too, and I''ve gotten as low as the 4th percentile. You take good pictures--it''s just a lot harder to take a good picture that fits a theme within the space of a week than it is to take a good picture of whatever kind. I hope to see more of yours on here, and someday one on the front page :)</td>', 'Yay for submitting! Don''t be discouraged by the poor finish; my first showing was lousy, too, and I''ve gotten as low as the 4th percentile. You take good pictures--it''s just a lot harder to take a good picture that fits a theme within the space of a week than it is to take a good picture of whatever kind. I hope to see more of yours on here, and someday one on the front page :)', '2005-05-04 01:06:54.000000', NULL, 0),
