(1357798, 170614, 36299, '<td valign="top">How I scored it.<br/> <br/>1. Focus.<br/>2. All the black dots.  1 is minimal.<br/>3. Too much information, leads to lack of focus.<br/>4. The colour, the boat should be in contrast.<br/>5. It is not under sail.  I know, WHAT?  A sail boat in its minimal state, should be under sail.</td>', 'How I scored it. 1. Focus.2. All the black dots.  1 is minimal.3. Too much information, leads to lack of focus.4. The colour, the boat should be in contrast.5. It is not under sail.  I know, WHAT?  A sail boat in its minimal state, should be under sail.', '2005-05-04 02:23:20.000000', NULL, 0),
