(1357951, 169320, 9906, '<td valign="top">Most excellent in the words of Bill and Ted!  You definately deserve it!  Didn''t get to see this in voting, but if I did I would say:<br/>Perfection in lighting, superbly subtle in composition!  Love the way the boats tones are blending into the tones of the reflected trees and contrasted against the blues of the water.  Looks like a great place to take a nap!<br/>Yours TC</td>', 'Most excellent in the words of Bill and Ted!  You definately deserve it!  Didn''t get to see this in voting, but if I did I would say:Perfection in lighting, superbly subtle in composition!  Love the way the boats tones are blending into the tones of the reflected trees and contrasted against the blues of the water.  Looks like a great place to take a nap!Yours TC', '2005-05-04 03:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1357959, 169355, 23458, '<td valign="top">Hehehe, two aussies in a row in this particular position - that''s gotta be a record. Fantastic shot it was - definately caught my eye as a thumbnail during voting and the full size shot didn''t disappoint.</td>', 'Hehehe, two aussies in a row in this particular position - that''s gotta be a record. Fantastic shot it was - definately caught my eye as a thumbnail during voting and the full size shot didn''t disappoint.', '2005-05-04 03:06:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1357963, 169187, 31214, '<td valign="top">Just getting around to commenting on the last last bunch in this challenge.  The idea is compelling but I''d like to see it in color.  A little noise but not too distracting.  Good job.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-04 16:56:55.</i></td>', 'Just getting around to commenting on the last last bunch in this challenge.  The idea is compelling but I''d like to see it in color.  A little noise but not too distracting.  Good job.', '2005-05-04 03:07:29.000000', '2005-05-04 17:56:55.000000', 0),
(1358052, 171363, 20256, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and photograph.  It''s amazing that an individual pictured as the size of an ant, can still add that much character to the photograph.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and photograph.  It''s amazing that an individual pictured as the size of an ant, can still add that much character to the photograph.', '2005-05-04 03:33:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1358068, 169656, 13709, '<td valign="top">thank you all for your votes and comments!<br/>I appreciate your input! :)</td>', 'thank you all for your votes and comments!I appreciate your input! :)', '2005-05-04 03:42:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1358076, 169355, 22459, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for all the fantastic comments I was really blown away by the reaction this image received it was so awesome to get all those comments during the challenge and the congrats afterwards has certainly made me feel part of this community. And a big thank you to everyone who voted on this shot.<br/>I kept expecting the score to drop everytime I hit the update button (which was often) but to my surprise it didn''t. So I have had a very nervous and enjoyable week and once again thank you to the DPC community you ROCK!!</td>', 'Thank you everyone for all the fantastic comments I was really blown away by the reaction this image received it was so awesome to get all those comments during the challenge and the congrats afterwards has certainly made me feel part of this community. And a big thank you to everyone who voted on this shot.I kept expecting the score to drop everytime I hit the update button (which was often) but to my surprise it didn''t. So I have had a very nervous and enjoyable week and once again thank you to the DPC community you ROCK!!', '2005-05-04 03:46:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1358112, 169355, 25355, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! - another Aussie winning a blue in recent times. It''s a fantastic image - I''m sorry I didn''t get to vote for anything in this challenge, but this would have received a 10 from me.</td>', 'Congratulations! - another Aussie winning a blue in recent times. It''s a fantastic image - I''m sorry I didn''t get to vote for anything in this challenge, but this would have received a 10 from me.', '2005-05-04 03:55:53.000000', NULL, 0),
