(1358215, 170615, 35750, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by metoecus:</b></div><hr/><i> Are my eyes playing tricks on me, or is that pin slightly bent? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yup! I did not notice it until afterwards. Do you think it matters?</td>', 'Originally posted by metoecus: Are my eyes playing tricks on me, or is that pin slightly bent?   Yup! I did not notice it until afterwards. Do you think it matters?', '2005-05-04 04:53:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1358217, 169320, 21202, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Bear.  I did not get to see this during challenge.  It is truly beautiful.  The water is gorgeous as are the reflections.  I wouldn''t mind sitting a spell holding that fishin'' rod.</td>', 'Congratulations Bear.  I did not get to see this during challenge.  It is truly beautiful.  The water is gorgeous as are the reflections.  I wouldn''t mind sitting a spell holding that fishin'' rod.', '2005-05-04 04:54:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1358220, 169761, 35044, '<td valign="top">This was my highest rated pic - I love the tonality.  I take my hat off to you: your image captures minimalism fantastically.  You took it in the same area as I took my pic, though I never thought to use the stairs (I just liked the plain granite as a background).  I had kind of guessed that it must be you (esp. since you mentioned that you often walking around this area with your camera).  Unlucky not to have ribboned, but well done!</td>', 'This was my highest rated pic - I love the tonality.  I take my hat off to you: your image captures minimalism fantastically.  You took it in the same area as I took my pic, though I never thought to use the stairs (I just liked the plain granite as a background).  I had kind of guessed that it must be you (esp. since you mentioned that you often walking around this area with your camera).  Unlucky not to have ribboned, but well done!', '2005-05-04 04:59:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1358223, 169320, 13879, '<td valign="top">CONGRATULATIONS! A really beautiful &amp; serene image &amp; also your first ribbon! <br/> <br/>I am really chuffed for you!</td>', 'CONGRATULATIONS! A really beautiful & serene image & also your first ribbon!  I am really chuffed for you!', '2005-05-04 05:05:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1358224, 169355, 11738, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  I attempted something like this a while back<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=165980" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/11738/thumb/165980.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/11738/thumb/165980.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/11738/thumb/165980.jpg"/></a> <br/>I like yours better.</td>', 'Awesome shot.  I attempted something like this a while back I like yours better.', '2005-05-04 05:05:53.000000', NULL, 0);
