(1358365, 170250, 32259, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your great comment´s. Nice to hear those good comment´s during voting. I know now that voters here on dpc want to see pictures that fit perfectly in rule of thirds. I tried cropping the photo so it would fit rule of third but I like it more like this (uncropped), this photo is almost straigt out of the camera.<br/>This picture dosen´t fit the challenge very well, but i just wanted to start participating in challenges and I didn´t expect high scores.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-04 21:34:56.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all your great comment´s. Nice to hear those good comment´s during voting. I know now that voters here on dpc want to see pictures that fit perfectly in rule of thirds. I tried cropping the photo so it would fit rule of third but I like it more like this (uncropped), this photo is almost straigt out of the camera.This picture dosen´t fit the challenge very well, but i just wanted to start participating in challenges and I didn´t expect high scores.', '2005-05-04 06:36:38.000000', '2005-05-04 22:34:56.000000', 0),
