(1358800, 170314, 36583, '<td valign="top">Well, the score for the hand in the ball is 24 comments in favor and 10 comments opposed (at least counting those comments that explicitly mention the hand).<br/> <br/>I shot two versions of the picture, one with the hand and one without, but I thought that the "action" of turning off the light helped meet the "strong point of the image, but only occupying a very small portion of the image space" as stated in the challenge.<br/> <br/>This was my first challenge submission, so thanks for all the comments!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-04 12:12:58.</i></td>', 'Well, the score for the hand in the ball is 24 comments in favor and 10 comments opposed (at least counting those comments that explicitly mention the hand). I shot two versions of the picture, one with the hand and one without, but I thought that the "action" of turning off the light helped meet the "strong point of the image, but only occupying a very small portion of the image space" as stated in the challenge. This was my first challenge submission, so thanks for all the comments!', '2005-05-04 09:29:58.000000', '2005-05-04 13:12:58.000000', 0),
(1358806, 171252, 32321, '<td valign="top">Point &amp; Shoot Challenge/Fun/work around<br/> <br/>Set f-stop at 2<br/>Candle on a black cloth and background<br/>Placed a white background behind the candle<br/>Set the timer<br/>Located the Focus point on the back of the candle<br/>Depressed shutter button so camera could do its thing<br/>As timer was counting down, I removed the white background, repositioned candle within frame, and turned of the light in the room.<br/>Minor USM after<br/></td>', 'Point & Shoot Challenge/Fun/work around Set f-stop at 2Candle on a black cloth and backgroundPlaced a white background behind the candleSet the timerLocated the Focus point on the back of the candleDepressed shutter button so camera could do its thingAs timer was counting down, I removed the white background, repositioned candle within frame, and turned of the light in the room.Minor USM after', '2005-05-04 09:31:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1358818, 169320, 31606, '<td valign="top">Long time coming already.....saw this and new it would ribbon.....congrats Robert....A well deserved ribbon......</td>', 'Long time coming already.....saw this and new it would ribbon.....congrats Robert....A well deserved ribbon......', '2005-05-04 09:35:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1358830, 171153, 34868, '<td valign="top">From Critique Club:<br/> <br/>beckttboots<br/> <br/>Over all image impact is excellent, the use of negative space, and color make this a very interesting image. The lighting was well set and almost no shadows. The strong offset placement of the flower adds impact to the image. I feel this should have placed much higher than it did. The fact you used what you had on hand for lighting and background only make this a more impressive image.<br/> <br/>As with any image, one could find fault with some part of it, if you look hard enough. I have only one thing to add, and that is you could have made the flower maybe just a tad darker, not much, just a bit. Having said that I still think this is a good strong image.<br/> <br/>It would seem that I am in the minority, seeing how this placed in the challenge. That is what makes art, art. Just because this placed low in the challenge does not lessen the quality if the image.<br/> <br/>Well done, keep up the good work<br/></td>', 'From Critique Club: beckttboots Over all image impact is excellent, the use of negative space, and color make this a very interesting image. The lighting was well set and almost no shadows. The strong offset placement of the flower adds impact to the image. I feel this should have placed much higher than it did. The fact you used what you had on hand for lighting and background only make this a more impressive image. As with any image, one could find fault with some part of it, if you look hard enough. I have only one thing to add, and that is you could have made the flower maybe just a tad darker, not much, just a bit. Having said that I still think this is a good strong image. It would seem that I am in the minority, seeing how this placed in the challenge. That is what makes art, art. Just because this placed low in the challenge does not lessen the quality if the image. Well done, keep up the good work', '2005-05-04 09:42:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1358849, 171363, 5792, '<td valign="top">Congrats on another good score. Did not vote but do like this one a lot. Good minimalism and B&amp;W is the right choice for it. Man, break out that heated wetsuit, you gotta be pretty hard core to surf the northern Oregon coast. Burrrr! :)</td>', 'Congrats on another good score. Did not vote but do like this one a lot. Good minimalism and B&W is the right choice for it. Man, break out that heated wetsuit, you gotta be pretty hard core to surf the northern Oregon coast. Burrrr! :)', '2005-05-04 09:50:05.000000', NULL, 0),
