(1358965, 171073, 2223, '<td valign="top">Great job Robert!</td>', 'Great job Robert!', '2005-05-04 10:21:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1359036, 169761, 27845, '<td valign="top">This is so cool! I like the almost floating, surreal feeling about your image. I''ve seldom seen lines that string in any image. The various textures and patterns along with a great tonal range make this an absolute favourite. Congrats on your green ribbon, I think it should have been a blue one.</td>', 'This is so cool! I like the almost floating, surreal feeling about your image. I''ve seldom seen lines that string in any image. The various textures and patterns along with a great tonal range make this an absolute favourite. Congrats on your green ribbon, I think it should have been a blue one.', '2005-05-04 10:36:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1359055, 170639, 35804, '<td valign="top">I CANNOT believe this picture placed where it did...this should be at the top, this is just so wrong. This is a truly wonderful picture in every way...and some of the comments just don''t make a shread of sense...some seem so nitpicky and not very enlightened...this is wonderful ARTISTIC picture. Keep up the AWESOME work. : }</td>', 'I CANNOT believe this picture placed where it did...this should be at the top, this is just so wrong. This is a truly wonderful picture in every way...and some of the comments just don''t make a shread of sense...some seem so nitpicky and not very enlightened...this is wonderful ARTISTIC picture. Keep up the AWESOME work. : }', '2005-05-04 10:39:45.000000', NULL, 0),
