(1361065, 169761, 14603, '<td valign="top">What a fabulous image !<br/>Simple and powerful at the same time...the introduction of the child on the steps really adds so much to the overall effect(for me).<br/> <br/>I`m starting to lose count of the number of 4th places you have had..(around your 4th perhaps?)<br/> <br/>I didn`t vote in this challenge but knowing how you previously felt about "selective desat", I doubt if I would have picked this out as your submission on that basis alone.<br/> <br/>Great stuff.<br/> <br/></td>', 'What a fabulous image !Simple and powerful at the same time...the introduction of the child on the steps really adds so much to the overall effect(for me). I`m starting to lose count of the number of 4th places you have had..(around your 4th perhaps?) I didn`t vote in this challenge but knowing how you previously felt about "selective desat", I doubt if I would have picked this out as your submission on that basis alone. Great stuff. ', '2005-05-04 19:15:15.000000', NULL, 0),
