(1361156, 171367, 24976, '<td valign="top">"Aloha and Thank you Kindly for your comments on my submission to the Minimalism Challenge.  Any additional comments would be welcome since a friend is requesting a print of this one..  Thank you again though for your time.  Renee :)"<br/> <br/>I think that apart from actually taking the photo again and changing the angle and things like that, I think this is pretty much a well finished piece and I wouldnt change anything about it. I like it. Plus your friend likes it as well :-)</td>', '"Aloha and Thank you Kindly for your comments on my submission to the Minimalism Challenge.  Any additional comments would be welcome since a friend is requesting a print of this one..  Thank you again though for your time.  Renee :)" I think that apart from actually taking the photo again and changing the angle and things like that, I think this is pretty much a well finished piece and I wouldnt change anything about it. I like it. Plus your friend likes it as well :-)', '2005-05-04 19:45:16.000000', NULL, 0),
