(1362147, 169320, 9581, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on taking third, what a lovely image! I like the peacefullness it has in it. Very calm blue is a nice color too that helps bring out that coolness and the blue really enhances the intire affect fading to the shade.. Well done!</td>', 'Congratulations on taking third, what a lovely image! I like the peacefullness it has in it. Very calm blue is a nice color too that helps bring out that coolness and the blue really enhances the intire affect fading to the shade.. Well done!', '2005-05-05 01:53:30.000000', NULL, 0),
