(1362535, 171293, 32239, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments.</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments.', '2005-05-05 08:04:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1362583, 170431, 29462, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the nice comments, when I spotted this shot I had very little time to perfect it as the yacht was emerging from the mist rapidly, I considered retaining more sea but my final crop really represented my vision so I stuck with it.<br/>Thanks again<br/> <br/>Pete</td>', 'Thanks for all the nice comments, when I spotted this shot I had very little time to perfect it as the yacht was emerging from the mist rapidly, I considered retaining more sea but my final crop really represented my vision so I stuck with it.Thanks again Pete', '2005-05-05 08:32:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1362607, 168822, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, when this popped up in the random photo thread, i thought i recognized it, but was looking at it as a standalone image (as opposed to a challenge entry).  my initial reaction was "interesting colors, but a little too in-your-face, without enough detail to be able to come to terms with the subject comfortably."  so, if that is what you were after, you succeeded.  if you just wanted to see how close in you could get and still have something in focus, you succeeded there, as well.  and if you were experimenting with color and bokeh, you also did well.<br/> <br/>as far as a challenge entry goes, i scored it a 4.  i didn''t think it met the challenge very well, nor did i find it that appealing or interesting.  if it hadn''t been so centered, i probably would have scored it a 5.  but, as it was, i didn''t see anything more to hold my interest.</td>', 'ok, when this popped up in the random photo thread, i thought i recognized it, but was looking at it as a standalone image (as opposed to a challenge entry).  my initial reaction was "interesting colors, but a little too in-your-face, without enough detail to be able to come to terms with the subject comfortably."  so, if that is what you were after, you succeeded.  if you just wanted to see how close in you could get and still have something in focus, you succeeded there, as well.  and if you were experimenting with color and bokeh, you also did well. as far as a challenge entry goes, i scored it a 4.  i didn''t think it met the challenge very well, nor did i find it that appealing or interesting.  if it hadn''t been so centered, i probably would have scored it a 5.  but, as it was, i didn''t see anything more to hold my interest.', '2005-05-05 08:44:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1363053, 169135, 1280, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!</td>', 'Fantastic!', '2005-05-05 12:08:39.000000', NULL, 0),
