(1371263, 171341, 27605, '<td valign="top">I agree with you,artvet, the frame looks great with this photo.  And while the sky and tree are both great, what I like best about your photo is... the fence!  Great shot, congrats on your high finish.</td>', 'I agree with you,artvet, the frame looks great with this photo.  And while the sky and tree are both great, what I like best about your photo is... the fence!  Great shot, congrats on your high finish.', '2005-05-08 15:05:54.000000', NULL, 0),
