(1372130, 169538, 23458, '<td valign="top">Hehehehe, I don''t have that lens - so the friendly competition won''t extend that far...<br/> <br/>Who cares about the challenge shoe horn - how good does the lack of shutter lag feel :)! The 4.7 is pretty clearly explicable by the fact that the only acceptable extreme sport here at dpc is motocross. I tried convincing my 8 year old foster brother to ride his bike off the roof so I could get a nice shot, but for some reason he wasn''t down with that.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-08 23:20:44.</i></td>', 'Hehehehe, I don''t have that lens - so the friendly competition won''t extend that far... Who cares about the challenge shoe horn - how good does the lack of shutter lag feel :)! The 4.7 is pretty clearly explicable by the fact that the only acceptable extreme sport here at dpc is motocross. I tried convincing my 8 year old foster brother to ride his bike off the roof so I could get a nice shot, but for some reason he wasn''t down with that.', '2005-05-09 00:20:26.000000', '2005-05-09 00:20:44.000000', 0),
