(1391218, 170617, 18219, '<td valign="top">you left a comment on my challenge entry a little while ago, so I thought I would return the favor on this picture!!!!!<br/>Anyway, I like this picture a lot.<br/>The flower seems too over exposed and the dirt around the flower looks like it has been freshly dug, I think that if the dirt was uniform it would have slightly more impact.<br/>The compocition is great though.<br/>Maybe you could try reshooting this, but just using some colored poster board as your background.<br/>Actually, that sounds like quite a good idea, I think I may try it.</td>', 'you left a comment on my challenge entry a little while ago, so I thought I would return the favor on this picture!!!!!Anyway, I like this picture a lot.The flower seems too over exposed and the dirt around the flower looks like it has been freshly dug, I think that if the dirt was uniform it would have slightly more impact.The compocition is great though.Maybe you could try reshooting this, but just using some colored poster board as your background.Actually, that sounds like quite a good idea, I think I may try it.', '2005-05-17 10:22:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1395094, 168963, 12962, '<td valign="top">I agree with most, this should have been in the top 10 especially if your main elements were placed to the right with more space for them to trot into.  A vertical crop may also work.  But it''s just gorgeous.  The three''s and below scores are just mean, I think.</td>', 'I agree with most, this should have been in the top 10 especially if your main elements were placed to the right with more space for them to trot into.  A vertical crop may also work.  But it''s just gorgeous.  The three''s and below scores are just mean, I think.', '2005-05-18 13:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
