(1397585, 169454, 34192, '<td valign="top">One thing that doesn''t get a lot of attention on DPC is balance.  This image has it, IMO. There is a triangle of subjects framed by balance blue water and sky.  The blue may be oversaturated to some but it helps hold the eye in the center of the image.  The wave is echoed by a streak of cloud, the tree is offset by the plane, the man pulls it all together.  I think this image is weighted well.  I believe this is one of those underrated images you find in every challenge.</td>', 'One thing that doesn''t get a lot of attention on DPC is balance.  This image has it, IMO. There is a triangle of subjects framed by balance blue water and sky.  The blue may be oversaturated to some but it helps hold the eye in the center of the image.  The wave is echoed by a streak of cloud, the tree is offset by the plane, the man pulls it all together.  I think this image is weighted well.  I believe this is one of those underrated images you find in every challenge.', '2005-05-19 08:28:37.000000', NULL, 0),
