(1631985, 170297, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  I remember this well from the challenge and scored it a 7.  Love the light on the ball - and am appreciative of the fact that you shared how you captured it!  :-)</td>', 'Very cool shot!  I remember this well from the challenge and scored it a 7.  Love the light on the ball - and am appreciative of the fact that you shared how you captured it!  :-)', '2005-08-22 15:47:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698376, 171315, 18738, '<td valign="top">Just to pick up on your description. A condom does not say ''safety''. Just because something is safe or enhances safety  does not mean it evokes a feeling of safety. For example an airbag is not something that will give you a feeling of security, whereas the smell of your mother''s perfume might.<br/> <br/>And for me the picture of the condom and the cigarettes take out any eroticism, sure condoms might be a necessary and important part of the erotic, but in themselves they are the opposite. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Just to pick up on your description. A condom does not say ''safety''. Just because something is safe or enhances safety  does not mean it evokes a feeling of safety. For example an airbag is not something that will give you a feeling of security, whereas the smell of your mother''s perfume might. And for me the picture of the condom and the cigarettes take out any eroticism, sure condoms might be a necessary and important part of the erotic, but in themselves they are the opposite.  ', '2005-09-12 10:10:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698415, 171315, 37215, '<td valign="top">Ignoring the challenge, I like the juxtaposition of the items and the fact it''s a female condom (isn''t it?) which makes it seem as if the woman involved is in control. Not sure on the focus here. Seems to me the focus is soft which is right for the rose but not for the ciggie packet . Personally I think the border is right for it but too heavy. <br/>A well composed and interesting shot, creative with great background and lighting.<br/>P</td>', 'Ignoring the challenge, I like the juxtaposition of the items and the fact it''s a female condom (isn''t it?) which makes it seem as if the woman involved is in control. Not sure on the focus here. Seems to me the focus is soft which is right for the rose but not for the ciggie packet . Personally I think the border is right for it but too heavy. A well composed and interesting shot, creative with great background and lighting.P', '2005-09-12 10:15:54.000000', NULL, 0),
