(2231017, 169561, 50075, '<td valign="top">Just cruising some portfolios and saw this. I like it''s simplicity. The yellow background is perfect for this. It is subdued just enough to compliment the yellow edges of the flower without competeing with it. Very well done.</td>', 'Just cruising some portfolios and saw this. I like it''s simplicity. The yellow background is perfect for this. It is subdued just enough to compliment the yellow edges of the flower without competeing with it. Very well done.', '2006-03-15 15:20:06.000000', NULL, 0),
